<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet (Word 4Z World)</book>
  <para style="h">Luk'as Dooshishiyo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Luk'as Dooshishiyo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk'.</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luk'as Dooshishiyo</para>
  <para style="mt">Luk'as Guut'tso</para>
  <para style="mt3">Nodoonz Iyesus Krstos Dooshishiyo</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">Luk'as guut'ts doo shishiyo Iyesusi b́ t'ints shin shin weetwe ett nebiyiwotsn b́ jango ay dúrosh jangiyetso Isra'eli kashitwoni ett bokotfere bo boteshts «Mesihiyo» mank'owere ash naar jamo «Kashiyitwo» b́ woto kits keewosha b́ tesh. Luk'as, Iyesusi «Tugretswotssh doo shishiyo b́ keewish» b́ nihoke wosheetso b́ woto manwere doo shishiyon ashuwotsatse fa'a gond keewo ay naarwotssh bits detstso b́ woto keewre. Luk'as doo shisiyotse bitsnor Iyesus weyi jango shino waa keewirwots tuwoki shinats k'ot'uwotsitsnat Iyesus daromaand tuwi jang keewirwots, k'otuwots s'uwoke eent bek'sht keewe geneúwi jangoni. Iyesus daromaand b́ tuwiyakon Krstani imnetiyo aak'o aaniyi bí aaytsok'o sheengsh keewirwo tarikiyo b́ wosheetsots fini mas'afotese guut'ts ashaann keewetso fa'e.</para>
  <para style="ip">Melakiwots duubo, Iyesus b́ shuwewor giz jinfwots amt bín bo s'iltsok'o keewiru tarikiyo, Iyesus na'or Ik' k'oni moomand bí amtsok'o, maac' k'ewts Semari jiro jangonat t'aft daatsets na'o jango Luk'as doo shishiyi mas'aaf mec'rotsna b́datsefo. B́ doo shishiy mec'rutse c'uushatse tuut c'uushats b́ borfetso een t'iwintson finetso Ik' k'oni jango, S'ayin shayiri jango, máátswots Iyesus finotse bodetsts boyokonat Ik'o ashna'i morrosh orowe b́ eti jangoni.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Kindo 1:1-4</para>
  <para style="io1">Gupfo Yohansnat Iyesusn shuweyi jango 1:5—2:52</para>
  <para style="io1">Gupfo Yohans fints fino 3:1-20</para>
  <para style="io1">Iyesus gupewonat b́ fadetsok'o 3:21—4:13</para>
  <para style="io1">Iyesus b́ fino Gelilitse dek'b́tuwo 4:14—9:50</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelil maantse tuut Iyerusalem maants 9:51—19:27</para>
  <para style="io1">Torbani s'uwatse Iyerusalemnat b gúúratse 19:28—23:56</para>
  <para style="io1">Doonzo k'irotse tuuwona, b́be'ewonat daromaand b́tuwon 24:1-53</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Shiimets Tewofloso!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">No dagotse k'aleets keewwotsi kishde'er kitsit tarikiyo haniye shin aywots guut'rnee. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Wosh han noosh beshitswots shin shinon teshts ááwon bek'tswotsnat b́ aap'tso nab́t teshtswotsiye. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Mank'owere taa shin shino tuzat jam keewo t'iwintsdek'at t s'iliyakoń b́ tarikiyo matsdek'at neesh t guut'etwok'o sheeng wotat taash b́ daatseyi. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Han tk'alwere ndants dano ar b́woto sheegshde dań ndek'isha etaatniye.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gupfo Yohans shuwetwok'o melakiyo Gebr'el shino b́ keewutsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1CH 24:10">1 Zen. 24:10</ref> </char>
    </note> Herods Yihud datsatse nugús wotat b́teshor, Aabiya kahni fini kayotse fin finirwotsitse Zekariyasi eteetso kahniya b́ tesh. Bíwere Aron naaratse shuwetsu Eelsabti eteets máátsu detsfe b́tesh. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Gitwotswere Ik'o shinatse kááwwotsi bo teshi, Doonzo alonat teron iko bo shapirawona Ik'i shinatse sheeng beya bobefoni bo teshi. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Elsabet' mahan b teshtsotse na'o deshatsno botesh, ando gitwotsu ay dek't gaawerwtskno bo tesh.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Manoor Zekariyas kahniwots jirwotsitse Ik'i mootse finosh b́ fini aawa b́tesh, mansha bí Ik'i shinatse b́ kahni fino b́finefera b́ tesh. <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Kahaniyots yoots bo k'alfok'ooń doonzo Ik' moots kindt it'ano s'uwiwosh bíats it'o keshb́wutsi. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Ik' mootsnowere it'ano s'uwiyewor, ash jamo úratse ned'de'rni Ik'o bok'onfo. <verse eid="LUK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Doonzo melakiyo it'an s'uwiyeyiru t'arap'ezoke k'aniweeron ned'irwo Zekariyas ats be'eeb́wtsi. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Zekariyas Ik'i melakiman b́bek'or tek'at shatb́wts. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Ernmó melakiyo bísh hank'owa bíet: «Zekariyaso! shatk'aye! Ik'o n k'ontso shishre, n máátsu Elsabet' nungush na'o neesh shuwitwaniye, b́ shútsono Yohansi err s'egetune. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>B́ shuwewono geneúwi eeno neesh wotituwe, aywotsu b́ shuwewon mank'o genee'úwitunee. <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 6:3">Taaw. 6:3</ref> </char></note> Bí doonzo shinatse een wotitwe, weyiniwon dutsets bironat k'osh mashit úsho úyatse, indu maac'otse b́befere S'ayn shayiron s'eenk wotitwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Bí Isra'el ashotse aywotsi bo Doonz Izar Izewer maants aniyituwe, <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAL 4:5-6">Mil. 4:5-6</ref> </char></note> Ari nebiyo Eliyas kok'o S'ayn shayironat angon wotaŕ nihwots nibo nana'o maants, aleraw ashuwots nibono kaawwots dan telofo maants aanitwe, ashaashwotsnowere doonzosh k'anbodek'etwok'o woshitwe.»<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Ernmó Zekariyas melakiwosh «Keewan arik b́ woto eegneya t daneti? Taawere gaawerwtserere, tmáátsunwere gawerwtserane» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DAN 8:16">Dan. 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:21">9:21</ref> </char>
    </note> Melakiyonwe hank'o ett bísh bí aani, «Taa Ik'o shinatse ned'efo Gebreel taane, doo shishiyan neesh tkeewitwok'o Ik'oke wosheyat waare. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Neemó bí aawo b́bodor wotitwo t keewts keewo amaneratsne, mansh neesh t keewts keew jaman wotar b́ s'eenfetso gidik' wotar s'k err nbeetesheti, noon keewono falatsne.»<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Manoor ash ashuwots Zekariysi bokotfera botesh, Ik'i mootse b́ ja'atsosh bo adi. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Zekariyas Ik' mootse b́ keshor ash ashuwotsnton keeweyo falratse b́ tesh, mansh bo Ik' mootse bek'o b́bek'tsok'oo danbok'ri, bí b́ kishon kitsfetstni boosh b́ daniyiri bako noon keewo falratse b́ tesh. <verse eid="LUK 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>B́fiino b́ s'uwi hakon Zekariyas b́ moo maants k'az bíami. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Muk'i b́teshihakon b́ máátsu Elsabet na'o maac'bwtsi, úts shashosh b moots ááshutsatni b tesh, hank'owo bi et, <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>«Doonzo keewi sheenghan taash k'alre, ashuwots dagotse t gac'ewo tiatse k'aaú dek't juu k'rere.»<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́ shuwetwok'o melakiyo Gbr'el b́ keewtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Elsabet bmac'ts shirtl shashon melakiyo Gebr'el Gelil datsatse fa'ú Naazreti eteef kituts Ik'oke b́ wosheyi. <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 1:18">Mat. 1:18</ref> </char></note> B́ woshewwere Dawit naar wottso Yosefi eteef ashosh wid'ets baarna'a s'eenúka b́ tesh, b shútsonwere Mariyami b tesh. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Melakiyonwere b maants waat, «Nee Ik'i s'aaton s'eentsune, jeeno neesh wotowe! doonzo neentoniye, [Nee máátswotsitse derek neene]» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Biwere melakiyo keew keewatse tuutson aydek'at tek'at, «Jam aatan awuk'o jam aate k'una?» etaat asaabbdek'i. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Melakiyonwere hank'o bish bíet, «Mariyame! Ik'i shinatse n baatsirwotse shatk'aye, <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Eshe! Na'o mac'ituune, nungush na'ono shuwiytuune, b́ shútsono Iyesusi etetune. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Bí were een wotitwe, jamoniyere damb bogo Ik'o naayiye eteetwe, doonzo Ik'o b́ nih Dawit naashi jooro imetuwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:32-33 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-13">2 Sam. 7:12-13</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 7:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa. 9:7</ref> </char></note> Isra'el ashaatsnowere dúre dúrosh naashitwe, b́ naashonwere s'uwo deshatse.»<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Mariyam melakiyosh «Taaho baarna'a s'eenu taanere, bere, hank'ó keewan aak'oneya woto b́faliti?» bi eti.<verse eid="LUK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Melakiyonúwere hank'o ett bíaany, «S'ayin shayiro ni ats weetuwe, jamoniyere damb bogts Ik'o angonwere neen gúúpetuwe, mansh niyatse shuwet na'o S'ayno wotitwe, Ik'o naayiye eteetwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Njaguu Elsabet dab mahani eteere beyat ja'at and b gaweriyakon nungush na'o maac' dek'raniye, b maac'ihakon and shirtl shasho bodrane. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:37</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Aze. 18:14</ref> </char></note> Ik'osh maawet keewo aaliye.»<verse eid="LUK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Maniyakon Mariyam, «Hamb! Taa doonzo gonú taane, taash niettsok'o wotowe» bieti. Manoor melakiyo biyoke k'az bí ami.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mariyam Elsabeti s'iilo bi amtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Manoor Mariyam gur báár datso Yihud datsomantse fa'a kitu maants kááron tuwat bi ami. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Zekariyas mootso kindat Elsabetsh jamo b imi. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Elsabet Mariyam bin jamo bi aator b k'aaro bshishtsok'oon b maac'itsi na'o t'oolo gedb́k'ri. Elsabetwere S'ayn shayiron s'eengutsat <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>B k'aaro eensh dek'at hank'o bi et, «Nee máátswotsitse derek neene, niyatse shuweetwonwe deereke. <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Tdoonz ind taan s'iilo b waan taash aak'o mangi eene, <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>N jamo t shishtsok'on manoor t maac'otse fa'a na'o gene'on t'oolere. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Doonzoke bish keewets aap'o b́s'eenetwotse nee amantsu aak'o deerek neene!»<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mariyam duubts udi duubo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:46-55 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1SA 2:1-10">1 Sam. 2:1-10</ref> </char>
    </note> Mariyam hank'owa bi et</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:46">«T kashu t doonzi úditwanee,<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>T shayiru t doonzn ti aton geneeúitwane,<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:48 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1SA 1:11">1 Sam. 1:11</ref> </char>
    </note> Ik'o taan ashitsi ashe dash gonú b́ s'iiltsotse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">Hambetse okoon shuwets jamo deretsuniye etetúne taasha,<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>Ik' kup'o een een keewwotsi taash k'alre.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">B́ shútsonwere S'ayine.<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>Ik'o bín shatirwotssh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">Bo Na'i na'osh b́ mhretiyo woshitwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>B́ kup' aaron bí ango kitsre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">Bog noona ett it'irwotsnowere bo tewnonton boon bad'ik'reree.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:52 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:11">Iyo. 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:19">12:19</ref> </char>
    </note> K'eeziru een eenwotsno bo naashi jooratse oorshre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">ernmó bo tooko dashan detsiru ashuwotsi mangon dambaan tizree.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>K'ak'tswotsno sheeng keewon worire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">Galetswotsnmó kishi baashon damik'rere.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54-55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54-55"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:54-55 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="GEN 17:7">Aze. 17:7</ref> </char>
    </note> Abrahamnat b́ naarwotssh dúre dúrosh b́ kitsts mheretiyonowere gawdek't,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54-55">B́ guutso Isra'eli tep'ree.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54-55">Manowere b́k'al shin no nihotssh b́ jangits keewo s'eentsoshe.»<verse eid="LUK 1:54-55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Mariyamwere Elsabetnton keez shashosh b́teshiyhakon b galomaants aanat k'azbiami.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gupfo Yohans shuwewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Elsabet b shuwi aawo b́bore nungush na'o shuubk'ri. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>B giyuwotsnat b jag jamwotswere doonzo bish mhetiyo b́ woshtso shisht binton bo geneúwi.<verse eid="LUK 1:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:59 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lew. 12:3</ref> </char>
    </note> Na'o b́ shuwetsi shmtl aawon, bín gof damiyewor b giyuwotsnat b jagwotsn kakweyat bo weyi, b́ nih shútson Zekariyasi err s'egetwok'o geyatni botesh, <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Indunmó «Mank'o woteratse, b́ shútso Yohansiye» bi eti.<verse eid="LUK 1:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Bowere bish «N jagotse shútsann s'eegetso konwor aalneya?» bo eti. <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Maniye okoon nihosh, «N naayi koni err s'egetwok'owe ngeyi?» ett kolon bo aati.<verse eid="LUK 1:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Zekariyasu bín guut'etuwo bísh bo imetuwok'o aatdek't «B́shutsoniye Yohansiye» ett b́ guut'i, jametswotsu keewmaanatse tuutson bo adi. <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Manoor Zekariyas albero bishwtsat bí eree noonkeewo b́fali, Ik'o údo dek'b́tuwi. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Manatse tuutson bogiyi jametswots shatoon tek'bowtsi, keewman gúrmanatsi Yhud dats jamwotsatse shiyeb́wtsi. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Keewhan shishits jamwots, «Na'i marmat'an eeg wotishek'uwa?» ett bo atsatseyo bo aatefere botesh. Han b́wotiye Ik' kisho arikon bínton wotat bín b́tep'tsoshe.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zekariyas bek'on b́ keewtso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Na'i marmat'o nih Zekariyas S'ayin shayiron s'eenwtsat hank'o ett bek'on b́keewi,<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>«Bí ashuwotsi mheretiyon waa b́s'iltsonat b́ kashitsotse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">Isra'elko Izar Izewer, doonzosh údo wotowe!<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>B́guutso Dawit naarotse kaashiyts kup'o noosh tuuzre,<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>Yoots shin dúrtson tuuzt b́ teshts S'ayin nebiyiwots noonon b́keewtsok'on,<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>B́ kashiwonwere no balangarwotsnat noon shit'iru jamwots kishotsene,<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Han b́ k'alwere nonihotssh mhretiyo b́ woshtsok'o</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:72">B́keewts S'ayn taaro s'eentsosh gawdek'tniyee.<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>Taaranowere, taaron b́ ím nonih Abramsha b́teshi.<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>B́ jangitsonwere no t'alatwots kishotse nas'o keer,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">Shatalon bísh no finishe,<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>Mank'o beyi dúr jamon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">Ik'ishinatse S'ayinonat kááwon beyo nofalitwok'owe.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:76 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mil. 3:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Aaninu nee na'i marmat'ono, jamoniyere danb eents Ik'ko bek'etsoniye neene eteetwe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">B́werindo k'aniyosh doonzoshinats beshar ametunee<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>Doononwere bo morrosh boosh oorowe err</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">Kashosh wotit dano boosh imetwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Noko Izar Izewer maac' k'ewtsonat maac' nefon b́wottsotse bín kashet shááno danmbane noosh b́ shanetwok'o woshitwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>Manwere t'aluwonat k'iri c'ishotse fa'a jamwotssh shaanitwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">No shaaw shaawonowere jeeni weromants jishitwe.»<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Na'onu eenb́wtsi, shayironowere kup'b́wutsi, Isra'el ash jamosh b́ be'efetsosh worwotse b́beeyi.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Krstos shuwewo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat. 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Man dúr Rom dats jami shirotse keeweyat beyiru ash jamwots bo taawetwok'o Rom nugúso Awugst'os bí azazi. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Shints ash taawman taawewor Soriyi dats keewirwo K'ereniwosi b́tesh. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Mansh asho ik ikon b́shútso guut'eyish b́ shuwets dats datsomand bo amfera boteshi.<verse eid="LUK 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Yosefwere b́ shuwewon Dawit naar b́teshtsotse Gelil datsatse fa'a Nazret kitutse tuut Yihud datsatse fa'a Dawit kitu Betelihem maants bíami, <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>Guut'ewosh bíamu mac'at teshtsu b́wid'tsu Mariyamntona b́ tesh. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Betelihem kitutse bobefere Mariyam shuwi aawo bodb́wtsi. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Manoknowere b k'aab́ na'o shuuk'rat bín eret tahon kaapbk'ri, ibi k'eefoke k'ewoko daatso bok'aztsotse minz kas'otse minzwots eeg eeg bomaf marats k'eez b́k'ri.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Giz jinfwotsnat melakiyotsn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Manoknowere, t'ú gizi s'een kotfetst sisatse k'eyiru giz jinfwots fa'ano bo tesh. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Mann, doonzo melakiyo boats be'eb́wtsi, Doonzo mangi shááno bogúúratse c'eesh b́k'ri, boowere ayidek'at shatbowtsi, <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Melakiwonmó hank'owa boosh bíet «Shat k'ayere! ash jamosh geneúi een wotitwo keewi sheengo itsh dek'at waare, <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Hamb! Hambetse Dawit kituts kashitso itsh shuwere, bíwere doonzo Krestosiye. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Haniye itsh milikit wotitwe, bín na'a erii tahotse kaapk'rets na'o gizwots kas'otse gizo eeg eeg maaf maratse b́ k'eefere daatsitute.»<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Dingaton darotsi melaki ayuwots, melkimanton ikwotat be'e bowutsi, Ik'ono údfetst́,<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>«Darotse Ik'osh mango wotowe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">Datsno Ik'o b́shunts ash jamwotssh jeeno wotowe!» bo etfera botesh.<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Melakiyo boatse k'aleyat daromaants k'az bokeshiyakon giz jinirwots bo atsatseyo «Beré Betelihem maants amone, and wottsonat Ik'o noosh bek'sht b́kitsts keewo s'iilone» bo et.<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Kááron amt Marymnat Yosefn daats bodek'i, na'i marmat'onwere gizi kas'otse gizwots bítse eeg eeg maaf maratse b́ k'eefere bobek'i. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Na'i marmat'onowere bobek'iyakon b́ jango Ik'i melakiyo boosh b́ keewtso keewo dek botuwi. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Keewman shishits jamwots giz jinfwots boosh bokeewts keewatse tuutson bo adi. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Maryammó, keew jaman b nibots detsdek'atni b asaabefo btesh. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Giz jinirumanotsu, jam keewo melakiyo boosh b́ ettsok'o wotat bí eree bobek'tsonat boshishtsosh, Ik'o mangifetst bín údfetst, bo beyok k'az bo aani.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus shútso kishetsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lew. 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:31">Luk'. 1:31</ref> </char>
    </note> Shimt aawo b́beshihakon na'o gof damiyoke, b́ shúútso «Iyesusi» ett s'egee. Hanwere b́ maac'eeftse shino melakiyo b́kishts shútsoni b́tesh.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:22-24 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:6-8">Lew. 12:6-8</ref> </char>
    </note> Nemok'on, s'ayintsi teri aawo bodb́wts, mann Maryamnat Yosefn na'i marmat'o doonzo shinats t'intsosh Iyerusalem maants dek't bo ami. <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Kesh. 13:2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12">12</ref> </char></note> Han bok'alwere doonzo kitsts nemok'on «Nungush na'a wotts k'aab́ jamo doonzosh, galdek' imeke b́ wotiti» eteets tzaziyok'on guut'etsone. <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Mank'o doonzo nemon «Git kurkundwotsi wee git eejiyi nana'uwotsi woshosh t'intso geyife» eteets alo fa'e b́tesh.<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Manoor Iyerusalemitse Sm'oni eteef ash iko fa'e b́tesh, bíwere b́kasho Ik'osh imk kááw asha b́ teshi, Isra'elsh weet kashiyono b́ kotiri b́ tesh. S'ayin Shayironwere bí atsatsa b́ tesh. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Bí doonzo mesihiyo b́be'aawo b́ k'irrawok'o S'ayin shayiro shaani dek't kitsre b́ tesh. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Manots aawots S'ayin shayiro b́gitsotse bín b́tuuzre Ik'i moo maants bíami, Yosefnat Mariyamwere bo nemok'on danetso na'osh finosh na'o dek't Ik' moots bo kindor <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Sim'on na'i marmat'o k'a'údek't erdekt, Ik'o údefetst hank'o bíet,<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>«Doonzono! hamb, jangiyat taash nimtso s'eenwtsere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">Eshe haniye hakon taan nguutso jeenon k'aaúde'e.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>N kashiyo ti aawon bek're,<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>Bíwere ash jami shinatse nk'anitsoniye,<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>Bíwere Ik' ash woteraw ashuwotssh aro kish kitsit shaano wotitwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">N ashuwotssh Isra'elsh mango wottsoniye.»<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Yosefnat Mariyamnowere na'o jangosh keewets jamatse tuutson ada boadfoni. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Sim'on boon b́deeriyhakon bítsnor na'i marmat'o ind Mariyamsh hank'owa bí et, «Hambe! na'i marmat'an Isra'elitse ayuwotssh t'afosh, ayuwotssh kashi jango wotitwe, bíwere ayuwots b́keewo k'ew dek'o bok'azetwoniye milikit wotitwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>Mannowere aywots nibotse fa'a aashts asaabiyo keer be'etwe, nnibonowere shiyani shiko kap'de beshitwe.»<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Mank'o manoor Aser naar wotts Fanue'l ní Hanayi eteetsu bek'etsu fa'a b tesh. Ayi dekat gawerwtsk máátsi b tesh, b kenihnton shawat nato b beyihako keniho k'irb́wtsi, <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>Maniyehakon b nato habi gitonat awd nato b́ wotefetsosh Ik' mootse b orerawon s'oomiyon, Ik' k'onon, aawonat t'úwon Ik'osha bfinefera b tesh. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Manoor biwere waat́ doonzo údo dek'btwi, na'i marmat'o jangosho Iyerusalem bín kashosh jangat kotirú jamwotssh bkeewufo.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nazret maants bo aantsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:39 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 2:23">Mat. 2:23</ref> </char>
    </note> Doonzo nemotse finef jamo fin bok'rihakon Gelil datsatse daatseyiru bo beyiru bo kitu Nazret maants k'az bo aani. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Na'i marmat'onwere eenono eenfetst kup'efere bí ami, danonowere s'eenḱ wotb́wtsi, Ik'i s'atonwere bíntoni b́tesh.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Ik'i mootse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:41 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Kesh. 12:1-27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-8">Iwi. 16:1-8</ref> </char>
    </note> Yosefnat Mariyamn worwot worwoton fazigi baaliyi aawor Iyerusalem maantsan bo amfo bo tesh. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Iyesus tatse git nat wotbwtstsok'on bo nemok'on baaliman mangiyosh bo ami. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Baaliyono ish bobazihakon bo bomoo maants bo aanor Iyesus Iyerusalemits oorb́wts, Yosefnat Mariyamnmó manoke b́ ooro danatsno botesh. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>Weratse sha'irwotsnton towat bí amiruwok'o boosh bí arere, ik aawjini sha'o sha'eron bo jini, maniye il bojag jamoknat bodants ash jamoke geyo dek' botuu. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Ernmó daatso bo maawutsotse geefere Iyerusalem maants bo aani. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Keez aawoniye okoon Ik' mootse daatsbodeki, manokno aaydekt dantswots dagotse bedek't bo keewirwo k'ebfetst bosho aato b́t'intsfera b́ tesh. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>B́ keew k'ebts jamwots b́ t'iwintsirwok'onat boosh bíanirwok'o bek't bo adifera bo tesh. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Yosefnat Mariyam bín Ik' mootse bobek'tsok'on ada bo adi, manoor indu, «Tnaayo eegishe hank'o taan nk'ali? N nihnat taan kic'at neen no geefera noteshi» bi et.<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Iyesuswere «Eegoshe taan it geyi? taa t nih mootse woto taash b́ geyitwok'o danatsteya?» bí eti. <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Boomó bí b́ keewtsman t'iwintsratsno.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Maniye il Iyesus Nazret maants bonton bíami, booshowere alya bí alefoni, b́ indwere keew jaman b nibotsa b detsfo. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:52 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 2:26">1 Sam. 2:26</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:2">Ari. 3:2</ref> </char></note> Iyesus Ik'onat ash shinatse shuneek wotat, dan teleefonat need'on eenfere bí amfo.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Gupfo Yohans nabtso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat. 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar. 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoh. 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Rom nugús wottso T'ibariyos b́naashtsi tatse útsl naton P'ent'os P'ilat'os Yihud datso k'eezfoni b́tesh, Herodis Galil dats keweefoni b́ tesh, Mank'o bí eshu Filatp'os It'uriyasnat T'rakonidosi kewútso, Lisaniyosm Abilenensi kewtsoni botesh, <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Hananat K'eyafwere kahniya bo tesh, manoor Zekariyas naay Yohans worwotse b́befere, Ik'i aap'o b́ maants b́ waa. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Mansh Yohans, Yordanos foki gúúratse fa'a daats jamwotsatse gúúrefetst «It fints morrosh orowe eto it daatsish it fints morrosh naandrone err gupewere,» et fetstni b́daniyfo. <verse eid="LUK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Han b́wotwere nebiyo Isayas Yohans jangosh shin shin hank'o ett b́ guut'tsok'on</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">Eshe han woruwotse hank'o etfere kuhiru asho k'aaroniye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">«Doonzo werindone k'aniwere!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">B́ fokonowere kaatswere!<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Dats k'ool jamonowere manutsider s'entsewe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">Guronat daaw jamonwere dashan t'ine!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">K'uur werindonwere kawowe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">Kaam werindonwere manutsowee!<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Ash jamonwere Ik'i kashiyo be'e!»<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat. 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref> </char>
    </note> Gupeyosh b́ maants waats ay ashosh Yohans hank'owa bí etfo «It merziyets dawnzi nananotso! Weyiru Ik'i fayotse itkeshtwok'o kone itsh keewi? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Yoh. 8:33</ref> </char></note> Abraham nana'uwots noone err it nibotse it'o k'ayr, naandrone it ettsok'o kitsit fino finore. Ik'o shútsanotsitse Abrahamsh nana'o tuuzo b́falitwok'o itsh keewirwe. <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Mat. 7:19</ref> </char></note> And shakurtso mitwots shirotse k'ut'osh k'anutsere. Mansha sheeng shuu shuraw mit jamo k'ut'etwe tawotsowere juwetwe.»<verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Ash jamonwere «Beree eeg k'alwonowa?» ett Yohansi bo aati.<verse eid="LUK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Bíwere, «Git tah detstso iko deshawosh ime, mísh detstsonwere deshawosh kayiwee,» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LUK 7:29">Luk'. 7:29</ref> </char>
    </note> T'ilish kakufwotswere gupeyosh bíyok waat «Danifono! noowere eeg k'alwono?» ett bo aati.<verse eid="LUK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Bíwere, «Nemon azazetsoniyere bogeshde aatk'ayere,» b́ eti.<verse eid="LUK 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Kes'kes'fwots waat, «Noo eshe eeg k'aluwono?» bo eti. Bíwere «Ash gizo weeralo bi'r dek'k'ayere, konnor kooton s'aamik'ayree, it took damozo itsh boree,» bí eti.<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Man dúr ash jamo Mesihiyo woo jangatni bokotfere bo tesh, Mansh Yonassh «Ashaan mesihiyo wotifa k'úwa?» etfets bo nibotse bo asaabi. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Yohansmó jamwotssh hank'owa bí et, «Taa itn aatson gupetwe, ernmó k'osho taayere k'up'o weetwe, taa b́ c'aami tipi joko bitsosh dab boratse, bí S'ayin shayiri tawon itn gupetwe. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Bí búts úratse maayo buuyotse s'ayintsosh k'orbiyo b́ kishats detsdek're, b́ s'ayintsiyakon maay s'ayino t'iwots gaas'etwee, buuyonmo tahra tawon mits k'ritwe.» <verse eid="LUK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Mank'o ash ashosh k'osh k'osh werindon izfetst sheeng keew man bo waazots b́ betsfera b́ tesh. <verse eid="LUK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Gelil datso k'eezfo Herodismó bí eshu máátsu Herodiyadin b́ dek'tsonat k'osh k'osh gond finwotsi b́ fintsotse bín b́fayi. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19-20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 6:17-18">Mat. 6:17-18</ref> </char></note> Herods b́ gondats gondo dabt Yohansi tipi moots kindsh b́k'ri.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusi gupetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat. 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mar. 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Ash jamo b́ gupehakon Iyesus b́ gupeyi, bí Ik' k'onoke b́ befere daro k'esheeb́wtsi. <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Aze. 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Dub. 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa. 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat. 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar. 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Luk'. 9:35</ref> </char></note> S'ayin shayironwere eerkundo araat bíatsats b́ oot'i. Manoor «Nee tshunts taash shune naayo neene, neen geneúwitwe» etiru k'aaro darotse b́weyi.<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Krstos shuweyi s'ap'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat. 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Iyesus daniyo dek' b́tuwor, b́ nato shash natok'oyi b́tesh, ash jamosh Iyesus Yosef naayi bíarefo, manwere Yosef Eeli naayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>Eeli Mati naayi, Mati Lewi naayi, Lewi Milki naayi, Milki Yona naayi, Yona Yosef naayi <verse eid="LUK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>Yosef Matatiyu naayi, Matatiyu Amos' naayi, Amos' Nahom naayi, Nahom Eslim naayi, Eslim Nage naayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>Nage Maa'at naayi, Maa'at Matatiyu naayi, Matatiyu Semeyi naayi, Smeyi Yosef naayi, Yosef Yoda naayi <verse eid="LUK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>Yodaw Yonan naayi, Yonanu Resa naayi, Resa Zerubabel naayi, Zerubabel Selatiyal naayi, Selatiyal Neri naayi <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>Neri Milki naayi, Milki Hady Naayi, Hady K'osam naayi, K'osam Elmodam naayi, Elmodem, Erm. naayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>Erm. Yose' naayi, Yose' Elezer naayi, Eliezer Yoram naayi, Yoram Mat'at naayi, Mat'at Lewi naayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>Lwi Simon naayi, Simon Yihud naayi, Yihud Yosef naayi, Yosef Yonan naayi, Yonan Eliyak'em naayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>Eliyak'em Melya naayi, Melya Maniyan naayi, Mayinan Mat'at naayi, Mat'at Natan naayi, Natan Dawit naayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>Dawit Isey naayi, Isey Iyobed naayi, Iyobed Boez naayi, Boez Selemon naayi, Selemon Ne'ason naayi <verse eid="LUK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>Ne'ason Aminadab naayi, Aminadab Ram naayi, Ram Arniy naayi, Arniy Hes'eron naayi, Hes'eron Fares naayi, Fares Yihud naayi, Yihud Yak'ob naayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>Yak'b Yisehak' naayi, Yishak' Abraham naayi, Abraham Taraá naayi, Taraá Nakor naayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>Nakor Serug naayi, Serug Reúú naayi, Reúú Feleg naayi, Feleg Eber naayi, Eber Shelah naayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>Shelah K'ayin naayi, K'aynu Arfaksd naayi, Arfaksd Sem naayi, Sem Noh naayi, Noh Lameh naayi <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>Lameh Matusal naayi, Matusal Henok naayi, Henok Yared naayi, Yared Melal'el naayi, Melal'el K'ayenan naayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>K'ayenan Henos naayi, Henos Set naayi, Set Adam naayi, Adam Ik'o naayiye eta boetfo.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesusatse fadetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat. 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mar. 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Iyesus S'ayin shayiron s'eengutsat Yordanos fokotse aanat b́weyi, maniyere hakon S'ayin Shayiron jisheyat woruwo maants k'azbíami. <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>Manoke hab́ aawosh diyablos bín b́fadfera b́ teshi, aawmanotsitse eegor b́ marawotse b́ s'uwi aawatse k'ak'b́wtsi.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Diabloswere Iyesusi «Ik'o naay neena wotiyal aab shúts han mish wotowe err azazowe!» bíet.<verse eid="LUK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DEU 8:3">Iwi. 8:3</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesuswere «Asho mish mec'ron beeratse ett guut'ere» ett bísh bí aani.<verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Maniyehakon diyabilos Iyesun dambaan tuuts beyokok kishdk't dats jik'atse beyiru naash jamwotsi iknun kitsb́k'ri. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>«Mangts al jamannat mang jamon neesh imetwe, jaman taash imek b́wottsotse t shuntsosh imo falfe, <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Mansh nee taash n sagadiyal jaman nik wotitwe,» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LUK 6:13">6:13</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesuswere, «N doonzi Izar Izewer s'uzsh sagadowe! B́ s'uznowere Ik'iwe, ett guut'ere» et bísh bí aani.<verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Maniyehakon Diyablos Iyesusi Iyerusalem maants dek' bí'ami, Ik' maa tookats kede'́er b́ ned'itwok'o k'alt hank'o bísh bí et, «Arikon nee Ik'o naay neena wotiyal, aab hanatse dashan t'olar ood'e, <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Dub. 91:11</ref> </char></note> ‹Neen bokotetwok'o b́melakiyo azazitwe, <verse eid="LUK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 91:12">Dub. 91:12</ref> </char></note> N tufonowere shútso b́jod'awok'o, bokishon te'úde neen oriy dek'etúne.› ett guut'ere» bí et. <verse eid="LUK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Iwi. 6:16</ref> </char></note> Iyesuswere, «‹N Ik'o doonzone fadk'aye› et guut'ere,» ett bí aani.<verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Diyblos Iyesusi fado bí ishiyehakon manorish bín k'azk'rat bíami.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́ danyi fino Geliln dek' b́ tuutsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat. 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mar. 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Iyesuswere S'ayn shayiri angon s'eenwtsat Gelil maants k'az bí'aani, b́ shúútsi eenonwere b́ gúúratse fa'a dats jamwotsatse shiye b́wutsi. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni mootse boon b́ danifoni, únetswotswere b́ daniy manatse tuutson bín bo údi.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Naazretn bíats bodts k'efo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat. 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mar. 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Maniyere il Iyesus b́ eents datsats Nazret maants bíami, b́ k'alfok'owere sanbati aawon ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni moots b́ kindi, nababosho b́tuwi, <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Nebiyo Isayas mas'aafo bísh imeyi, mas'afmano b́ jargtsok'on, hank'o ett guut'etso beewoko daatsb́dek'i,<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>«Doonzo shayiri S'ayno ti atse b́faoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">Doo shishiyo t'owwotssh tshishiytwok'o taan woshere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Tipeetswots bo bishitwok'o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">Dogwots bobek'etwok'o, kuhar t keewish er</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">Kic'iyetswtswots bo kic'otse boon t kishitwok'o taan woshere,<verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:18-19 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Isa. 61:1-2</ref> </char>
    </note> Mank'o doonzo ash jamo bín b́kashitwo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:19">s'aati dúronowere t daniytwok'o taan woshere.»<verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Iyesuswe mas'aafo k'oddekt ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni mootse wosheyirwosh imk'rat be b́wtsi, ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni mootse fa'a jamo b́maand aanat t'iwints dek't bín s'iilo dek't botuwi. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Bíwere «Hamb! and nababere it shishts S'ayn mas'afatsi aap'o s'een wutsere» bí eti.<verse eid="LUK 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>B́ jangosh jamwotswere sheenga bo keewfo, b́ keewiru s'aaton s'eents keewmaanatse tuutson adt «Han Yosef naayiyoshna?» bo et. <verse eid="LUK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Iyesuswere boosh hank'o bí et, «Nee hakimiyono, aab n tooko kashiwe, etirwo jewron keewetso tiats it keewituwok'o danfee, mank'o ‹K'frnahomn k'alrne boere noshishts jamo, hanoke ndatsatse k'alwe› etetute tasha. <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Yoh. 4:44</ref> </char></note> Arikoniye itsh tkeewiri, nebiyiyo b́ dats ashuwotsoke mangrakee.<verse eid="LUK 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1KI 17:8-16">1 Naash. 17:8-16</ref> </char>
    </note> «K'ewere ariko itsh keewna, Nebiyo Eliyas dúr keez natonat shirt shashosh awusho bútso b́k'aztsotse dats jamatse k'ak'o kup'atni b́ teshi, Manoor Isra'el datsatse bo kenih k'irts mááts ayuwots fa'ano botesh. <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>Eliyasmó, Sidon datson Serap'ta eteets galutse fa'a bkenih k'irts mááts iku s'uzoka wosheyi bako k'osho konokor wosheratse. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">2 Naash. 5:1-14</ref> </char></note> Mank'o nebiyiyo Elsa'a dúr ay een shod detstswots Isra'el datsatse fa'ano botesh, ernmó Soryi datstso N'imaniye okoon boyitse iko dab s'ayinatse.»<verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Ayhudiyots Ik' k'oni mootsno fa'awotsitse jamwots han boshishtsok'on ayidek' bofayi. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Tuutnwere Iyesusi geetsdek't kitoniyere ur kish bok'ri, gohots gfnide'e juk'rosh bokitu biageets gohi gúúrats dek'bokeshi. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Bímó bodagotse beshat k'az bíami.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kim shayiro bín s'eents asho b́ kashtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mar. 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Maniyere il, Iyesus Galil datsatse fa'a kitu K'frnahom maants bíam, manokno ash asho sanbati aawon b́ daniyfoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 7:28-29">Mat. 7:28-29</ref> </char></note> B́ keewiru keewonúwere alon s'eenk b́wottsotse jamwots b́ daniyatse tuutson ada bo adfo botesh. <verse eid="LUK 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Manokno ayhudiyots Ik' k'oni mootse kim shayiron s'eents asho fa'e b́tesh, bíwere k'aari eenon hank'o etni b́ kuh. <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>«Nazrettso Iyesuso aage! Nee nooke eeg kis'e n detsi? Noon t'afiyosh wafi? Nee koni nwoto taa danfee, nee Ik'oko S'ayino neene.»<verse eid="LUK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Iyesuswere kim shayirmansh, «S'k err bíatsotse keye!» ett b́ fay, Kim shayirmanwere ash jami shinatse ashman dikdek't eegor bín b́k'alrawon k'az b́keshi.<verse eid="LUK 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Jamwots adt bo atsatseyosh, «Han aak'o aap'e? Kim shayironowere alonat angnon b́ azaziri, boowere bísh aleyat bo keshiri,» boatsatsewosh bo etfera botesh. <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Iyesus shútsonwere gúúrmanoki dats jamwotsatse shisheye b́wutsi.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus shodets ayuwotsi b́ kashitsok'wo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat. 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mar. 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Iyesuswere ayhudiyots Ik' k'oni mootse kesht Simon moo maants k'azbíami. Manokno Sim'on awu ay dek'at bi atso k'es't bí'ere shodat bk'eyir, mansh bin b́kashitwok'o Iyesusi bok'oni. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Iyesuswere bmandan t'int́ bganok need'dek't biatsi weshman b́ fakshitwok'o bí hadi, bi atsi k'es'manwere fakshb́k'r, manooro tuwat boon ibiyo dekbtwi. <verse eid="LUK 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Aawu bkindor ash ashuwots ayi naari shodon boshirotse deshets shodets jamwotsi Iyesus maants dek' bowaa, bí were ik ikon boats kisho gedt b́ kashiyi. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Foerawwotswere «Nee Ik'o naay neene!» et fetst kuhefetst ay ashuwotsi faksht bokeshi, bíwere Mesihiyo b́ woto dandek'rno bo tesh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">Iyesusmó b́ jangosh eegoru bo keewawok'o fayatni b́bazi.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Geliln b́ daniyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat. 4:23-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mar. 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Datso gatsb́wtstsok'on Iyesus manoke kesht ash aaloke dats baashok k'azbiam, ash ashuwotswere bín geyokna bo tesh, daats bodek'tsok'ono «Noon k'ay amk'aye» ett bok'oni. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Bímó «Taa twoshe hansh b́ wottsotse k'osh kitwotsits amr Ik'i mengst doo shish keewo taan geyife,» bí eti.<verse eid="LUK 4:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Mansha Yhudn fa'a ayhudiyots Ik' k'oni maa jamwotsitse gúúrat b́ nabfoni.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́ danif shintswotsi b́ s'eegtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat. 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar. 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Ik aaw Iyesus Genseret' aats k'ari gúratse need' dek't b́ befere ay ashuwots b́ maants t'int Ik'i aap'tso k'ebosh bo gifniyefere bo teshi. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Bí aats k'ari gúrats t'iindek't need'iru jelb gitwotsi bek'b́k'ri, mus' detsirwotsmó jelbwotsitse kesht bo mus'i kambwotsi bo mashfera botesh. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1-3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 13:1-2">Mat. 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:9-10">Mar. 3:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1">4:1</ref> </char></note> Iyesus jelbwotsitsi iku, Simoonk wottsuts b́ kindi. Simonshowere «Jelbani datsatse aats k'aromaants aab taash t'intswe» bí et. Maniye okoon jelbú'ats bedek't ash asho b́ daniyiri b́ tesh.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>B́ keewrwo b́ ishyakon Sim'onsh, «Jelbu ay dek't k'arts aats k'aromaants wokide'er neenat n tohuwotsn mus' detsosh juwore,» b́ et.<verse eid="LUK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JHN 21:3">Yoh. 21:3</ref> </char>
    </note> Sim'onwere «Danifono! t'ú jamo maawron gatsaat eegor deshatsone, nee ni'etihakonmó, hambe! mus'i kambo shap'etwone,» bí et. <verse eid="LUK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 21:6">21:6</ref> </char></note> Mus'i kambman bo shap'tsok'on kambo b́ gad'efetso weeralo ayts mus'o detsbodek'i. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Mansh k'osh jelbutse fa'a bo tohuwotsi kolon waar boosh geetso bo dabitwok'o bo s'eeǵ, boowere waat git jelbuwots limosh muk'i boborfetsosh mus'on s'eents bok'r. <verse eid="LUK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Simon P'et'ros man bek'b́k'rtsok'on Iyesus shinats tuk'umalgutsat, «Doonzono, Taa morretsk t wottsotse t maants t'ink'aye!» bí et. <verse eid="LUK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Han bíettsonwere bínat bínton teshts b́ tohjamwots bo detsts mus'i aytsatse tuutson ayidek't adt boteshtsotsna. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Mank'o Sim'on tooh wottswots Zebdiwos nanawots Yak'obnat Yohansń adtni botesh. Iyesus Simonsh «Shenono shatk'aye, Haniyehakon ash detsetwo wotitune» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Bowere jelbuwotsi aats gúúrats bot'intsi hakon jam keewo k'azk'rat Iyesus shuuts shoydek't botuwi.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus eenshodets asho b́ s'ayintstsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat. 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mar. 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Ik aaw Iyesus kit ikutse b́befere bíatso een shodon detsetso, eenshodonwere bí ats jamats keshutstso ash iko b́ maants b́ waa, Iyesusi b́ bek'ktsok'on b́ baron datsats gúp'gup'dek't t doonzo «Ni eekiyal taan s'ayintso falfne,» et bín b́ k'oni.<verse eid="LUK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Iyesuswere b́ kisho jargdek' bín shuu'at «Eekere! s'ayine!» bí et. Ashmanwere manoor b́ een shodatse s'ayin b́wutsi. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lew. 14:1-32</ref> </char></note> Manats dabt hank'o ett bí azazi «Keewan konshor nkewrawok'owa, ernmó niamtsok'on n tooko kahniwotssh kitswe, ash jamosh gaw b́wotitwok'owa n s'ayintsi jango Muse b́ azaztso woshoono t'intswe.»<verse eid="LUK 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Iyesus shútso iki k'oshortsoniyere bogo shiye b́guuts, ay ashuwotswere b́keewo k'ebonat boshodotse kashosh geeyat bo kakuwefo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Bímó ash aalok k'ayamrni Ik'o b́ k'onfo.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ash duro b́ kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat. 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mar. 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Ik aaw Iyesus daniyoke b́befere ferisawi eteetswotsnat Muse nemo danifwotsn b́ganoke bedek'tni bo tesh, bo Gelilnat Yihud gál jamotse Iyerusalem kitotsnowere watswotsu fa'ano botesh. Iyesus shodetswotsi b́ kashiru doonzo ango bíntoni b́tesh. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Ash dúr iko es'oń kur dek'ts ash ashuwots Iyesusmaants dek't bowaa, Iyesus bítse b́ beyiru moots kindsh de'er b́shinats beezo geyatni bo tesh, <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Ernmó asho bí'aytsatse tuutson durman moots kindsho bomaaw, mansh máá tookats dek' bokesh, máá tokono wogdek't máá maac'ots bí'es'onton Iyesus shinats orshdek't gedebok'ri. <verse eid="LUK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Iyesuswere bo aman amano b́bek'tsok'on durosh, «Ashono neena! n morro niatse sholbazere,» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Nem danifuwotsnat ferisawino etefwotsn «Kone bíwo Ik'o c'ashirwani? Ash morro oorowe etosh falitwo Ik'oniye okoon k'osho kone fa'oni?» ett bo gitsotse bo gawfera botesh.<verse eid="LUK 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Iyesuswere bo bogawirman dank'rat boosh hank'o bíet, «It nibotse eegoshe hank'o it gawiri? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>B́woteferemó ‹N morro neesh oorowe› etonat, ‹Tuur amee!› etotse aaw ketefa? <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Ernmó ash na'o datsatse morro oorowe etosh alo b́detstsok'o dano itsh geyife» ett ash durmansh, «Ashono neena tuuwe, ni es'o kur de'er n galomand amee!» bí eti.<verse eid="LUK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Dúronwere manoor ash ashuwots shinatse tuut, bíats k'eedek't b́teshts es'o kurdek't, Ik'o údefere b́ galomand bí ami. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Manoke fa'a ash jamwotswere ayidek't adfetst, shatoon «Hambets adits keewo bek'rone,» etfetst Ik'o bo údi.<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Matiwosi eteetso Lewi b́ s'egtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat. 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mar. 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Maniyere il Iyesus manoke kesht bíamfere Lewi eteetso t'ilish ko'ifo t'ilish b́dek'foke b́befere bek'krat «T shuutso wowe» bí et. <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Lewi were jobk' ett jamó k'azk'rat b́ shuutso bíami.<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Maniye il Lewi b́mootse Iyesus mangosha ett een wotts móónat úshon k'aniyi b́k'ri, b́ k'anits móónat úshono t'ilish kakuf ayuwotsnat k'oshwotsu ay ash ashuwotsu datseyatni botesh. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 15:1-2">Luk'. 15:1-2</ref> </char></note> Ferisawi eteefwotsnat bo jir wotts nem danifwots «T'ilish ko'ifwotsntonat morrotswotsnton maat b́ úshiri eegoshe?» ett Iyesus danifuwots aats bo mumund.<verse eid="LUK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Iyesus hank'o et boosh bí'anyi, «Shodtswotssha bako jeenwotssh atetso geyiratse, <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Taa t wáá morretswots naandrone bo etetwok'o s'eegosha bako kááwwotsi s'egoshaliye.»<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'oomi jangosh aatets aato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat. 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mar. 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Ik ik ashuwots Iyesussh, «Yohansnat ferisawiwotsn bo danifwots ayoto s'oomefno, Ik'ono k'onfnere, n danifwots jam aawo máát bo'úshir eegoshe?» ett bín boaati.<verse eid="LUK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Iyesuswere hank'o ett boosh bí aani, «Guuyo bonton b́befere guuy jishfwots bo s'oomo boosh geyitwe etatnya it gawiri? <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Ernmó guuyo booke k'a'údek'et aawo weetwe, manoor s'oomitúne.»<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Manatse tuut Iyesus jewrdek' boosh ik keewo b́keewi, «Shemi handri but'o shemi nataats shipfo konwor aaliye, mank'o b́k'aliyalmó shemi handro gad'ni b́k'riti, but'i handronwere shemi natosh woteratse. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Mank'o weyni biri arwi natots weyni biri handro gas'fo aaliye, gas'eyalmó weyni biri handrman aruman t'up'inibk'riti, weyni birmanwere kud'ni b́gutsiti, arwonwere finats jinatse. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Mansh weyni handr biro arwi handrots gaas'o geyife, <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Weyni biri kats úshtso weyni biri beno úsho geeratse, ‹Ja'atso weyni biri katso k'anefe,› bí eteti.»<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Sanbati jango aatets aato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat. 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mar. 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:25">Iwi. 23:25</ref> </char>
    </note> Sanbati aawon Iyesus taari taalon b́beshefere b́ danifwots sndyi motso k'ut'dek't bokishon shik'dek't moo dek' botuwi, <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Ferisawino eteefwotsitse ik ikuwots b́danifwotssh, «Sanbati aawon k'alosh geyiraw keewo it k'alir eegoshe?» bo eti.<verse eid="LUK 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:3-4 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Sam. 21:1-6</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesuswere hank'o ett boosh bí aaniy, «Bínat bínton fa'a ashuwotsn bo k'ak'or Dawit b́k'altsok'o nababeratsteya? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Lew. 24:9</ref> </char></note> Kahniwotsiyere okoon konwor b́marawok'owa ett baziyetso, bí Ik'i moots kinddek't Ik'osh t'ints misho k'a'ú dek't b́ máá, bínton fa'uwotssho bí ími.»<verse eid="LUK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Manats dab́t Iyesus, «Ash na'o sanbatushor b doonziye,» bí eti.<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ash kish duro Iyesus b́kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat. 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mar. 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Sanbati aaw k'oshots Iyesus ayhudiyots Ik' k'oni moots kind dek't b́ danifera b́ tesh, manokno b́ kish dúr ash iko fa'e b́ tesh. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Muse nemo danifwotsnat ferisawino etefwotsen Iyesusi bín bos'aamit k'uur keewo bo geyefera botesh, «Sanbati aawon ashaan kashitwek'úna aab s'iilone» ett bín kot bodek'i. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Iyesusmó bo gawirwo dank'rat kish durosh «Tuur taalots ned'de'e!» bí et. Duronwere tuut taalots need' b́dek'. <verse eid="LUK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Manór Iyesus ashuwotssh, «Aab́ itn aatuna, arikon aab sanbati aawots finore eteetso gond finemo doo fine? ash kash úd'emó ash kash oriyee,» bí eti. <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Iyesus bín gúúr dek't beyiru ash jamwots maants b́s'ili hakon kish durosh «N kisho jargwe!» bíet. Bíwere b́kisho b́jargtsok'on kashutsat b́ kish k'oshokok'o jeen wotb́wtsi.<verse eid="LUK 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Muse nemo daniyfwotsnat ferisawiwotsmó ayidek' nibok'únt, Iyesusi bo k'alitwok'o shiye bowtsi.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tatse git woshetswotsi Iyesus gal b́ dek'tsoko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat. 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mar. 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Ik aaw Iyesus Ik' k'onosh guri abaats kesh b́dek'i, manoknowere t'ú jamo Ik'omand k'onron b́ gatsi <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Datso b́gatstsok'ono b́ danifwotsi b́ maants b́ seeg, boyitsnowere tatse gitwotsi galdek't «Woshetswotsi.» ett boshútso b́ kishi, <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Boshútsonwere, P'et'rosi ett b́ s'eegetso Sm'onnat bíeshu Indriyasi, Yak'obnat Yohansn, Flip'osnat Bertelemyosi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Matiyosnat Tomasn, Ilfyos naay Yak'bnat «Okooretska» ett s'eegefo Sm'oni, <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Yak'ob naay Yhudnat Iyesusi beshidek't imtso Ask'rottso Yhudne.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus ay asho b́ danitsok'onat b́kashitsokon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat. 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Iyesus bík woshetsnton guri abaatse oot't juwanots ned'b́dek', b́ danifwotsitse aywotswere manoke fa'ano botesh, anynwere b́ keewirwo k'eboshat boshodotse kasho geeyat wááts ay dek't ayts ash ashuwotswere fa'ano botesh. Bowere bowóóko Yhud datsatse, Iyerusalem kitotse, aatsk'ari ganoke fa'uwots T'irosnat Sidon kitwotsitsikno botesh. <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>Kim shayiron detseyat kic'efetst teshts ash ashuwotswere waat kashefno. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Kashiyi angonwere bí atsotse kesht bo únetsi b́kashiyiruwotse kakuwets ash jamo Iyesus atsats bodosh bo geefoni.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Geneeúwonat shiyani jango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat. 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Iyesus dambaan kááwdek't b́ danifwots maants s'iilfetst hank'o b́ et,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">«Ik'i mengstu itk bwottsotse, It t'owwots derek itne!<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>It and k'ak'irwots, ayts it mishetwotse derek itne!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">And epiruwots it, ayts it mis'etwotse derek itne,<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1PE 4:14">1 P'et'. 4:14</ref> </char>
    </note> T jangatse, ash na'o atse tuutson ash ashuwots iti bo shit'or,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:22">Bogalor, bo aatsniyononat it shútso bo t'afiyor derek itne!<verse eid="LUK 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:23 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="2CH 36:16">2 Zen. 36:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">Wosh. 7:52</ref> </char>
    </note> «Darotse it daatsit k'awntso een b́wottsotse jaman itats b́ bodor derek itne! manór gene'on t'olar k'afore, shin shin bo nihotswor Ik'i ashuwotsats hank'o gond fina finat boteshi.<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>«Gaaletswots itmó it beyi sheengosh wotitwo andon it datstsotse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">Indowe itsha!<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>And wortswots it,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">Ayits it k'ak'itwotse indowe itna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">It and mis'irwots,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">Ayits it shiyanituwonat it eepetwotse</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Indowe itnsha!<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>Ash ashuwots it jangosh sheengo bokeewor indowe itsha!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:26">Bonihotswor kootets nebiyiwotssh mank'o k'altniye boteshi.»<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Balangaro shunere</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat. 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">Mat. 7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>«T keew k'ebirwotssh itshmó hank'o etirwe, it balangarwotsi shunere, iti shit'irwotssh sheeng keewo finore, <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>Iti c'ashirwotsi deerwore, itn p'ek'irwotsish Ik'o k'onuwere, <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>N malal iko jabitwosh, dabr ikmandtso aani de'er ime, n shemi nat'alo dek'irwosh n kitonor dabde'er ime, <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Niyatse k'oniru jamosh ime, n detstso niatse dek'iru asho bí aanitwok'o aatk'aye. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 7:12">Mat. 7:12</ref> </char></note> Ashuwots itsh bok'alitwok'o itgeyirwo itwoor mank'o boosh k'alwore.<verse eid="LUK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>«Iti shunirwots mec'ro it shunal, deero it dek'et aawushe? Morretswotswor boon shunirwotsi shunfneree, <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Itsh sheeng fintswots mec'rosh itwere sheengo it finiyal eegoshe bogo daatso it faliti! morretswotswor mank'ó k'alfnosha, <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>‹Noosh aniyitune› etaat it gawiru ashuwotssh it gushiyal awuneya bogo it datsiti? Bogushitsman aani dek'osh morretswotswor morretswotssh gushifnee. <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Itmó it balangarwotsi shunere! sheeng keewonowere boosh finore, No gusho aniytune it erawon gushiwere, mank'o itk'liyal it k'awntso eena b́wotiti, jamoniyere damb bogts Ik'o nana'uwotsno wotitute, bí werigondetswotsnat úderaw gondwotsshor dowe. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>It nih dartso maac' k'ewetsi b́ wottsok'o itwoor bíkok'o maac' k'eewtswotsi wotoore.<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">K'oshwotsats angsho b́geyrawok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat. 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>«Itats angsherawok'o konatsor angshk'ayere, itats angshratse, ash k'oshwotsi k'efk'ayere, itnowere k'eferatse, orowe erere, itwere orowe eto daatsitute, <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Imere, itshowere imetuwe, it tatsit tatsi k'ac'ots itsho tatsetwe, dab sheeng tatsi k'ac'otse mirde'er tuc'etso s'eenr kud' kud' ettso itsh imetwe.» <verse eid="LUK 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:39 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 15:14">Mat. 15:14</ref> </char></note> Manats dabt Iyesus aridek't han boosh b́keewi, «Dogo dogo jishosh falitwá? Mank'o k'alitwe bíetalmó bo gitetswor desheyar gohots dihni bowtsiti. <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:40 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:24-25">Mat. 10:24-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Yoh. 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15:20</ref> </char></note> Daniru na'o bín daniyrwoniyere bowatse, ernmó daniru na'o sheengeshde'er danbdek'al bín danyrwok'o wotituwe. <verse eid="LUK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>N ááwotsi gindo nbe'aawo eegoshe n eshu aawitsi kimúwu n s'iliri? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Ando ni'ááwotse fa'a gindo nbe'aawo nieshush ‹Ti eshuwo, n aawitsi fiishani aab neesh kishuna› eto aawuk'oneya nfaliti? Nee git alberetsono, shin shino ni'aawitsi gindo kishuwe, maniyere il nieshu aawotse fa'a fiisho s'ayintsde'er s'iilo falitune.»<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mito b́shuwatse b́daneefok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat. 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>«Miti sheengo gond shuwo shuurake, ando mank'o miti gondo shwi sheengo shuurake. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>Mit jamo b́shuwona b́ danefo, angitsotse belesiya eteef miti shuwo mec'eraka, mank'o angitsi atatse woyiniya eteef miti shuwo mec'eraka. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat. 12:34</ref> </char></note> Ash sheengo b́ nibi s'aynotse sheeng keewo kishitwe, gond ashonwere b́ god nibotse gond keewo kishituwe. Ashoniye b́ maac'otse s'eentsoniye b́nonon b́ keewfoni.»<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'alats wee shíyats ageets moowwots eeg bo artsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat. 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>«Taa t keewirwono fineratstere, eshe eegoshe, ‹t doonzo! t doonzo! etaat taan it s'eegiri?› <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>T maants waar t aap'tso k'ew de'er finats jitsitwo koni bí artsok'o itsh keewna, <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>B́ gop'o dashan wokidek't isht b́ moo kup' s'alats need'idek't detsits ashoni bí ariye, di'onwere waat maaman b́ gifniy, ernmó kup'ts s'alats b́ detsetsotse giwsho falratse. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Ti aap'o k'ebt finats jitsrawonmó b́ moo dashan b́gop'irawo shawats agts asho arefee; di'o waat b́gifniytsok'on manoor dihb́wtsi, b́ dih dihonwe ayi dek't dhi een wotb́wtsi.» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus bali naasho guutso b́kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat. 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Iyesus jamhan ash ashosh keew b́ íshihakon K'frnahom maants bí ami.<verse eid="LUK 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Manokno Rom datsatstso bali naash iko fa'e b́tesh, bíwere ayidek't b́shunf b́ guuts shodo bíats b́manzre k'iro b́beshi. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Bali naashmanu Iyesus jango b́ shishtsok'on Ayhudi eenashwotssh «Oona itsha, Iyesus wáár taash t guutso b́ kashytwok'o amr taash k'onwere,» ett b́ wosh. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Bowere Iyesus maants amt, «Ashaansh han nk'alo bísh geyife, <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>Bí noo ash asho shunfee, Ayhudi Ik' k'oni moono noosh agree,» ett kup'idek't bok'oni.<verse eid="LUK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Mansh Iyesus bonton tohaat bí ami, b́ mooko bodosh bo etfere bali naashmanwere b́ jagwotsi hank'o ett Iyesusok b́ wosh, «Doonzono! Nee t moots nkinditwok'o bodk twoterawotse t moots wosh shambk'aye. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Taawor ttokoon nmand wosh bodk taanaliye, Manoke bede'er ik nonu keewwe, t guutsonwere kashitwe. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Taawor ttookon naashwotssh alek wotefetsat taayere dashwotsno t altswots kes' kes'fwotsi detsfe. Mank'o b́wottsotse ikosh ‹Amee!› ti etor ametuwe, k'oshosh ‹Wowe!› t etor weetuwe, t guutsosh ‹Hank'o k'aluwe!› ti etor k'alitwe.»<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Iyesus han b́ shishtsok'on bí adi, b́ shutsatse weyiru ashuwots maantsan wongr ett, «Dab Isra'elitse hank'o bodts imnetiyo daatsratse» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Wosheetswere bali naasho moo maants aanat bowatsok'on b́ guutso kashat b́ befere daatsbodek'i.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus t'oow mááts iku na'o k'irotse b́tuztsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Yatsok'on Iyesus Nayini eteets kit iku maants bí ami, b́ danifuwotsnat ayi asho b́ shutsats bínton towat boami <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Iyesus kitu fengshi ganok b́ bodtsok'on, ashuwots duuno kurdek't kitutse bokeshfera botesh, k'irts ashman b́ indsh ik s'uza b́tesh, b́ induwere kenih k'irts t'oow máátsi, kitutsnowere ay asho b shutsatse bo sha'iri. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>doononwere bin b́ bek'tsok'on bish maac'o k'ewat «Epefne shenúne!» bí et. <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Manye il b́ maants t'int she'o b́t'awiyi, she'ono kuriru ashuwots ned'bowuts, Iyesuswere «Nee jawetsono tuuwe etiruwe neesha!» bí et. <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>K'irtsonwere jobk' ett tuut bedek't noon keewo dek' b́ tuu, maniyere hakon Iyesus indúsh «Hambe nnaayi,» ett imb́k'r.<verse eid="LUK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Jametswotswere shatwtsat «Noyitse bek'ts eeno tuugutsere, Ik'o bí asho kashiyosh waare,» et fetst Ik'o bo údi.<verse eid="LUK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Iyesus shúútsonwere Yihudnat b́ gúrmanatse fa'a datsjamatse shiye b́wuts.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gupfo Yohansoke Iyesus maants wosheets ashuwotsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Yohans b́danif'uwots keew jamanots jango bísh bo keewi, bí were b́ danifwotsitse gitwotsi s'eegdek't, <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>«Mesihiyo weetwe eteetso neenemó k'oshe nokoteti? err aatwere,» ett doonzo Iyesusok b́ wosh.<verse eid="LUK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Bowere Iyesusok waat « ‹Weetwe eteetso neenemo? k'oshe nokoteti?› err aatwere ett gupfo Yohans niyok noon woshere,» bo et.<verse eid="LUK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Iyesus manoori sa'atmanitse ash ashuwotsi atsi weeshonat ay naari shodotse b́ kashiyi, kim shayirwotsnowere b́ kishi, ay aaw dogwotssho bo aawo b́ k'esh. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 35:5-6">Isa. 35:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">61:1</ref> </char></note> Iyesus woshere watswotssh hank'owa bí et, «Aanar amr Yohanssh it bek'tsonat it shishtson keewwore, hambe dogwots bek'irunee, shoklirwotswere kawdek't sha'irune, een shodetswotsu s'aynirune, gidik'uwotswere shishirune, k'irtswotswere tuwirune, t'owwotssho doo shisho nabeyirwee. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Aak'o gene'ona tiatse maac' k'ut'rawoni?» <verse eid="LUK 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Yohans woshtswots k'az boamihakon Iyesus Yohans jango ash ashosh hank'o et keewo dek'b́tu, «Eeg s'iile worwots oot'at it weyiri? Jongon hake bako giwiru elt s'iilisheya? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Eeg bek'oshe keshat it weyiri? Tah sheeng tahiru asho s'ileya? Tah sheeng tahirwotsnat beyi sheeng beyirwotswo naash naashi mootsere bo fa'oni, <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Aab taash keewwore, eeg s'iiloshe it keshi? Nebiyo s'ilosheya? Ee, itsh keewirwe, dab nebiyiyonyere iki bogtso s'ilishe. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mil. 3:1</ref> </char></note> Bíwere ‹Eshe! n shin shinatse beshar n weerindo k'aniytwo twosh na'o deyitwe,› ett guut'etsoniye. <verse eid="LUK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Máátsatse shuuts jamwotsitse Yohansiyere bogo konwor aaliye, Ik'i mengstotsnmó jamotse muk'o bíyere bogfe.»<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:29-30 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:32">Mat. 21:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:12">Luk'. 3:12</ref> </char>
    </note> Han bo shishtsok'on ash jamo t'ilish ko'irwots dab bo'orerawo Yohans kishatse gupeyat boteshtsotse Ik'i fino arik b́wottsok'wo t'iwints bodek'i. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Ferisawiwotsnat Muse nemo danifwotsnomó Yohanis kishon guperatsone ett Ik'i shuntso k'efatniye botesh.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Manats dabt Iyesus hank'owa bí'et, «Eshe and dúri s'oot'an egonton boon ariywta? Eege bo arik'úna? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Gawiyi beyoke bedek't kaashirw nana'uwotsi arefne, boowere boatsatseyo s'eyeyat ‹Turaro itsh nofugi, itmó duuwatste, eepi jááwono nojáwere eefatste,› etirwotsiye. <verse eid="LUK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Gupfo Yohans b́woor misho b́marawonat weyniy bíron b́úyawon b́watsosh ‹Fo'erawoniye bí'atse fa'oni› it eti. <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>Ando ash na'o mafere úshfere b́watsosh, ‹S'iilere maac' geenzonat máshetsana, t'ilish ko'ifwotsnat morrets ashuwotssho kod'i ashe› it eti. <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Dan telefu arik b́ woto b nana'atsnee b be'efonye.» bíet.<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mááts iku Iyesus tufo shituwo bfuuttsok'owo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Ferisawiwotsitse iko Iyesusi b́gale aaw misho b́metwok'o b́ s'eegi, Iyesuswere ferisawiya eteetsman gal amt mishimarats t'iin b́dek'i, <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Kit manitse morr finon daneets mááts iku fa'a b́tesh, bíwere Iyesus fersawiya eteetsman gale mishimaratse b́beyirwok'o b shishtsok'on shituwo bin s'eentso albat'rosiya eteets shútson dozets blk'at'iyon s'eents shituwo dek'at bweyi. <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37-38 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 26:7">Mat. 26:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3">Mar. 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:3">Yoh. 12:3</ref> </char></note> Iyesus shutsomantse b́ tufi ganoke need'dek' eepfetsat b́ tufo bi ac'uwon ok'iyfetsat b took s'iron bfiri, b́ tufuwotsno jobefetsat shitúwon bfuutiri. <verse eid="LUK 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Ferisawiya eteets waa misho moowe ett s'egtsman wotiruman b́ bek'tsok'on, «Ashaan nebiya wotink'ere bín shú'iru máátshan koni b wotonat aak'o morretsk bwoto danak'e b́teshi» ett b́ nibotse b́ gawi.<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Iyesuswere, «Sim'ono! neesh tkeewit keew iko detsfe,» bíet.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Bíwere, «Eek'uwa, danifono! abtaash keewwe!» bíet.<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Iyesuswere hank'o etfere keewo dek't b́ tuu, «Ash iko git ashuwotssh gizo gushitso fa'e b́ tesh, iko atse úts bal dinariyo, ando ikoatse balk'ats dinariyo b́ tesh. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Gitetswotswere bogushtso dasho bo maawere boatsi k'awntsman dasho k'ayk'rore bí et, eshe aab bogitetsitse boosh giz gushitsman bogshde'er shunetuwo aawi arefa neesha?» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Sim'onwere, «Ay k'awntso b́ daywok'o orowe eteetso bogshde bín b́ shuneetwok'o arefee taasha,» ett bíaany.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Iyesuswere «Aree n keewi,» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Maniye hakon Iyesus máátsu maants wongr ett aanat Sim'onsh hank'o bí'et «Máátsani bek'irwiya? Taa n moots t kindihakon nee dab tutuf mashi aatso doratsne, bimó ttufo biac'won mashat b took s'irone b firiri. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Nee taan jamo niator joberatsne, bimó n meyits t kindron t tufo jobo ned'iratsaniye, <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Nee t tookats zeyito dab furatsne, bimó t tufwotsi shitwo futraniye. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Manshe bi ayi dek'at b shuntsotsne b morro ayone bish orowe eteyi maniye neesh t keewi, b́ morro múkshdek't oorowe eteetsonmó b́shunwere múkshdek'tniye.»<verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Maniye hakon Iyesus máátsmansh, «N morro neesh orowe eteere,» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Bínton mishimarotse mafetst teshtswotsmó «Morronor orowe etetwuhan kone?» ett bonibotse gawo dek't botuu.<verse eid="LUK 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Iyesusmó máátsmansh «N imnetiyo neen kashire, jeenon amee!» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus shuuts sha'ef máátswots</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Maniyere il Iyesus kitwotsnat gál gálotse Ik'i mengsti jango nabfere doo shishiyo keewfere b́beshir, tatse gitwotswere bíntoni botesh. <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>Mankoó kim shayirwotsnat bo shodatsnowere kashts máátswots Iyesus shutsatse bo sha'efere botesh. Bowere fo'era shawatwots biatsotse keshtsu Megdelawi datstsu Mariyami eteetsu, <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2-3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 27:55-56">Mat. 27:55-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:40-44">Mar. 15:40-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:49">Luk'. 23:49</ref> </char></note> Herodis mootse alat teshtso Kuz máátsunu, Yohanna, Sosnanat k'oshwots ayuwots fa'ano botesh, máánots Iyesusnat b́ danifwotssh bo gizona bofinefo.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shook shookirwo ariyetso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat. 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mar. 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Ay asho kitwotsitse keshit b́ maants waat ikok kakwe bowtstsok'on Iyesus hank'o ett jewrdek't b́ keew.<verse eid="LUK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>«Goshts iko shooko shookosh dek't b́keshi, b́ shokferowe maay shook ik iko weerindi gúrats fed'at net'eb́gutsi, kaf kafwtswere mec'dek' maabok'r, <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Shook k'oshonwere dats t'orats fed'b́gutsi, b́ bos'tsok'onowere daats shuuk' b́wottsotse bos'ts bos'man shuk'b́gutsi. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>K'osh shookonwere angitsi dagots fed' b́wutsi, angits manwere bínton eent guk' dek' oryib́dek'i <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>K'osh shokonmó sheeng datsats fed'at bos' b́gutsi, b́ bos'manwere eent ik ik shiro bal shuwo b́shuwi.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Manats dabt Iyesus, «Shiy waazo detstso k'ewe!» bí eti.<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus jewuron b́ keewtsi jango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat. 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mar. 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>B́ danifwots Iyesussh, «Ariydek'at nkeewts keewhan biitso eega etee?» ett bo aati. <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isa. 6:9-10</ref> </char></note> Iyesuswere hank'o ett boosh bí aaniy «Ik'i mengsti jango dano itsh imeke, k'oshwotsshmó keew jamo jewrone keeweti, ernmó bo be'eftsr t'iwintsratsno, shisho shifetsr nibn bode'awok'oye.»<verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shook shookirwo jewrets biitso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat. 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mar. 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>Jewuron keewets keewman bitsonúwere hank'oyiye, «Shooko Ik'i aap'oniye» <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Werind gúrats fed'ts shooko ariyetsman b́ kitsir Ik'i aap'o manórush k'ebirwotsi, ernmó bo amanar bokasherawok'o Diyablos waár Ik'i aap'tso bo nibotse k'a'udek'tsonye. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Dats t'orats fed'ts shooko b́kitsirwo Ik'i aap'o boshishtsok'on gene'on dek'iru ashuwotsiye, bomó boamanit manórusha, s'ap'o bodeshawotse fadewo boats b́ waal manoor bíne bohaaliti. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Angitsi dagotse fed'tswotsi artso b́kitsir Ik'i aap'o manorush k'ebiru ashuwotsi, ernmó datsanatsi beyosh shiyanonat gaalon, datsatsi sheeng beyo gú'de'er shuwlon boon orib́k'rti. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Dats sheengats fed'ts shooko artsonmó b́ kitsirwots Ik'i aap'tso shisht nib sheengonat kááwon k'ebdek't kotdek'tswotsi, boowere bíaapts aap'atse kup'at shuu shuwirwotsiye.<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">C'eesho bí aat'efo datso b́ shanytwok'owa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mar. 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat. 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Luk'. 11:33</ref> </char>
    </note> Manatsdabt Iyesus hank'owa bí et, «C'eesho c'eeshde oosho bí ats gup'shfo wee es'ishirots gedfo konwor aaliye, maniyere dab úratse moots kindiru jamwots b́ shááno bobek'etwok'o s'ogatsa b́gedfoni.<verse eid="LUK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mat. 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Luk'. 12:2</ref> </char>
    </note> «Mank'owo aatsetso be'erani, aashtso daneeraniye orituwo aaliye.<verse eid="LUK 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:29">Mat. 25:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Luk'. 19:26</ref> </char>
    </note> «Eshe Ik'i aap'tso it k'ebor it atso korde'ere, detsts ashosh daabde'erni bísh imeti, deshawoshmó dab detsfe bíetirwnor bíatse k'a'uni dek'eti.»<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus indnat b́ eshwotsn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat. 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mar. 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Iyesus indnat bí eshuwotsn b́ maants bowaa, ernmó ash aytsatse tuutson bín daatsratsno. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Mann, «Hambne! nindnat n eshuwotsn úratse need' dek't neen bek'o geefne.» ett ashuwots bísh bokeew.<verse eid="LUK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Iyesuswere «Ik'i aap'o k'eb́dek't finats jitsitu jamwots bona tindu ti eshuwotsiye.» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus kup'ts aatsatsi jongo b́ ned'itsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat. 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mar. 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Ikaw Iyesus b́ danifwotsnton jeelobuts kind dek't «Bak'ets kimone» bí et, boowere amoosh botuu. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Aatsk'ari abaatse jookdek't bo kimfere Iyesus tokrb́gutsi, manoor kup' eguraho aats k'armanatse tuub́wts, atsonwere jelbuts s'enfere b́waare shatbowtsi. <verse eid="LUK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>B́ danifwotswere, «Age danifono! danifono! s'uuroone!» eton Iyesusi tuzbodek'i.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Bíwere manoor tuut jongonat angnon giwu wutsts aatso b́ hadi, jongonat angi eenon giwuts aatso manoor need' bowutsi, manye il jamkeewo ayidek' s'ik etb́wutsi. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Maniye il Iyesus b́ danifwotssh, «Aawne it amantsoni?» bí et. Boomó ayidek't adt shatt, boatsatsewo, «Jongonat angi eenon giwuts aatsonor ale bíaliri, boowere bíshe boaleyiri, ashaan kone bí?» bo et.<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus kim shayiron detsets asho b́ kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:28-34">Mar. 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mar. 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Aats k'aro kimt Geliliye bak'etse fa'a Gergesenoni am bobodi, <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Iyesus jelbutse dats b́ oot'tsok'on fo'erawo bíatsots s'eents ash iko kitotse kesht bín gonkb́dek'i, ashman araatson b́ beyihakon aydúro teshka, b́befonwere doow doowi beyoka bako mootsali, <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Iyesusi b́ bek'tsok'on b́ kuhi, Iyesus shinatsowere dats diht b́k'aaro eenshdek't, «Nee jamoniyere damb bogts Ik'o naay Iyesuso, ti atse eege ndetsi? oona neesha taan gondo bek'shk'aye,» bí et. <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Man bí'etwere Iyesus kim shayirmansh asho atsotse b́keshetwok'o bí azaztsotsna. Maniye shinon kim shayironwere ashmanatse ayota b́ tuufo, muk'onat habliyon tifderni kotefo, ernmó habliyono b́k'ut'fo, muk'ono b́titsfoni. Fo'erawonwere bín joohde'er woruwotsa b́ damfo.<verse eid="LUK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Iyesuswere «N shúútso kone?» ett bí aati, bíwere ay fo'erawwots bí'ats oot'dek't́ b́teshtsotse «T shúútso Legiyoniye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:30 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Legiwoni: </char><char style="ft">Legiyoni eto kes' keshiru ik jirwotsi. </char></note>» ett bíaaniy. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Manoor fo'erawonwere «Oona neesha ayidek't dashan gop'ts gop'ots noon damik'aye» eton bín bok'oni.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Gohi gúúratse jiniru guritsi s'eeno fa'e b́tesh, fo'erawotswere, «Guritswotsits nokindish noosh eekowe» ett Iyesusi bok'oni, bí were boosh «Kindwere» bí eti. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Mann fo'erawwots ashmanitse kesht Guritswotsts bokindí, Guritswots gohatse t'olefere bo'ot', aats k'arots kindt limbowtsi.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Gurits jinirwotswere wottsman bobek'tsok'on shatoon k'azbowos'i kit kitonat gál gáltse keewman shishiy. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Ash ashuwotswere wotts keewman s'ilosh bo maa mootse kesht Iyesus maants boweyi, fo'erawwots bíatsotse keshts ashonwere bíatso dandek't taho tahdek't Iyesus tufishirotse b́ befere bek't shatbowts. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Áawon bek'tswotswere fo'erawwotsn detseyat teshts ashman awuk'on b́kashtsok'o bokeewi. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Maniye il Gergesenon dats ash jamwots Iyesus bo datsatse k'aybíametwok'o bok'oni. Man bo etirwere ayi dek't shat t botehstsotsna, mansh Iyesus jlbots kínd dek't b́ waats datsomand aanat k'azbíami. <verse eid="LUK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Fo'erawo bíatsotse keshts ashman Iyesussh «Oona neesha n shuutso sha'ona,» ett b́k'on. Iyesusmó hank'o ett jami b́k'ri.<verse eid="LUK 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>«N galomand amr Ik'o neesh b́ k'alts jamo keewwe» ashmanwere Iyesus bísh b́k'alts keewi eenman kit jamotse keewfere bí ami.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iya'ros ni'nat Iyesus shemo t'awits máátsuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat. 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mar. 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Ash jamo bí b́kotirwotse Iyesus aanat b́waatsok'on jametso gene'ona bín bodek'i. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Manoor Ayhudi Ik' k'oni maatse naash wottso Iya'irosi eteets asho b́waeyi, Iyesus tufi shirots diht, «Oona neesha t gal wowe,» ett b́k'oni. <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>Han bí'etirwe tatse git nat wottsu b́ na'a ik s'uzu shodat k'irosh biettsotsna.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Iyesus bínton towat bíamfere b́shutsatse bín shoydek't amiru ash ay boatsatseya bo gifniyfera botesh. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Mááts iku tatse git nat jamo s'atso kud'at need'o b́k'aye ayi dek'at kic'iru fa'a btesh, b detsts gizo jamo atetswotssh im ishat boyitse konwor bin kashiyo falratse. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Biwere Iyesus maants wáat b́shutsatse bíyok t'iinat b́ shemi jilo b t'awi, manoor b s'atsi kuud'o ned'b́wts. <verse eid="LUK 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Iyesuwere «Kone tiats bodtsoni?» ett bí aati.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Jametswots «Noo niats boratsonee» boeti, P'et'roswere «Danifono, ash asho neen gifnit nshuutso b́ sha'efere bek'fetsatniya kone tiats bodi nietiri?» bíet.<verse eid="LUK 8:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Iyesusmó «Ango ti atsotse b́keshtsok'o tdantsotse arikon ash iko tiats bodre,» bí et. <verse eid="LUK 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Máátsmanwere ááshar b oorerawok'o bdantsok'on k'ewefetsat Iyesus maants waat b́tufishirots b dih, maniye il eegosh bín bt'awitsok'onat manoor bkashtsok'o ash jami shinatse kish b́ keewi. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Iyesuswere «T ni'e, n aman amano neen kashire, jamon amee!» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Iyesus man keewoke b́ befere ash iko ayhudiyots Ik' k'oni maa naasho mootse kesht «N na'ú k'irgutseraniye, eshe danifo datsmec'ro shambik'aye!» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 8:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Iyesusmó han shisht Iya'irossh, «Shenono shatk'aye, amanowe bako, n na'ú kashitwaniye,» bíet.<verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Iyesus Iya'iros mook b́bodtsok'on P'et'rosiye, Yohansiye, Yak'obiye, na'ú nihnat indna boko k'osho konwor bínton gitsomaand b́ kindrawok'owa bí eti. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Manokno fa'a ash jamwots na'ú jangosh eepfetst, indowe indowe boetfera botesh. Iyesusmó, «Eepk'ayere, na'ú tokra btokri bako k'irratsaniye,» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 8:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Boomó na'ú bk'irtsok'o bo dantsotse bo jamets bíatsa bomis'i. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Iyesus na'ú kisho dets dek't, «T ni'e, tuuwe!» bí et. <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Bíwere b kasho bíatsots bí'aanere manoor jobk' etaat b tuwi, Iyesuswere «Bmetwo bísh imere!» ett b́ keewi. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Na'ú nihonat indun ayidek't bo adi, bímó wotts jamo konshor bo kewrawok'owa ett boosh b́keewi.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s">Tatse git b́ woshefwots daniyosh bo woshetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat. 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mar. 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Iyesus tatse git b́woshtswotsi b́maand s'eegdek't fo'erawwotsi kishosh, shod jam kashiy, angonat alon b́ imi. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Ik'i mengsti jango ash jamosh bo keewitwok'o shodetswotsno bo kashitwok'o boon b́ woshi. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3-5 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Luk'. 10:4-11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:51">Wosh. 13:51</ref> </char></note> Hank'owa boosh bí et, «It werindosh wotitwo eegor deshdek' k'ayere, gumbonor b́wotiyal, k'arc'itonor, galonor, gizonor, woniyet tahonor dab daamk'ayere. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Ibo amr maa ikots it kindor gálmanitse keer it amfetsosh maa man mec'rotse teyere. <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>Asha ashwots itn ibiyo bok'azetk wotiyalmó gálmani fakshr it amor it tufatsi k'undo tebk'rar ameree, manwere boats gaw wotitwe.»<verse eid="LUK 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Mansh wosheetsots maniye kesht doo shishyo daniyfetst shodetswotsi kashiyifere gál gálotse boguurefoni.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Herodis Iyesus een shúútso b́shishtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat. 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mar. 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7-8 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mat. 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mar. 8:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Luk'. 9:19</ref> </char>
    </note> Ash ik iko «Gpfo Yohans k'irotse k'az tuure» ett bo keewirwotse Gelil dats k'eezfo Herodis Iyesus fints jamo b́ shishor daand b́wutsi. <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Mank'o ik ikwots «Nebiyo Eliyas aanat waare,» bo etor k'atswotsmó «Shints nebiywotsitse iko k'irotse k'az tuure,» bo etiri. <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 14:1-2">Mat. 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-15">Mar. 6:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-8">Luk'. 9:7-8</ref> </char></note> Herodiswe b́ kaaton «Taa Yohans tooko k'ut'rere, eshe, jaman k'alirwe ett keeweyirwo kone eshna?» bí etfo. Bín bek'ono b́ tewnfo.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus uts kum ashuwotsi b́maanztsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat. 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar. 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoh. 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>B́woshefwots bowoshetsoke aani wáát bok'alts jamo Iyesussh bokeewi. Bíwere Betesayida eteets kitu ganoke fa'a jokats bo aali dek't bíami. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Ash ashonwre Iyesus beyoko áwok b́woto bo daniyakon b́shuutso shoy dek't botuw, bíwere boon dek't Ik'i mengsti jango boosh b́ daniyi, boshodatse kasho geeyat waats jamwotsno bo shodotse b́ kashi. <verse eid="LUK 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Aawo ilosh bí'etfere, b́danif tatse gitwots Iyesus maants t'int «No beyirwokanwo woorwere, eshe ash ashuwotsi gúranatse fa'a kitwotsnat gat'eriwotsits amr mishonat k'eyokon gee bodek'etwok'o fakshk'rowe,» bo et.<verse eid="LUK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Iyesusmó «It it tookon bometwo boosh imere,» bí eti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Bowere «Noo nodetsiye úts mishunat git mus' mec'riye, man b́wottsotse no kewiyala bako jam ashaansh boratse,» bo eti.<verse eid="LUK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Ash ashonwere úts kumk'oyi b́tesh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Iyesus b́ danifwotssh «Ash asho b'alk'ts b'alk'tson kayide'er bo bedek'etwoko woshwere» bíet.<verse eid="LUK 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>B́ danifwotswere bí'ettsuk'o ash ashuwotsi bobetwok'o woshbok'ri. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Maniyere il Iyesus úts mishwotsnat mus' gitwotsn k'a'udek't daromaants kááwdek't s'iilt Ik'o b́údi, tishde'er ash ashosh bokayitwok'o b́ danifwotssh b́ ími. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Jametswots maat bowori, b́ danifwots ash mááre oorts mishi fed'o tatse git ooshi s'eeno bo k'a'úwi.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Mesihi b́wottsok'o P'et'ros b́keewtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat. 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mar. 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Ik aaw Iyesus bí'yal Ik'o b́ k'onfere b́ danirwots waat bínton be bodek', bíwere, «Ash asho taan koni etfno?» ett bíaat.<verse eid="LUK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Bowere «Ik iko ‹Gupfo Yohansiye,› k'atswots ‹Eliyasiye,› etfne neesha, ‹Yoots nebiyiwotsitsi iko k'irotse tuure,› etirwotsu fa'ane,» ett bísh bo aaniyi.<verse eid="LUK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>Itmó eshe, «Taan koni etfte?» et boon bí aati. P'et'roswere, «Nee Ik'i mesihiyo neene,» ett bísh bí aaniy.<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus gond bek'onat b́k'iri jango b́keewtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mat. 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Mar. 8:30—9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Iyesusere han konshor bokeewrawok'o kup'idek't b́ keewi.<verse eid="LUK 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>Manats dabt Iyesus b́ danifwotssh hank'owa bí'et, «Ash na'o gond bek'o ayide bí'ats b́bodo jinatse, eenashwotsnat kahniy naashwotsn, Muse nemo danifwotsoke gac'etwe, úd'etwe, b́wotiyalor keezl aawon k'irotse tuwitwe.»<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat. 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luk'. 14:27</ref> </char>
    </note> Jametswotssh hank'wa bíet, «T shuuts waa geetso b́ beyal b́took keewo juk'rowe, aaw aawonowere b́ mask'aliyo kurde t shuutso sha'owa <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat. 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luk'. 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yoh. 12:25</ref> </char></note> Taayere bogo b́ kasho shawsh geyitu jametswots t'ut'etúno, taasha err b́ kasho beshide'er imetwonmó ooridek'etwe. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Asho datsatsi gaal jamo b́datsiyal, b́ kashunmó b́ t'afiyal eege bísh b́k'aliti? <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Taanat tdanits daniyi jangatse tuutson jitsitu jámo ash na'o b́mangonat b́ nih mangon, aani b́ melaki S'aynwots mangon b́ woor b́jangatse jitsitwe. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Arikoniye itsh t keewiri, and hanoke fa'úwotsitse Ik'i megstu bo bek'fetsosh k'irrawwots fa'ane.»<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus aro b́woneetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat. 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mar. 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Iyesus han b́keewtsi shmt aawe hakon P'et'rosi, Yohansnat Yak'obn jishdek't Ik' k'onosh gur iko abaats keshb́dek'i. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Ik'o b́k'onfere bí'aro wone b́ wtsi, b́ tahonuwer nas' wotat b́ goli. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Mann! gawerawon git ashuwots waat bínton bokeweyir, boowere Musenat Elyasna bo teshi. <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>Mangon be'eyat keewefetst bo teshtsonwere, Iyesus Iyerusalemitse gond bek'o bí'ats b́ bodetwok'onat b́ k'iritwok'ona b́teshi. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Manór P'et'rosnat b́ tohwotsn tokron maawutsat k'egutserno boteshi, tokrotse bo tuwtsok'nmo Iyesus mangonat bínton teshts ash gitwotsn bo bek'i. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Ash gitwots Iyesusatse k'aleyat bo amtsok'on P'et'ros Iyesussh «Danifono, hanoke beyo noosh shenge, eshe iko neesh, iko Musesh, ikono Eliyassh, keez gofuwotsi áá de'one!» bí et, P'et'ros han bietoor b́ keewirwo danatse.<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>P'et'ros man keewoke b́befre daawno waat boon degbdek', dawnonwere boon degb́dek'tsok'on shat bowtsi. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa. 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat. 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar. 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk'. 3:22</ref> </char></note> Dawnmanitsno, «T marat'tso t na'o haniye, bín k'ewere!» etiru k'ááro b́ waa.<verse eid="LUK 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>K'armanwere b́ shisheyahakon Iyesus bíaali wotat b́ daatseyi, b́ danifwotswere bo bek'ts jamo konshor bo kewrawon s'ket be bowts.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus kim shayiron detsets na'o b́kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat. 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mar. 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Yatsok'on Iyesusnat b́ danif keezwotsn guri abaatse bo oot'tsok'on ay asho Iyesusi amt gonkbodek'i. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Ash ash dagotse ash iko hank'o ett b́kuh! «Danifono! na'an taash iks'uz b́wottsotse taash n kashiytwok'o neen k'onre, <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Hambe! Kim shayiran gawerawo detsdek't b́ kuhirye, datsats dikdek't úmbo kishifetst b́ s'ik'iyriye, bí atsono gaawit gondo b́ bek'shiyakon b́fakshfoni. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Kim shayiran bo kishitwok'o n danifwotssh keewre b́tesh, ernmó falratsne.»<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Iyesuswere hanko bí et «It amaneraw k'uurts s'oot'wotso! awrifetsone itnton t beeti? awrifetsoshe it keewo t k'amiti? aab n na'o hakan de'ewowe.»<verse eid="LUK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Na'onwere Iyesus maants b́ t'intsok'on fo'erawo datsats dikdek't b́ s'ik'i, Iyesusmó kim shayirman hadat, na'onowere kashidek't b́ nihsh imb́k'ri. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Ash jamonwere Ik'i een ango bobek'tsotse bo adi.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Iyesus b́k'iri jango gitlo b́keewtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat. 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mar. 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Jametsuwots Iyesus b́ k'alts keewmaanatse tuutson adoke bobefere b́ danifwotssh hank'o bíeti, <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>«Itsh tkeewiru keewan nibn de t'iwintsde'ere! Hambe, Ash Na'o ashuwotssh beshide imetwe.» <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Boomó keewman t'iwintsde'atsno, b́keewirmanwere boosh aashgutsatni b́tesh, bín aatoshowere shat bowtsi.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jamoniyere bogo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat. 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mar. 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:46 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luk'. 22:24</ref> </char>
    </note> B́ danifwots «No únetsitse bogo kone?» ett moosho tuuz bok'ri. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Iyesusmó bo nibotse bo gawirwo dank'rat na'i marmat' iko dek' waat b́ ganok need'i b́k'ri, <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:48 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat. 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Luk'. 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Yoh. 13:20</ref> </char></note> Bíwere «Na'i marmat'han taasha err dek'etwo taane b́ dek'iy, taan dek'ts jamonwere taan woshtsonye bo dek'iye. Ititse it jametswotsitse dashtso bí jamoniyere bogee b́ wotitye,» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iti k'eferawu jamo it mandke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mar. 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Maniye hakon Yohans Iyesussh, «Danifono, ash iko n shútson fo'erawo b́ kishfere nobek'i, ernmó noonton b́woterawotse bazi nok'ri,» bíet.<verse eid="LUK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Iyesuswere «Iti k'eferaw jamo it maants b́wottsotse k'ayere, bazik'ayere!» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Semariy ashuwots Iyesusi bo k'eftsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Iyesusi daromadan b́ keshet aawo t'infere b́ waatsok'on Iyerusalem maants amoosh k'ut'dek't b́ tuwi. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Bíyere shin shino amet woshetawotsi woshb́k'ri, boowere jam keewo k'aniyosh Semaritse daatsets gal iku maants bo ami. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Ernmó bí mann beshar Iyerusalemi bí'ametuwok'o bo dantsotse gal manitsi ashuwots bín dek'o geratsno bo tesh. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>B́danifuwots Yak'obnat Yohansn man bo bek'tsok'on, «Doonzono! darotse tawo ood'r ashaanotsi mits b́ bazetwok'o no k'alish eekineya?» bo et.<verse eid="LUK 9:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Iyesusmó bo maants wongr ett aanat boon b́ hadi. [It aaw naari shayirokik it wottsok'o danatste, ash na'o b́awa ash kash worya bako, t'afiyaliye.] <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Manoknowere tuut k'osh gaalo maants k'az bo ami.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus shuuts sha'it ashaats bodet gond bek'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat. 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Iyesusnat b́ danifwots weerindatse bo sha'efere ash iko Iyesussh «Taa ni'amiru jamok n shuutso shoyde'er amoosh geefe,» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 9:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Iyesuswere «Waangwots gop'o detsfne, daritsi kafwotswere kúto detsfne, ashna'onmó dab b́ tooku bits b́ gedetwok wotts bewoku deshatse,» ett bísh bíaaniy.<verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>K'osh ashosho, «T shuutso wowe» bí et. Ashmanmó «T doonzo! shino amr t nihi duh tdek'ish taash eekowe,» bi et.<verse eid="LUK 9:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Iyesuswere «K'irtswotsi k'ayk'rowe, k'irts bokuwotsi duhde'enee, nemon amr Ik'i mengsti jango daniwe!» ett bí aaniyi.<verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:61 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1KI 12:20">1 Naash. 12:20</ref> </char>
    </note> Maniye il k'osh ash iko «Doonzono, taa neenton sha'o geefe, wotowa bako shino amr t meyitsi ashuwotsi jamir t weetwok'o taash eekowe,» bí eti.<verse eid="LUK 9:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Iyesuswere «Goshosh hordo kishon deshde'er shuutso maants s'iliru asho Ik'i mengstosh wotitkaliye,» et bíaanyi.<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus doo shishiyo bodaniytuwok'o b́danif shabe gitwotsi b́wooshtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Maniyere okoon doonzo, shabe git ashuwotsi galbdek'i, bí amoosh b́gawts kitonat beyok jamok shin shino bo ametuwok'o git gito woshdek't b́woshi. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 9:37-38">Mat. 9:37-38</ref> </char></note> Hank'o boosh bíeti, «Hamb, kakwet mááyo aye, mááy kakuwi fintswotsmo kos'nee, mansh mááy katso doonz mááy kakwitwotsi mááyko'iyosh b́woshitwok'o k'onwere. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:16">Mat. 10:16</ref> </char></note> Eshe ameree, hamb, mereerikok'o iti elahi dagots twoshiri, <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4-11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:7-14">Mat. 10:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Mar. 6:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Luk'. 9:3-5</ref> </char></note> It werindosh eegor deshdek'k'ayere, gizi borsonor, k'arc'itonor, c'amonor b́ wotiyal deshdek'o k'ayere, ashonton jam aateyoke weerindatse need'ar aawo ili k'ayere. <verse eid="LUK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>It kindts maa jamotse shin shino ‹Jeeno mansh wotowe,› erere, <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Jeen shunts asho maa manitse fa'e wotiyal it jeeno bísh bodetwe, maniyalbako it jeeno it maants k'ay aanitwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1 K'or. 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 T'im. 5:18</ref> </char></note> Finiru ashosh damozo bísh geyife, mansha it kindts mootse itsh t'íntsetso mafetsr uyfetsr beewere, ik mootse keer k'osh moots gúúŕ k'ayere. <verse eid="LUK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>Aaknor wotowa kitots it kindor ashuwots itn bo dek'or itsh bo t'intstso moore. <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>Kit manitsi daatset shodetswotsnowere kashiwore, ash jamoosho were, ‹Ik'i mengstu it maantsan t'inraniye,› err keewwere. <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Ernmó kit aawitsor it kindor ash ashuwots itn dek'o bok'azetka wotiyal kit man jebats keder boosh hank'o erere, <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10-11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Wosh. 13:51</ref> </char></note> ‹Hambe, dab notufatse fa'a it kitutsi k'undo itsh tebk'rirwone, ernmó Ik'i mengsto it maants b́ t'intsok'o dan de'ere.› <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Aze. 19:24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:24">Mat. 11:24</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:15">10:15</ref> </char></note> Angshi aawots kit maniyere Sedom kituats weet fayo ketefe etirwe itsha.»<verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aman k'azts kitwotsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat. 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 23:1-8">Isa. 23:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Hzk'. 26:1—28:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Iyu. 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Amo. 1:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Zek. 9:2-4</ref> </char>
    </note> Manats dabt Iyesus hank'owo bíet, «Indowe neesha Korazine! indowe neena Betesayido! ititse finets aditswots, T'irositsnat Sidoniytse finere wotink'e manoke fa'a ashuwots shiyani taho tahde'er tuulats bede, naandrone etank'ne. <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Manshe angshi aawots itiyere T'irosnat Sidonats fayet fayo ketefee. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 14:13-15">14:13-15</ref> </char></note> Neewere K'frnahome, darots n borfetso dambaan tuwo geefneyá? Beree si'olits oot'etune.»<verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>Aaninwere Iyesus b́ danifwotssh, «Iti k'ebetwoniye taano k'ebetwe, itsh k'aztso taano k'azre, taan k'aztso taan woshtsoniye b́ k'aziri,» bí eti.<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shabe git wosheetswots boon woshetsoke aanat bowatsok'owo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Shabe git wosheets b́danifwots boon woshetsoke aydek't gene'uwat bo aani, Iyesusokowere t'int́, «Doonzono! n shúútson dab Fo'erawwots noosh alernee» bo et.<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Iyesuswere boosh hank'owo bíet, «Shed'ano darotse guumok'o shap'eyat b́ fed'efere bek're, <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 91:13">Dub. 91:13</ref> </char></note> Eshe hamb! dawuzonat ok'olshon it net'etwok'o, balangari ang jamo it da'itwok'o itsh alo imre, itats gondo bets falitwo ik jago aaliye. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Ernomó it shútso darotsi mezgebíyats guut'etsosh gene'ore bako Fo'erawo itsh b́ aletsosh gene'úk'ayere.»<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́gene'útsok'o b́kitstso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat. 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Manór Iyesus S'ayn shayiron gene'uwat hank'o bí et, «Daronat datsonsh doonz wotts Nihono! keewhan s'ekwotsnat dantswotssh aatsat danawwotssh nkitstsotse neen údere, ee, Nihono! han k'alo n shuno wotere.<verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:35">Yoh. 3:35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">10:15</ref> </char>
    </note> «Jam keewo t nihoke taash imere, naayo koni b́woto nihoniyere okoon konwor dantso aaliye, mank'owa niho koni b́ woto naayo niye okoon wee naayo kitsosh b́ geyirw ashoniye okoon k'osho konwor danetwo aaliye.» <verse eid="LUK 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Maniye okoon Iyesus b́ danifwots maants wongr ett aanat bo aalsh hank'o bí eti, «It it bek'irwan bek'irowots derekne. <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Arikon ay nebiyiwotsnat naashwotsn it bek'irwan bek'osh tewntni bo teshi, ernmó be'aatsno, it k'ebirwanor k'ebosh tewntniye botesh, ernmó shiyatsne.»<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maac' k'ewets Semari dats asho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:25-28 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:35-40">Mat. 22:35-40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mar. 12:28-34</ref> </char>
    </note> Ik aaw Muse nemo daniyf iko Iyesusok b́weyi, bín fadosh geeyat «Danifono! dúre dúri kasho daatsosh eeg k'alo taash geyfa?» ett bíaati. <verse eid="LUK 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Iyesuswere «Nemotse guut'etso eebi? n nababor bítse aak'owe n t'iwintsi?» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lew. 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:5">Iwi. 6:5</ref> </char>
    </note> Ashmanwere «Nemonmo ‹Doonzo Izar Izewernehe n maac'i s'eenon, n kashok'o, ni ang s'eenon, n nib s'eenon, shune,› ando mank'owa k'osh asho n tokok'o wosh de'er shune» etfe bí et.<verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:28 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lew. 18:5</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesuswere «Arikon aniyirne, eshe nee man k'aluwe! dúre dúri kashone daatsitune» bí eti.<verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Muse nemo daniyfonmó b́ tooko kááw asho woshosh geyat́, «Wotowa eré t mashmó kone bí?» ett bíaati.<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Iyesuswere hank'o ett bísh bíaaniy, «Ash iko Iyerusalemitse kesht Iyariko maants oot't bí'amfere weerindatse bik'fwots daatsdek't b́ taho bí'atse kishdek't, jot' isht k'irosh kasho b́ k'as'fere juuk'rat k'az boami. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Kahhini iko dingatoń werind mann bí'amfera b́ teshi, jot' dek't juuk'rets ashman b́ bek'tsok'on eegor bísh b́k'alrawon ashman nad't k'azbiami. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Mank'o Lewawiyo werindmann b́ beshefera b́tesh, bíwere ashman b́ bek'tsok'on eegor bísh b́ k'alrawon k'osh werindon beshat k'azbí'am. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>Semriya eteets dats ashonmó man weeron b́ beshefere ashman maants wáát, bín b́ bek'tsok'on bísh maac'o b́ k'ewi, <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33-34 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2CH 28:15">2 Zen. 28:15</ref> </char></note> B́maand t'int zeyitonat weyiniwon dutsets biro b́ gaawmanats b́ kuut'i, tahonowere bíats s'as'dek't tipb́k'ri, maniye il b́ took dazats bezdek't ib ibuwots k'eef mook dek' bíami, manoknowere sheengshdek't b́ duguní. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Yatsok'on git dinariwotsi kishdek't ibi k'ey maa man doonzsh imt ‹Ashaan sheengshde dugunowe, k'osh gizo nkishiyalowere ti aanor neesh dashetwe,› bí eti.<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>«Eshe, keez ashaanotsitse, biik'tswotsn togeyat dihts ashmansh b́ mashi bísh wottso aawi arefa neesha?»<verse eid="LUK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Muse nemo daiyfonwere, «Bísh maac' k'ewat bín tep'tsmaniye,» ett bí'aaniy.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Iyesuswere «Eshe amee, neewor mank'o k'alwe!» bí eti.<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Martanat Mariyamn mootse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Iyesus b́ danifwotsnton weerindo amfetst gál ikuts bodb́wtsi, manokno Martay eteets mááts iku bgal s'eegbdek'i, <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38-39 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 11:1">Yoh. 11:1</ref> </char></note> Biwere Mariyami eteets mishu detsfa btesh, Mariyami eteetsman Iyesus tufi shirots bedek'at b́ danirw dano bk'ebiri. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Martamó mish k'ac'on aydek't bmawufera btesh, mansh Iyesus maants t'iinat, «Doonzono! t mishhan fin jamo tiats k'azbk'rere bek'fetsat s'k niet eegishe? Oona neesha taash b dabitwok'o bish keewwe!» bi'eti.<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Doonzo Iyesusmó hank'o ett bish bí'aaniy, «Marta Martaye, nee ay keewone n kic'iri, ay keewonowere gondo nbek'iri, <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>Ernmó geytwoniye ik s'uzee, Mariyamwere k'ants keewo galdek'raniye, bínowere biyatse konwor k'a'udek'etwo aaliye.»<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Ik' K'oni Jango b́ danitsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat. 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Ik aaw Iyesus beyok ikoke Ik'o b́ k'onfere b́tesh, Ik' k'ononowere b́ ishtsok'on b́ danifwotsitse iko, «Doonzono! Yohans b́ danifwotssh Ik' k'ono b́ danitsok'o neewor Ik'o k'ono noosh daniwe!» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Iyesuswere, «Ik'o itk'onor hank'o erere bí'et,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">‹Darotse beyiruwo no Nihono!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">Nshútso S'aynee!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">N mengstu wowiye!<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Aaw aawon noosh nomeet misho ime!<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Noon dadtswotssh oorowe noettsok'o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">No morro noosh orowa eree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">Fadeyotsowere noon kindshk'aye› gondatse noon oriwe bakona.»<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Manats dabt Iyesus b́ danifwotssh hank'owa bí'eti, «Aab ititse b́ shunts tooh detstso fa'e erone, b́ toohman t'ú talititson b́ toohman galok amr, ‹T masho, oona neesha keez misho taash gushiwe, <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>T mash ikoniye wokdatson weeron waat b́ eree t t'intsituu misho tt'ut'i!› bí etal <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>Eshe, b́ mootse bede'er, ‹Oona neesha taan kic'ik'aye! fengesho is'k'reke, t nana'uwotswere taantoniye es'atse bok'eyiri, manshe tuur n geyiru misho neeash imosh falratse,› etetwá? <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>B́ mashi b́ wottsosh dab tuur imo b́k'azalor b́ kasho b́ k'uushirwosha err bísh geyits jamo tuurni b́ imetiye etirwe itsha. <verse eid="LUK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>Manshe taawor itsh t keewirwo haniye, k'onwere itsh imetwe, maa fengesho k'ofore itsh k'eshetwe, <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>K'onitw jamo dek'etwe, geyirwonwere daatsitwe, fengesho k'ofirwosho k'eshetwe. <verse eid="LUK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>Ititsnmó nih wotefetst, b́ na'o tusho b́ k'onor shúts imetuwo kone? Mus'o b́ k'oniyal mus'i shegro dawnzo imetwá? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Himó keetso b́ k'oniyal ok'olsho imetwa? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>It gondwotsi wotefetsat it na'osh sheeng keewo imo it daniyakon, darotse fa'o itnihmó bíyoke k'onirwotssh S'ayin shayiro bogshde aak'owe imob́k'azeti!»<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusnat Beel zebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat. 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mar. 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Ik aaw Iyesus noon keewo faliraw fo'erawo gidik' ash iko atsotse b́ kishfera b́ tesh, Fo'rawonwere b́ keshtsok'on gdik'o noon keewo dek't b́ tuwi, ash ashonwere keewhanatse tuutso ayi dek't bo adi. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat. 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref> </char></note> Ik ikuwotsmó, «Fo'erawo b́kishiriye Fo'erawi naash wottso Beel Zebulnee,» bo eti.<verse eid="LUK 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mat. 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1">16:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mar. 8:11</ref> </char>
    </note> K'oshwotswere bín fadbek'o geyat́ darotse milikit iko boosh b́ kitsitwok'o bo aati. <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Iyesusmó bo gitsotse bo gawirwo dank'rat boosh hank'o bíet, «Ik mengsto hake bak kayeyar bí'atsatsewo b́k'aleyetka wotiyal, mengstman t'afa b́t'afiti, mank'o ik maá asho bí atsatsewo b́ k'aleyal dihe b́dihiti. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Mansha shed'ano bí atsatseyo b́ k'aletka wotiyal b́ mengsto ak'ok'alrniya kup'ar need'o b́ faliti? Itiyere ‹Bíhe Fo'erawo b́kishiriye Beelzebulne,› etfte taasha. <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Taa bére, Fo'erawo t kishir Belzebulna wotiyal it nana'úwots bokishir konneya? Manshe it took nana'o dab itats angshitúne. <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Eshe Fo'erawo tkishir taa Ik'i angona wotiyalmó Ik'i mengstu itmaants bwatsok'o dande'ere.<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>«Ash kup' iko t'eesho deshde'er b́ moo b́ kotetka wotiyal b́ gizo sheengshde kotetwe, <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Ernmó bíyere bog asho wáár bín da'abdek'al detsfe bí etts kes'i gino bíatse k'aa'úni b́dek'eti, b́ giz jamonowere bi' de'er kayini b́k'riti.<verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mar. 9:40</ref> </char>
    </note> «T maants woteraw jamó taana b́ k'efiti, tiyok kakuraw jamo bad'iye b́ bad'iyiri.<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kim shayiro ashots aani b́kindo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat. 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>«Kim shayiro ashotse b́ keshor b́ k'ot'okoo geyoke aats aalok dats shuk' jamok b́ guriti, b́ k'ot'it beyoko b́ t'ut'almó ‹T keshts moots aanar amna› bíeteti. <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>Aanar b́ waáfere s'ayintsdek't k'aniyetso datsb́dek'eti. <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>Maniyere il amr biyere gondwotsi k'osh Fo'eraw shawatwotsi de'er b́ weeti, bali biitse b́ beef mootse kind de b́ beeti, ash man il b́wotitwo shintsoniyere iki gonde b́ wotiti.»<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ar wotts geneúo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Iyesus man keewoke b́befere mááts iku ash ash taalotse b́ k'aaro eenshdek'at «Neen shuwat s'atstsu deerekiye,» bi eti.<verse eid="LUK 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Iyesusmó, «Deretswotsiyere Ik'i aap'tso k'ewde'er finats jitsitwotsiye,» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Milikiti jango aatetso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat. 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Ay asho b́maand waat bo kakwetsok'on Iyesus hank'owa ett b́keewu, «S'oot'ahan gonde, milikit bek'e bogeyiri, ernmó nebiyo Yonaskoniye okoon k'osh milikito boosh imeratse. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 3:4">Yoh. 3:4</ref> </char></note> Nebiyiyo Yonas Nenewe kititsi ashuwotssh milikit wotat b́ teshtsok'o mank'o ash na'o and duranatsi s'oot'osh milikit wotitwe. <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lew. 27:30</ref> </char></note> Muur Nugusu angshi aawots and duranatsi s'oot'wotsnton tuur boats angshitwane, bi Selemon dani telefo k'ebosh dats daaratse tuwat waarane, ernmó hambe, Selomoniyere bogo hanoke fa'ee. <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Mank'owoŕe Nenewe kiti ashuwots angshi aawots and duri s'oot'anotsnton tuur angshitwane, Nenewe ashuwots Yonas nabtso boshishtsok'on bo fints morrosh goynatt naandrone etrne, ernmó hambe, Yonasiyere bogo hanoke b́ fa'oni.»<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ash atsatsi c'eesho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat. 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>Manats dabt Iyesus hank'o bí eti, «C'eesho c'eeshde'er dats ashok gedfo, wee oosho bí'ats gúp'shfo konwor aaliye, maniyere dab ashuwotssh máá gitso maants bo kindór b́ shanetwok'o dambaan s'ogatsa bogedfoni. <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Ni atsatsi c'eesho ni ááwoniye. Niááwo jeen b́wotiyal niats jamo sháánon s'eenke b́wotiti, ni ááwo shodk b́wotiyalmó ni ats jamo t'aluwotse b́wotiti. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Manb́wottsosh eshe ni atse fa'a c'eesho t'alu b́woterawok'o niatso korde'e. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Eshe ni ats jamo bíatse t'aluwo b́ deshawo sháánon s'eentso b́wotiyal, c'eesho ayider golor neesh b́shaanifok'o iki golr sháán wotitwe.»<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ferisawiwotsnat Muse nemo danifuwots Iyesus b́ bak'ntsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat. 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mar. 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Iyesus han b́ keewufere ferisawi wotsitse iko aawu misho moowe bí eti, Frisawiwo moots kindt aawu misho moosh mishimarasts t'inbdek'i. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Iyesus misho b́maftsere shino kisho masho b́k'aztsosh ferisawimań bí adi. <verse eid="LUK 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Mansh doonzo Iyesus bísh hank'o bíeti, «It ferisawiwots brc'uk'onat saniy abo s'ayintsatniy it mashiri, it gitsonmó gondonat bík'on ititse s'eengutsi. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>It dartsuwotso! úratstso azts Ik'o gitsitstsonmó azratsa? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>It brc'k'onat it s'awotse fa'o t'owwotssh imere maniye hakon it keewu jamo s'ayino itsh wotituwe.<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>«It ferisawiwotso indowe itsha! ik weeron ak'arshudona, c'ilatamikonat ay k'ac'n maay naruwotsatse tatslo kishirute, k'osh weerono ariko angshonat Ik'i shunonowere k'az it k'riri, ekeewi it k'alor hanowere k'azo itsh geyiratse b́ teshi.<verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>«It ferisawi etetsanots indowe itna, Ayhudi Ik' k'oni mootse beyoki sheengats beyo shunfte, mankoo jebonat gawiyotse ashjamo itn jamo bíatituwok'o it geyiri. <verse eid="LUK 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>Ash ashuwots bo danawo bíabatse boshaíru doowo it artsotse indowe itsha!»<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Muse nemo danifuwtsitse iko Iyesussh, «Danifono, han eto nonor c'ashrne etee!» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Iyesuswere hank'o bíet, «Indowe itsha, it nemo danifuwotssha! ashaats kurimango it kurfoni, itmó kurman dab it kishi jabon t'awiratste.<verse eid="LUK 11:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>«It nihots bo úd'ts nebiyiwots doowo it sheengsh dek'at it doziruwotse, indowe itna! <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Eshe it nihots bo úd'ts nebiyiwotssh bo doowo it finiruwotse itwere bo gond fino tep'iruwotsnat gawuwots itne. <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Manatse tuutson Ik'i dan telefu hank'o etfane, ‹Nebiyiwotsnat woshetswotsi bo maants woshituwe, ik ikuwotsi úd'itúne, ortsuwotsno gondo bek'shitunee, <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Datso bí'azeron tuut kud'ts nebiywotś s'atso, and dúranatsi s'oot'anots angshon aatetúne.› <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>Ariko itsh keewna, Abeelatse tuut wosh t'intseyiru t'arap'ezonat Ik' maa taalotse úd'etso Zekariyaskok b́ borfetso kud'ts s'atsosh and dúrantsi s'oot'anots aatetúne.<verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>«It nemo danifuwots indowe itsha! Dani fengesho bín k'eshet k'ulfiwo it kishatse detsfte, ernmó it it tookosh bíts kindratste, kind geyiruwotsno bo kindrawok'owa it baziri.»<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Iyesus manoke k'ay amoosh b́tuutsok'on nemo danifuwotsnat feriswiwotsn b́keewo k'efat ando ay aato t'intso dek't botuwi. <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>Hań bo k'alirwe b́keewiru keewon bín detsosh geyatni boteshi.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Git alberetsi wotaatsi atso kordek'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mat. 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:6">Mat. 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:15">Mar. 8:15</ref> </char>
    </note> Manoor ay kumon tawet ash ashuwots kakuwe bowutsi, bo aytsatse tuwtsotson bo atsatsewo gifinefetst bo net'eyiri, Iyesus shini b́ danifuwotssh hank'o eto dek't b́tuu. «Ferisawiwots boot' shashatse etonmó bokok'o git alberetsi wotatse it aatso korde'er. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>Ipets keewo wogerawo oreratse, aatsetsonúwere danerawon oreratse. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Eshe t'aluwotse it keewts jamo shanatse shishetuwe, is'eets mootse shashkon it keewtso jebatse sháánon keewetuwe.<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Koni shato b́geyituwok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat. 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>«Itsh tmashootssh hank'o etiruwe, meets mec'ro úd'oniyere oko k'osho eegor k'alosh falrawuwotsi shatk'ayere, <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Ernmó koni shato itsh b́geyituwok'o itsh keewituwe, manuwere b́ úd'iyehakon gahanemits juwosh falituwo aldetstso Ik'oniye; ee, b́ s'uzi sharere etiruwe itsha!<verse eid="LUK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>«Útś dimbitiwotsi tats santimosh kemefoshna? Boyitse ikunwor dab Ik'i shinatse batekiyaliye. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Itkonmó it tooki s'ronuwor jamon dab tawekee, mansh shatk'ayere! it ay dibitiwwotsiye bogfte.»<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus jangosh gawu woto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mat. 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>Manats dabt Iyesus hank'o bí eti, «B́ jitserawo ash shinatse tjangosh gawituwosh ando taawor Ik' melakiwots shinatse b́ jangosh gawituwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Ash shinatse taan halituwosh ando taawere Ik'i melaktiwots shinatse bín haalitwe.<verse eid="LUK 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:32">Mat. 12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:29">Mar. 3:29</ref> </char>
    </note> «Ash Na'o c'ashetuwosh b́ morro bísh orowa etetuwe, S'ayin shayiro c'ashetuwońmó b́ morro bísh orowe eteeratse.<verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>«Ash ashuwots itn Ik' k'oni maa moots bodamor, dats naashuwotsnat datsatse alts ashuwotsn shinats bo t'intsor ‹Eege no'aniytik'úna? Aawuk'o erniya k'úna nokewiti?› Err kic' k'ayere. <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>Keewosh iti geyituwo manoor S'ayin shayro itsh keewituwe.»<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gaalets asho b́ dárts daro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Ash ashi dagotse ash iko Iyesussh, «Danifono, nonih noosh jeshuwo b́ imts datso taash b́ kayish oona neesha, ti eshush keewwe» bí eti.<verse eid="LUK 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Iyesusmó, «Ashono neena, it dagotse angshituwo t wotituwok'onat resity t kayituwo kone taan naashiy?» ett bíaaniy. <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Manats dabt́ jametsuwotssh hank'o bíeti, «Ash kasho b́gizi ayonaliye, manshe it atso korde'er, jaalatsnowere it tooko korde're.»<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Maniye okoon Iyesus ariyetsan hank'o ett b́ keewu, «B́ taaro maayi ay bish b́datsits gaalets ash iko fa'e b́ teshi, <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>Bíwere b́ nibotse, ‹Maay jaman bítś t gas'et́woko t deshawotse aak'owe k'una tk'aliti?› ett b́ shiyaniri. <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>Hank'o bí et, ‹Hank'owa t k'aliti bí et tt'iwu jamo gaahde k'osh een eenuwotsi agetwe, manits t mayona et, tk'ac' jamo bíts kakudek'etuwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Maniye okoon t tookosh, eshnee, ay natosh neesh bodetuwo ay gaalo fa'ee, eshe kashdefets hid'ee! moowe! úyee! genewuowee! etetuwe› bí et. <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>Ik'onmó ‹Nee dogono, hambets t'uwanitse n kasho niatsotse k'a'udek'etwe, eshe n kakuts gaal jaman konshe b́ wotiti?› bí et.<verse eid="LUK 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>«B́ tookosh datsatse gaalo kakuwiruwo, Ik'i shinatse tugrets wottso hank'owe b́wotitiye.»<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Imnetiyo Ik'ats woshdek'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat. 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Maniye hakon Iyesus b́ danifuwotssh hank'o bíeti, «Eshe it kashosh ‹Eege no meeti? Noatsats eege notahiti?› err it beyosh shiyan k'ayere etiruwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Mishoniyere kasho, tahoniyere atso bogfe. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Aak' k'oruwotsi aab s'iilere! bo shohakno, k'ec'akno maay ko'iyet t'iwo wee maay ko'iyetwoko deshakno, b́wotefere, Ik'oni boosh manzir, Itiye kafuwotsiyere ayidek'at bogfte! <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Aab ititse shiyanat b́ beyi dúrats ik aawo dabdek'o falituwo kone? <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Eshe keewi muk'nannor dab k'alosh falrawuwotsi wotefetsat, eegishe k'osh keewosh it kic'iri? <verse eid="LUK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:27 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1 Naash. 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2 Zen. 9:3-6</ref> </char></note> Shiratsi funduwotsi aak'on bo eniruwok'o aab s'iilere, bo finon mawratsno, jokeraatsno, b́wotefere Solomon dab́ b́ mang jamonton boyitsi ikuk'o sheengts taho taheratse. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Eshe, Ik'o hambets be'eyar yats taawots juwetuwo shiratsi tootso hank'o sheengsh b́ takitk wotiyal it amanerwanotsó, itnere bogshde'er takiyalkeya! <verse eid="LUK 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>Mansh ‹Eege nomeeti? Eege nousheti?› err shiyanar k'ic'iftee. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>Hanan datsoshere dastanatsi ash ashuwotswor kic'efno, itmó jaman itsh b́ geyituwok'owo daritstso it Nih danfee. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Shin shino Ik'i mengsto geyore, jam keewanotsi itsh dabetuwe.»<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Datsatse gaalo ko'iyo b́geyirawok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat. 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>«It jir muk'ok'o wottsanotso shatk'ayere, it Nih darotstso mengsto itsh imoshe shunre. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>It detsts jamo kemde'er t'owwotssh imere, narawu k'arc'ito k'anide'er it gizo ump'etso b́ borawok, k'inonuwere b́marawokonat b́ jamonor b́ s'uwurawokok Ik'i mengstots gerde'ere. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>It nibo it gizi beyoke b́ wotiti.»<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kup'at fints guutso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:35 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:1-13">Mat. 25:1-13</ref> </char>
    </note> Manats dabt Iyesus hank'o bí et, «K'awints edde'er finosh jam aawo k'an de'ere, it c'eeshonuwere aat'k wotowe. <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 13:34-36">Mar. 13:34-36</ref> </char></note> Mank'owon, bo doonz jiwi mooke b́waa kotiruwo guutsuwotsi arore, bo bo doonz danerawo waar maá fengesho b́ togor kaari k'eshosh k'an dek'kne. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Bo doonz gawerawo b́ woor, kup'dek't bokotfere b́daatsit guutsuwots aak'o deereknok'uwa? Arikone itsh t keewiry, bí k'awints edde'er boon mishimarats beezituwe, t'inrnwere boosh manzitwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Bodoonz talititson wee talititsoniye okoon b́ wafere botkrerawon kup'ar bín bokotfere b́ daatsitgutsuwots derekne. <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39-40 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 24:43-44">Mat. 24:43-44</ref> </char></note> Andoor man dande'ere, moo doonz úmp'etso weet sa'ato b́ danink'e úmp'etso b́ moo iyde'er b́ kindituwok'o k'ayank'e b́ tesh. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Mank'o Ash Na'o it gawuraw sa'ton it jalerawo, weetuwe, manshe itwor k'ande'er korere.»<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sheeng guutsonat gond guutson</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat. 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>P'et'rosuwere «Doonzono! Jewuron nkeewiruwan noalsheya n keewiri? Himo jamosheya?» ett Iyesusi bí at.<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Doonzo Iyesuswere hank'o et bí aaniy, «Eshe b́ maá ashuwotsi shengde'er b́ k'ezituwok'o b́ guutsuwotssh bo misho boosh eteets aawon boosh imetuwok'o b́ doonz b́ manzish naashiyets amanets s'ek guutso kone? <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>B́ doonz bíamtsoke bí'anefere bísh keewetsok'on b́ finefere b́ daatsituwo awuk'o deereke! <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Ariko itsh keewiruwe, b́ doonz b́ dets jamatse altso woshde'er naashituwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Ernmó gutsman ‹T doonz kaari waratse, teshetwe› err b́ mafere, úyifets, mashefetsr guutsonat gonon jot'o de' b́tuwit. <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>Ernmó b́ doonz b́koraw aawonat b́gawraw sa'aton weetwe, b́ gutsmanowere ayider fayarr b́tooko kawlr b́ gowonoowere woterawwotsnton b́woshiti.<verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>«B́ doonz shunts keewo danfetst k'ande'awo, wee b́ doonz finowe bí ettso k'alraw guutso kup' togona b́ togeti. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Ernmó b́ doonz geyiru keewo daron, bíyats dowet keewo finar b́daatseyal bín fayet fayo ketituwe, ay bísh imetsatse ayo bí'atse geetuwe, ay adaro imets ashoke aye bí'atse geeti.»<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jam keewo k'ayr Iyesus shuuts sha'a</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat. 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>Manats dabt Iyesus hank'owa bí et «Hamb! taa datsats taawo dek'at waare, eshe, kaari taash desh b́gutsink'ere aak'owe t gene'uwiyank'oni! <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:50 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 10:38">Mar. 10:38</ref> </char></note> Ernmó taa t gupet gond bek'i gupeyo detsfe, bíwere b́ s'uufetsosh kashde'atse. <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Taa datsats jeeno tdootsok'o arefa itsha? Taayere tdootso k'aleya bako jenaliye etfe itsha. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Andon tuur ik mootse fa'a úts ashuwots k'aletune, Kezuwots gitetsuwotsats, gituwots kezetsuwotsats bo tuure fayetune. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:53 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mik. 7:6</ref> </char></note> Niho naayo aats, naayonuwere nihoats, indu b́ ni'ats, ni'únuwere b indats, aawunuwere b́ naay maátsuats, naayo máátsunuwere bi awats, tuur bo eree bok'aleti.»<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dúr dani jango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat. 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Dabt Iyesus ash ashosh hank'owa bí et «Dawuno aawu kindo maantse itbek'tsok'owon ‹Hambe! hambets awusho butsishe bíetiri!› etetute, arikon butsetuwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Mank'o muur maantse jongo b́jongor, ‹Hambets aawo k'es'e b́ wotiti› etetute, arkon wotituwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>It git alberetswotso dari maac'o s'ilat wotituwo danr keewitute, eshe and duranatse wotituwo eegishe it dariri?»<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">T'alatonton ik woti jango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat. 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>Maniye hakon Iyesus hank'owa bíet, «Beree it eegishe it it tookon ari keewo dan dek'at angsho it k'azi? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>N t'alato neen s'aamide angshi mook neen de bíamor weerindatse n t'alatonton ik wotosh kup'owe, maniyalbako bi niats angshituwots shinats getsde'er ametuwe, angshituwotsúwere tipetwotssh beshide'er imetuwe, tiptsmanuwere tipi moots kindshituwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>K'awunts jamó im n ishfetso tip mootse kesho nfalrawok'owo neesh keewiruwe.»<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Naandre eraaw jametsuwots t'afitkno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Manoor ashuwots Iyesusok waat, «Gelil ashuwots woosho bo t'intsfere P'ilat'os boon b́úd'i, bo s'atsonowere wooshoonton ekb́k'ri» ett bokeewu. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Iyesuswere hank'o ett boosh bíaaniy, «Eshe, Gelil ashmanots keewi gond jamman bo ats b́bod bo Gelil ash jamotse bog morr fintsuwotsi bowottsosh arefa itsha? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>‹Mank'oyiyaliye, naandre eto itk'azal itwor bokok'o t'afitute› etre itsha. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Selihom gimbiwo bo ats girshat bíere k'irts tatse shmt ashuwots jango aak'owe itsh bíari? Bo Iyerusalemitse beyiru ash jamwotsiyere bogo morretsuwotsi boteshtsok'o arefa itsha? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Mank'oyiyaliye! naandre eto itk'azal itwoor bokok'owa it t'afiti.»<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shuraw belesi mitu bi artsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Maniye hakon Iyesus jewurets keewan b́keewu, «Ash iko b́ woyini mituwots beyoke tokets belesi mitu fa'aniye btesh, belesiy mitmanatse shuwo daatsituwe ett amt datsraniyere b́ oori. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Eshe mituwotsi kotiruwosh ‹Hamb, belesi mitanatse shuwo datsifta etaat keez nato ti anaani, ernmó eegor shuwo daatsratse, andowo k'ut'k'rowe! eegishe datso bi awaashiyiri?› bí eti. <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>Mituwotsi kotiruwonuwere hank'o ett bíaaniy, ‹Doonzono! aab handransh k'ayk'rowe, b gúro goyde'er dats goofituwo b gúrats gedetuwe, <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Gawish shuwo bímal shengre, mank'o woto b́k'zal bin k'ut'k'rewe.› »<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Ik'i aawon jik' k'uur wotts máátsu b́ kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Iyesus Ik'i aawots ayhudiwots Ik' k'oni maa ikotse b́daniyfera b́tesh, <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Manoknowere tatse shmt naton tuwat kim shayro b jiik'o b́k'urits mááts iku fa'a btesh, jik' k'uur b́wottsotse b́ jamon kááwu dek'ofalratsa. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Iyesus bin b́ bek'tsok'on s'eegdek't, «Nee máátsane n shodotse kasherne!» bíet. <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>B́ kishonowere biats b́gedi, manoor kawudek'at ned'bgutsi, Ik'onowere b údi.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:9-10">Kesh. 20:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:13-14">Iwi. 5:13-14</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesus saambati aawon b́ kashitsotse Ik' k'oni maa naasho fayat ash ashosh, «Ik gawuyotse fin finet shrt aawwots fa'ane, aawanotsn waar kashowere, saambati aawonomó kasho woteratse» ett b́ keewi.<verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Doonzo Iyesuswere hank'o ett bísh bíaaniy, «It tooko dambaan detsirwotso, ititse ik iko Ik'i aawon b́ minzi beero k'as'tse kishde'er, wee b́daazo tipotse bishde'er aats b́ úshetuwok damalkeya? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Eshe, Abraham naar wotts máátsan tatse shmt nat s'eeno shed'anon tipeyat b kic'efere teshrane, bi bere, tipeyat bkic'iru shodanitse Ik'i aawon bítse biisho bish geyiratsa?» <verse eid="LUK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>B́ keewts keewannó Iyesus bín k'efiruwotsi jitsi b́k'r, ash ashonmó Iyesus b́ fints adits keewu jamon bo geneúwi.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sinafc'i ááwun ariyetso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat. 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mar. 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Iyesus hank'owa bíet, «Ik'i mengstu eega biari erono? Himó awunton bin nutsiwuta? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Ash iko b́ taritalots b́ shookts snafic'i aawuniye bíari, bi enat mit wotbgutsi, kafuwotswere b jaabats bo kúto agbodek'í.»<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Boot' shasho ariyetso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mat. 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Iyesus aani hank'o biet, «Ik'i mengstu egontoniya t nutsiti? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Ik'i mengstu, mááts iku boot' jamo b́ shashfetso keez tatsi shel buudots baad'i bk'rts boot' shashituniye biari.»<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fengesh t'ebu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat. 7:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Maniye okoon Iyesus Iyerusalem maants amfetst kit kitonat gal galotse daniyfetstni b́ beshefo. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Manoor ash iko, «Doonzono, kashit ashuwots muk'nowa?» ett bíaat.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Iyesus hank'o ett boosh bíaaniy, <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>«Fengsh t'ebun beshosh kup'ore, fengesh mann kindosh geyiruwots aynee, ernmó kindo faleratsne etiruwe itsha. <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>Moo doonz tuur fengesho is'etuwe, itwere úratse bede'er fengesho toofetsr ‹Doonzono! oona neesha noosh k'eshuwe!› eto de'e tuwitute, bíwere ‹Ewukik it wattsok'o danatse!› err itsh bíaniti. <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>Manoor it, ‹Nenton towat marone, towat úshrone, no jebatsnowere danirne› it eteti. <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Dub. 6:8</ref> </char></note> Bíwere aaniy ‹Aawoke it wottsok'o danatse, it gond finets jamanots ti atse wokoore!› bí eteti. <verse eid="LUK 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 22:13">Mat. 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref> </char></note> Abrahami, Yisehak'i, Yak'obi, Nebiyi jamwotsi Ik'i mengstotse bek'etute, itmo úratse juweyar it oror eeponat gash k'asho itats bodetuwe. <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:29</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 8:11-12">Mat. 8:11-12</ref> </char></note> Ay ashuwots aaw kindon aaw keshon, gaarnat muurn weetúne, Ik'i mengstotse mishi marats beetúne. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:30 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Mat. 19:30</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:16">20:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mar. 10:31</ref> </char></note> Mann shintswots shuuts shutstswotswere shintsi wotitune.»<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Iyerusalemsh b́ eptsok'owo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat. 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Manoor ferisawiyotsitse ik ikuwots Iyesus maants t'int «Herodis neen úd'osh b́geyiruwotse hanoke keer amee» bo et.<verse eid="LUK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Ernmó Iyesus boosh hank'owa bíet, wangmansh «Amr ‹Hambetsonat yatson fo'erawo kishitwe, shodetswotsi kashitwe, keezl aawonowere t fino ishitwe› etfe err keewwere. <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Wotowa eree hambetsonat yatson, sharto t weerindo Iyerusalem maants amo taash geyife, nebiyiyo Iyerusalemiye okoon k'osh beyoke k'iro bísh geyiratse.<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>«Iyerusalem! Iyerusaleme! nee nebiyiwotsi úd'irune, n maants wosheets wosh na'úwotsi shútson togirwune, baaku b na'o b gop'shots bkakufok'o, taawere ambtsoto n nana'o kakwo t geyi! ernmó neenat niashwots k'azfone etrte. <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Dub. 118:26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:5">Erm. 22:5</ref> </char></note> Mansh it moo bashone b́ ooriti, arikone itsh tkeewirye, ‹Doonzo shútson wetuwo deereke› it etfetsosh b́ jamon taan be'atste.»<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus ando aani sanbati aawon shodets iko b́kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Sanbati aawots, Iyesus ferisawino eteefuwots naashowutsitsi iko gale aawu mish moosh b́kindi, ferisawiwotsuwere b́k'alituwo s'iilosha bo kotiri botesh. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Manoor shodatse tuutson bíats jamo gaapwutsts ash iko Iyesus shinatse fa'e b́tesh. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Iyesuswere Muse nemo danifuwotsnat ferisawino etefuwotsnsh «Sanbati aawots kashiyo nemotse fa'a?» ett bíaat.<verse eid="LUK 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Boomó eegor boanirawo s'k et bowuts, Iyesus shodts ashman detsdek't kashik'rat daami b́k'r. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Maniye hakon Iyesus, «Ititse sanbati aawots b́ na'o wee b́ minz beero gop'ots b́ fed'iyal manoor kishrawo kone?» ett boon bíaati. <verse eid="LUK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Bo moó egoer aaniyosh falratsno.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">B́tooko dash detsonat ash ibiyon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Iyesus jiwosh s'eegets ash ashuwots mang beyoko desh dek'osh bo bi'efere b́ bek'i, mansh hank'o ariy dek't boosh b́ keewu, <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>«Asho neen jiwo b́ s'eegor beyoki mangok beek'aye, danerake neyere bogo mang asho jiwok s'eegetso beyosh falituwe, <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>Eshe it únetsi s'eegts asho n maants wáár, ‹Beyokan ashaansh fakshuwe› bí eteti, manoor ayide'er jitsefetsr dashani bewokok ood'r nbeti. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Ernmó jiwok n s'eegeyor dashani beyok beewe, mann neen s'eegts asho nmand waar, ‹T mashono! dambanok waa beewe› bí eteet, manoor s'eegets jamwots shinatse mango daatsitune. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat. 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">Luk'. 18:14</ref> </char></note> B́ tooko dambaan detsetu jamo dashan anituwe, b́ tooko dash detsetu jamonmó danmban tuwitwe.»<verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Iyesus jiwu s'eegts ash mansh hank'owa bíet, «Aawu misho wee kooc' misho manzosh nietor bo táron gusho bo anituwok'owa err n jirwotsi, n eshuwotsi, n jaguwotsi, gaalets wotts n giyuwotsi s'egk'aye, <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Ernmó jiwo maanzo n geyor t'owwotsi, bo atso k'ut'tswotsi, duruwotsi, dog wotts ashuwotsi s'ee. <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>Hank'o nk'alitka wotiyal, bo neesh gush aaniyo bofalrawotse nee derek wotitune. Kááwwots k'irotse botuworowere Ik'o neesh aaniytuwe.»<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Een wotts moonat úshon ariyetso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat. 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Mishi maratse bedek't teshtswotsitse iko Iyesus keewutso shisht, «Ik'i mengstotse mishi marats beyo falituwo awuk'o deereke!» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Iyesusmo hank'owa bísh bíet, «Ash iko kooc'ish mishi eeno k'aniyik'rat, ay asho b́s'eegi, <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Jiwi sa'atonwere b́bodtsok'on, ‹Hamb, ún keewo k'anb́wutstsotse jiwo maants woore!› err b́keewish moonat úshon doonz b́ guutso s'eeget ashuwotsok b́ wosh. <verse eid="LUK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>Ernmó s'eegets ash asho ik ikon moonat úshok waá k'azosh weebo t'intso dek'btuu, iko ‹Datso tkeewtsotse amr s'iilo taash geyife, manshe woo t falawotse tiats irk'aye› bí et. <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>K'oshonwere ‹Úts s'ind minz beruwotsi t kewutsotse boon amr bogosh gosho fadbek'o taansh geyife, manshe woo t falwotse ti'ats irk'aye› bí et. <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>K'oshonwere ‹Máátso dek'at guuy twottsotse woo falratse› bí et. <verse eid="LUK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>B́ guutsonwere gál k'az aanat jamman b́ doonzsh b́keewu, moo doonzwere fayat b́ guutsosh ‹Káári kitomaand amr kititsi weeronat weeri kati kayuwotsats amr, t'owwotsi, bo atso k'ut'wotsi, ááwu dogwotsi, shokliru duruwotsi, s'eede'er wowe› bí et. <verse eid="LUK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>Guutsonwere aani waat b́ doonzsh, ‹T doonzo! hambe, taash finowe ni etts jamo fink'rere, ernmó ash beyokon andoor senafa'e› bíet. <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>Mann moo doonz b́ guutsosh hank'o bíet, ‹Tmoo b́ s'eenish gat'ariyo maants amiru weerinduwotsnat weeri kayiwotsats amr k'oshuwotsi s'eede bowetuwok'o woshuwe! <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Bali shino s'egetsmanotsitse ikonuwor t moonat úsho nonots geeratsne!› etfe, etiruwe» itsha.<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus shuuts sha'o bíats juwo geyife</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat. 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Ay asho Iyesusnton bo amfera botesh, bíwere bo maants wongr ett boosh hank'o bíet, <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:37">Mat. 10:37</ref> </char></note> «T maants weetu jamo bí indnat b́ nihn, b́ máátsunat b́ na'on, b́ mishnat b́ eshuwotsn, b́ took kashonor b́wotiyal taayere bogshde'er shunetk b́ wotiyal t danifo woto falratse. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat. 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:24">16:24</ref></char></note> B́ took mask'aliyo kurde'er t shuuts sha'erawo, t danifo woto falratse. <verse eid="LUK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>Ititse aab kone? B́ Gimbi maa agosh b́geyor finman bín b́finet gizo ambtso b́ geyituwok'o shino bede tanerawo iko fa'oni? <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Dashe ago de'er b́ damfere isho b́mawure moo aaisho b́mawor ag isho maawets maá man bek'tsuwots bíats miis'etúnee, <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>‹Hambe, ashaan maa ago dek' tuut, isho mawure› err bomis'eti. <verse eid="LUK 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>Tats kúm kes'tsuwotsi detsts naash iko hiy kúm kes'tsuwotsi dek't bíats weyiru k'osh naashonton kaarosh b́geyiyal shino bín kes' weyiruman kes'o b́falitwok'o danosh bede'rni b́ shiyeti. <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>B́ mawitka wotiyalmó bín kes'o weyiru naashmań wokoon b́ befere manosh wosh nana'uwotsi b́ maants woshar mano bí aatiti. <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Mank'owa ititse b́detstso t jangosh ett k'azk'rerawo t danifo wotosh falratse.»<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woteraw beero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat. 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mar. 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>Manats dabt Iyesus hank'owa bíet, «Beero sheeng, beronmó b́shaawo b́ t'ut'al aak'o k'alrniya shaawo b́ faliti? <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Han naari beero goshi daatsosh wotowá dats goofiwosh b́ woterawotse manoor kishde'er juwni k'reti, shiy waaz detstso shiye!»<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s">T'aft daatsets mereero ariyetso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat. 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>T'ilish koiruwotsnat morrets jamwotsn b́ daniyman shishosh Iyesusok waatni botesh. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 5:29-30">Luk'. 5:29-30</ref> </char></note> Ferisawiwotsnat Muse nemo danifuwotsn man bek't «Hanuwo morretsúwotsi b́ t'itsiri, bontonu ikoke b́ meyiri» ett Iyesus ats bo mumundi. <verse eid="LUK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Mansh Iyesus ariyets keewuman hank'o ett boosh b́ keewi.<verse eid="LUK 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>«Ititse bal mereer detstso baluwotsitse ik mereero b́ shirotse b́t'afiyal bal bodosh ik shapo bodootse k'ay k'raŕ t'aftsman b́ datsfetso gee amawo kone? <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Daats b́dek'oro gene'úwefetsr b́mangrats kurde'er aani b́weti. <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>B́mook waa b́bodtsok'on b́ jaguwotsnat b́ giyuwotsn iknon s'ede'er ‹T mereer t'aftso daats t dek'tsotse geneúwere itwere geneúwore!› etetuwe. <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Naandre eto boosh geyiraw balosh ik shap ash shengwotsiyere naandre etetu moorrfints ash iko jangosh darotse gene'úwo wotituwe etiruwe.»<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">T'afat daatsets ambari santimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>Manats dabt Iyesus hank'owa bíet, «Tats ambari santimuwotsi detsts máátsu tats santim manotsitse iku b́shirotse bt'afiyal c'eesho c'eeshde'er, b́ moo fohde b́ shirotse t'afts santimu b́datsfetso kup'sh de geyiyalkneya? <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Datsbdek'tsok'on b shuntswotsnat b giyotsi ikn s'eede'er ‹T'afts t santimu dats t dek'tsosh geneúwere, gene'ore!› etee tuwaniye. <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Naandre etet́ moorrets ash iko jangosh darotse Ik'o melakiwotsoke mank'o geneúwo wotituwe etiruwe itsha.»<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">T'aft daatsets na'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Manats dabt Iyesus hank'owa bíet, «Ash iko git nanauwotsi detsfe b́tesh, <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Muk'efo b́ nihsh ‹Tniho, n gaalotse kayide'er t bano taash ime› bí et. Mann niho b́gaalo b́ nana' gituwotssh kayibk'r. <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>Muk' aawoniye okoon muk'efo b́ gizo ko'idek't wok datso k'azbimi, dats manatsnowere b́ giz jamo dats mec'ron bad'i b́k'ri. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>B́giz jamono ishb́bazihakon datsmanatse kup' wotts k'ak'o b́kindtsotse kic'ats dihbutsi. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Mansh datsmanatsi ashuwotsitse ikok t'iin b́ de'e ashmanwere gúrits jinosh bín gedb́dek'i. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Gúritswots bomeyiruwatse k'oro maar bín b́ maac'o s'entsdek'osh b́tewunfo b́teshi, ernmó manoor bish imetuwo aali. <verse eid="LUK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>Manoor na'man dartsi b́ woto t'iwintsdek't hank'o bíet, ‹T nih gale keeweyat finiru guutsuwots misho boworfetsosh maarr booe're orefuwots ambtsno! taa eshe hanoke k'ak'one t k'iriri, <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Tuur t nihok amŕ, tnih ababo, Ik'onat neen shinatse naandre, <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Haniye hakon n naayi err segeyosh boratse, ernmó guutsuwotsitsi ikok'o taash k'aluwe erna.› <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>Mansh tuut niho maants bíami. B́nihuwere wokoon b́befere b́ naayi bek'b́k'ri, maac'o k'ewatnuwere b́maants b́wos'i matdek'tnuwere b́ joobi. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Na'onuwere, ‹T nih ababo, Ik'onat nshinatse naandre, haniye hakon nnaayi eteyar segeyosh bodk taanaliye› bí eti. <verse eid="LUK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>B́nihmó b́ guutsuwotsi s'eegdek't hank'o bíeti, ‹Káári amr jamotse k'ants taho de'ewaar bísh takuwere! b́ jabotso k'ubelo, b́ tufotso c'aamo gerere! <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>K'otsts minz úro de'ewar shuhere! móóne! gene'one! <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>T naayhań k'irtniye b́teshi, hamb́ and kashon fa'ee, t'aftniye b́teshi, daatsere› geneonowere dek'et bo tuwi. <verse eid="LUK 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>Manoor na'a eenfo tarots amtni b́tesh, aanat b́waafere mook b́t'intsok'on duubonat k'afi k'aro shish b́k'ri, <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>B́guutsuwotsitsi iko s'eegdek't Eebi b́naroni? Ett bíaati. <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>B́ guutsonuwere ‹Ni eshuye aanat b́ watsotsne, nnih jeenon b́ datstsosh k'otsts minz wúro bísh b́shuki› bí et.<verse eid="LUK 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>«Eshu eenonuwere ay dek't fayat, ‹Moots kindratse› bí eti. Mansh niho úratse kesht b́kindituwok'o b́ k'oni, <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>B́naymo nihosh hank'o ett bíaaniy, ‹Hamb ambts dúrosh neesh finere, ni'aalotse hank'o borawu shapi danaktane, ernmo taa ttohuwotsnton bín t geneúwituwok'o eyish buk'ul iko dab im danakne! <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>N na'anmó n gizo Woteraw máátsuwotsnton bad'ik'rat bíaanor k'otsts minzi úro bísh nshuki.› <verse eid="LUK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>B́ nihwere hank'wa bíet, ‹T naayo, neye úni aawo taantoniye n fa'oniye, t detsts jamoniye nike. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Nieshu hanmo k'irtni b́ teshi, and aaniy kashon b́ daatseyi, t'aft b́ teshtsotse, and daatsere, mansh ayide'er gene'o noosh geyife.› »<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Amaneraw jintso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Ando aani Iyesus b́ danirwotssh hank'o bíeti, «Gaalets ash iko b́ mootse b́ detsts giz jamo bísh k'eezitu jints iko detsfe b́tesh. Ashuwots ‹N meyitsi jintsan n gizo bad'iye b́ badiyri› ett gaaltsmansh bo numi. <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>Galetsmanwere jints man s'egiit ‹N jangosh t shishiruwan eebi b́naroni? Haniye okoon t mootse jints wotosh n falrawotse jinosh n dek'ts t gizonat k'ac'on taash aab t'ntsuwe› bíet. <verse eid="LUK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>Jintsmanwere bí nibots hank'o ett b́ gawi, ‹aak'o t k'ale k'una k'aniti taasha? Goshosho ango deshatse, falratse, k'onoshowere taane b́ jiitsiti, <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Bete! taa t k'alituwo danfee, t jinf finanatse taan gishewor, bo moots taan bezit jaguwotsi kishde'na.›<verse eid="LUK 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>«Mann b́doonzatse giz gushts jamwotsi ik ikon s'egdekt, shintsosh ‹T doonzsh n dashetuwo gusho ambtse ni atse fa'oni?› ett bíaati. <verse eid="LUK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>Bíwere ‹Bal kor zeyito gusho tiatse fa'e› bí et, jintsmanwere, ‹N faramtso wuliyo hambe kaari waa bede' balk'ats kora err guud'e› bíet. <verse eid="LUK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>Gitlono s'eegdek't, ‹ni'atse fa'o gusho ambtse?› bí et. Bí were ‹Bal arw sndeye tiatse fa'oni› ett bíaaniy. Jints manuwere ‹Hambe nfaramats wuliyoni! habi gita err guud'e› bí et. <verse eid="LUK 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>B́ doonzwere amaneraw jintsman s'eko bek't bín b́údi. Manuwere Ik'i ashuwotsiyere datsatsi ashuwots bo datsatsi beyosh s'ek bowotoniye b́kitsiri.<verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gizo niwuron koto b́geyiytuwok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>«Manshe datsanatsi gondon ko'iyets gizone jago kishde'ere etiruwe itsha, man it k'aliyale it gizo b́ s'uure kish basho it oror it jag manots dúre dúrosh bo beyiru mootse iten dek'etúne. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Muk' keewwatse amanets asho een keewatsnowere amaneke b́wotiti, múk' keewatse amanerawonwere een keewatse amaneratse. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Eshe datsnatsi gaalo k'eezosh amaneratste wotiyal arik wotts gaalatsnmo kone amanar itsh imeti? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Ando k'osh ash gizatse amaneratste wotiyalmó itsh wotituwo detso kone itsh imeti?<verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 6:24">Mat. 6:24</ref> </char>
    </note> «Ash iko iknon git doonzwotssh keeweyo falratse, man b́wotiyalmo, iko shid'r ikoni b́shuneti, iko mangiyir iko gac'ituwe, mank'o Ik'onat gizonsh keeweyo falratste.»<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Ferisawiya eteefuwots giz shunk bowottsotse, Iyesus keewutsman shisht bí keewo bogac'i. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Bímó hank'wa boosh bíet, «It it tooko ash shinatse kááw it wottsok'owa it ariyri, Ik'onmó it nibitstso danfee, ash shinatse mang detsts araat be'eyiruwo, Ik'i shinatse shit'eke.»<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nemonat mááts dek'i jangon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat. 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar. 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat. 11:12-13</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesus b́ keewmaanats dabt hank'o bíet, Nemonat nebiyiwots mas'afwots Gupfo Yohansok b́borfetsosh keewefera botesh, maniye hakono keeweyiruwo Ik'i mengsti misiraci jange, ash jamonwere mengst manits kindosh kup'at b́ finiri. <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 5:18">Mat. 5:18</ref> </char></note> Wotowa eree, Muse nemotse dab k'op' iku b t'afoniyere daronat datson bo besho ketefe. <verse eid="LUK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat. 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10-11">1 K'or. 7:10-11</ref> </char></note> «B́ máátsu fakshr k'osh maatsu dek'etuw jamo gobetsiye. mank'o b́ kenihatse faksheets maatsu dek'etuwo gobetsi bwotiti.»<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gaalets ashonat tugretso Alazarn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>Manats dabt Iyesus hank'o etre, «Gizi shaawon keewets tahi biro tah dek'ts gaalets iko fa'e b́tesh, bíwere aaw aawon beyi sheengo b́befoni. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Bíats jamó gaawu wottso Alazari eteetso t'oowo ando gaaletsman máá fengeshatse b́k'eefoni, <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>T'owmanwere, gaaletsman mishi maratse fed'iru mishi fed'man moosh b́joolfo, kanwotswere waar b́ gawo bolep'efoni.<verse eid="LUK 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>«Maniyehako t'owman k'irb́wutsi, melakiwotswere Abraham ganok dek't boami, ando gaaletsman b́ k'irre dukeyi. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>Siolitsnowere b́ kic'efere, b́ tooko dambaan kááwdek't́ b́s'ilfere Abrahamnat b́ ganoke fa'o Alazari wokoon b́k'b́k'ri. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>B́ k'áárono eenshdek't hank'owa bíet, ‹Niho Abrahamo! oona neesha! taash maac'o keewowe! taw lalwanitsne aydek'at tkic'iruwotsene b́ kishi jaabo aatsots gufde'er ti albero bíak'itwok'o Alazari tmaants woshdyiwe!›<verse eid="LUK 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>«Abrahammó hank'owa bísh bíet, ‹T naayo, nee datsatse n kashon n beets dúron ay sheeng beyo daatsat n gene'útsok'o gawude'e, Alazarmo gond bek'owotse b́teshi, manshe hanoke bí and b́ genee'úwor nemon n kic'iri. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Jamanatsnmó itnat noon dagotse gohi eeno fa'ee, mansh nomande it maants, it maantse nomand kímo falituwo konuwor aaliye.› <verse eid="LUK 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>Galetsonwere hank'o bíet, Nihono, bere oona Alazari tnihi mook n woshituwok'o neen k'oniruwe, <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>Oke uts eshuwo detsfe, ando manots kic'anok kindosh bowarawok'o amr boosh keewwe. <verse eid="LUK 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>Abrahammo ‹Musenat nebiyiwots mas'afwots boosh fa'ane, boon k'ewune› bí eti. <verse eid="LUK 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>Ash gaaletsmanuwere ‹Woteratse! niho Abrahamo, ik asho k'irotse tuur amr b́keewink'e goyinar nandrone etank'ne› bí et. <verse eid="LUK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>Abrahamuwere ‹Musenat nebiywots mas'fwots bo etiruwo k'ewatsno wotiyalmá ik asho k'irotse tuur b́keewiyalor amaneratsne› bí eti.»<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s">Ashosh t'ug wotatse atskordek'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat. 18:6-7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mar. 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Iyesus b́ danifuwotssh hank'owa bí et, «Ashuwotsi gandde'er moorrots dikit keewwots bo woo oreratse, ernmó morrots dikosh t'ug wotitu man wotk'ayna! <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Konwor wotowa asho, múk'nananotsitse dab iko gand de'er dikitwoniyere di'i shútso b́bimbats tifde aats k'arots bín juwk'rewo k'aniyank'e bísh. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 18:15">Mat. 18:15</ref> </char></note> Eshe it tookish it atso korde'ere! ni eshu neen b́dadiyal fayowe! b́ t'afiyo danr naandre bí etal bísh orowe eree! <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Ik aawon shawatoto neen b́ dadiyal err ik aaw manots n maants waar ‹T t'afitsosh goynere› bí etal bísh orowa eree.»<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>B́ woshtswots doonzo Iyesussh «Oona neesha imnetiyo noosh dabuwe» bo et. <verse eid="LUK 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Doonzo Iyesuswere «Fuk'i aawi fetshuk'o imnetiyu it detsink'e fuk'i mitansh ‹Hanoke wad'ar aats k'arots kokewe!› it etink'ere itsh aleyank'e» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Guuts sheengo k'alo bín b́geyiytuwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>Manats dabt́ Iyesus hank'owa bí et, «Ititsi iko gosh goshfo wee mereer jinf guutso detstso, b́ guutso finoke bí aantsok'on guutsosh ‹Waa bede n kooc'misho moowe› etetuwa? <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Maniyere ‹Eree! t kooc'misho taash k'aniwe, maar t úyfetsosh tuumr taash finowe, maniyere okoon ando nee maar úshetune› etetuwoshna? <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Eshe, guutso bísh finowe eteetso ee ett b́ fontsotse b́ doonz bín b́ údituwok'o arefa itsha? <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Itwoor mank'o it finituwok'o itsh keewets jamo fin it k'rtsok'on, ‹K'awuntsalk guuts noone, no k'altsosh noon údo geyiratse› erere.»<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Een shodets tats ashuwotsi Iyesus b́kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Iyesus Iyerusalem maants bí amor Semarinat Gelil dagona b́ beshi. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Gal ikuts b́ kindtsok'on, tats een shodetsuwots b́ maants waat wokoon need' boguts, <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>Bok'aronowere eenshdek't «Iyesuso, danifono, oona neesha noosh maac'o k'ewowe!» ett bokuhi.<verse eid="LUK 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lew. 14:1-32</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesuswere boon s'iilt «Ameree! It atso kahniwotssh kitsuwere!» bí et.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Bowere amoke bobefere bo een shodatse kashbowuts. <verse eid="LUK 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Boyitsi iko bí een shodotse b́ kashtsok'owo b́ bek'tsok'on Ik'o udfere aanat b́waa. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Iyesusnowere údefetst́ b́tufi shirots b́dihi, bímo Semary dats asha b́ tesh. <verse eid="LUK 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Iyesuswere hank'owa bí et, «Een shodotse kashtsuwots tatsnosha boteshi? Eshe, tatswots aabno? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Ik'o údosh aanat waatso k'osh jirani bako k'osho dab iko datseratsaá?» <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Maniye hakon Iyesus ash mansh, «Tuur amee, n imnetiyo neen kashire» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik'i mengsto bweetuwok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat. 24:23-28</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Ferisawiwots Iyesussh, «Ik' mengstu awure b weti?» ett bo aati. Bíwere hank'o ett boosh bí aani, «Ik'o mengstu wáá woo ash ashuwots bo kotiruwok'onaliye, <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>Konwor ‹Hambiye, hanoki ye wee ekewokiye› etetkiyaliye, hamb Ik'o mengstu it dagotsiye.»<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Manats dabt Iyesus b́ danifuwotssh hank'o bíet, «Ash Na'o aawwotsitse dab iku bek'osh it mirac'it aawo weetuwe, ernmó be'atste. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Ashuwots ‹Hambe, Krstos hanoke b́ fa'oni! wee ekewoke b́ fa'oni!› etetúne, ernmó amk'ayere, boshutso shoy k'ayere. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Guumo darotse b́ p'alk'or ik maants dats daaratse tuut k'osh dats daarats b́ golfok'o ash na'o b́ weet aawots mank'owe b́ wotiti, <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Ernmó Ash na'o shino ayide gond bek'o tí ats bodo geyife, and dúri s'oot'wotsnowere gac'ewonat k'efeyo oritkaliye. <verse eid="LUK 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:26 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 6:5-8">Aze. 6:5-8</ref> </char></note> Noh dúr wottsi naaro taa Ash na'o t wooror mank'o b́ wotiti. <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:27 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 7:6-24">Aze. 7:6-24</ref> </char></note> Noh markabuts b́ kindfetso ash ashuwots mafetst, úshfetst, dek'fetst de'efetstni botesh, manoor t'afits atso waat jametsi k'ot'dek' t'afi b́k'ri. <verse eid="LUK 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:28-29 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 18:20-19:25">Aze. 18:20—19:25</ref> </char></note> Mank'owa ando Lot' dúr b́ wottsi naaro wotituwe, manoor ashuwots maat bo ushfere, kemt bokeewefere, atkltiyo kokeftst moo bo agfera bo teshi. <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>Ernmó Lot' Sedomitse b́ keshts aawots tawonat diniyon darotse butst jametswotsi t'afibk'ri. <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>Taa Ash na'o t be'ewotso mank'o wotitwe.<verse eid="LUK 17:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:31 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:17-18">Mat. 24:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:15-16">Mar. 13:15-16</ref> </char>
    </note> «Manots b́ máá tokatse kesht beyiru asho b́meyitsi k'ac'dek'o oot' k'aya, gooshok amt fa'o b́gal aanar waak'aye. <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:32 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 19:26">Aze. 19:26</ref> </char></note> Lot' máátsu b wottsok'o gawude'ere! <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:33 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat. 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luk'. 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yoh. 12:25</ref> </char></note> B́ kashu oori dek'o geyiru jamo bin t'ut'etuwe, b́ kasho beshide imetu jamo wooriydek'etuwe. <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Manots t'ú git ashuwots ik es'atse k'eetúno, boyitse ikonowere dek'etuwe, ikonúwere oorituwe. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Mááts gitetswots ikoke ik di'i shútsatse tohar dio di'ituno, iku dek'etuwe, iku oorituwane. [ <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>Git ashuwots tar ikotse goshfere, iko dek'etuwe, iko oorituwe.»]<verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>B́ danifuotswere Iyesussh, «Doonzono, ewuke dek' ameyiri» ett bo aati.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Bíwere «Duuni beyoke k'orwotsuwere kakuwetúno» ett boosh bíaaniy.<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s">T'owu máátsunat gond naashon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Maniye hakon, Iyesus bo tahrawon jam aawo Ik' k'ono boon b́ geyituwok'owo daniyosh aryidek't hank'o ett boosh b́ keewu, <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>«Kit ikutse Ik' sharawo, ashono jitseraw naash iko fa'e b́teshi. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Kit manitse keniyal t'owu mááts ikunu bbefo, bi naashmanok waat ‹T balangaronton t detsts moosho taash angshwe!› bi etfoni. <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>Bíwere bish b́ k'oorrawon ayo b́ ja'a, ilmó hank'o ett bíasabi, ‹Dab Ik'o shato tk'azalor, ashono jitso t k'azalor, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>T'owu máátsan taan k'eezo bazaat taan b taahitsotse bish k'oorituwe, maniyalbako uni aawo anaanar taane b tahiyiti.› »<verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Manats dabt Doonzo Iyesus hank'owa bíet, «Mor gond naashman keewtsman t'iwintsde'ere, <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Eshe Ik'o, t'uwe aawo kuh dek't k'oniru bí ashuwotssh angshiyalkeyá? Batarnmó boosh b́ k'alitwo jaítúwáá? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>B ja'arawon karr boosh k'oorituwe etiruwe. Ernmó taa Ash Na'o aanar t woor datsatse imnetiyo datsifak'una?»<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Feresawiya eteefonat t'ilish ko'ifon ariyetso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Manats dabt Iyesus Ik' shuntsok'on beyiruwots noone etfetst it'fetst koshuwotsi gac'iru ashuwotssh aryidek't man b́keewu. <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>«Git ashuwots Ik' k'onosh, Ik'i moo maants bo am. Iko ferisawiya eteyiruwo b́ wotor ikonmó t'ilish ko'ika b́tesh.<verse eid="LUK 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>«Ferisawiya eteyiruman b́nibotse hank'o ett Ik'o b́ k'on, ‹Ik'ono! taa k'osh ashuwotskok'o bik'tsi, weral fintso, widetso wot tk'aztsosh neesh udo boree, bitsnor t'ilish ko'ifank'o wototk'aztsotse neen udere. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Taa ik gawiyotse git aawo s'oomiruwe, t daatsiru jamotse tatslo kishdek'at imiruwe.›<verse eid="LUK 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>«T'ilish ko'ifmanmo wokoon need'dek't́, daromaand kááwdek' s'ilosh dab shatfetstni b́tesh, ernmó b́ kishon b́ gero k'is'fetst, ‹Ik'ono! taa morretsk tane taash maac'o k'ewowe!› bí etiri, <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat. 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luk'. 14:11</ref> </char></note> Ik'i shinatse kaawu wotat b́ gal antso eshe t'ilsh ko'ifmaniye bako ferisawiya eteyirumaniyaliye etiruwe itsha, b́ tooko damb detsiru jamoniye dash oot'etwe, b́ tooko dashan detsirwonmo dambaan keshetuwe.»<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus nanaúwotsi b́deertsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat. 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mar. 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Ashuwots nana'o b́ shú'ituwok'o Iyesus maants dek't bowáá, b́ danif'uwots man bek't boon fayi. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Iyesusmó nana'uwotsi b́ maants s'eegdek't hank'owa bíet, «Ik'i mengstu hanots k'owuwotssh b wottsotse nana'uwotsi k'ayere tmaants wonee, bazik'ayere. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Arikoniye itsh tkeewiri! Ik'i mengtu na'i marmat'ok'o wotar de'awoniye konuwor b́wotiyal bits kindratse.»<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Datsatsi gaalonat darimengston</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat. 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mar. 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Ayhudi naashuwotsitse iko Iyesussh, «Danif doowono, dure dur kasho daatsosh eeg k'alo taash geyifa?» ett bíaatí.<verse eid="LUK 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Iyesuswere «Eegoshe doowono taash nietiri? Ik' ikoniyere okoon doowo konuwor aaliye. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Kesh. 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Iwi. 5:16-20</ref> </char></note> Nokotetwok'o bímts nemonuwotsi danfnee, boowere ‹Wido amk'aye, úd'k'aye, úmp'k'aye, kooton gawuk'aye, nindnat t nnihn mangiwe› etetsuwotsiye.»<verse eid="LUK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Ashmanwere «Hanotsnma t naortson tuuzat kotdek're» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Iyesus man b́shishtsok'on ashmansh, «Beree ik keew nk'alituw oor fa'ane, n detsts jamo kemde b́ gizo t'owwotssh ime, darotse kakuwets gaalo daatsitune, maniye hakono waar tshutsats sha'owe» bí et. <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Ashman ayidek't gaaletsko b́ teshtsotse, man b́ shishtsok'on ayidek't shiyanb́guts. <verse eid="LUK 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Iyesusere ashman b́shiyantsok'o bek'k'rat, hank'owo bíet, «Gaaletsosh Ik'i mengstots kindo aak'owe kic'ike! <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Gaaletso Ik'i mengstots b́kindoniyere, kambulo mafi fúron b́ besho ketefe.»<verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Man shishts ash jamo, «Hank'owon bere kone fal kashiti?» bo et.<verse eid="LUK 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Iyesusmó, «Ashoke maawets keewo Ik'oke faleke» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>P'et'rosuwere «Hamb́, noo no detsts jamo k'azk'rat n shuutso shoy dek' sha'erone» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Iyesuswere hank'o boosh bíet, «Arikon itsh keewiruwe, Ik'i mengst jangosh ett b́ moo wee b́ máátsú wee b́ eshuwotsi wee bí indnat b́ nihn k'azts asho, <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>And datsanatse gitkishoniye bogo ay daatsituwe, weet datsatsnowere dure duri kasho daatsituwe.»<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́k'iri jangonat k'irotse b́tuwi jango keezlo b́keewtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat. 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mar. 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Iyesus b́ danif tatse gituwotsi b́ maants t'intsdek't hank'o bí et, «Hamb! Iyerusalem maants amishee, Ash na'o jangosh nebiyiwotsn keewets jamó manoke s'eenetwe. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Bín Ik' ash woterawwots kishats beshide imetuwe, boowere bí atso s'udetuno, bíno c'ashetuno, bín aatsniytune. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Bo jod'i hakon úd'ituno, ernmó keezl aawots k'iro da'er tuwituwe.»<verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>B́ danifuwots keew jamanitse dab ikunor t'iwintsratsno, b́ keewiru keewwots biitso boosh ash bwutsitsosh eeg bíetiruwok'o danatsno.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Iyesus Iyariko maants b́ t'intsok'on ááwu dog iko weri guratse bedek't b́ k'onir b́tesh. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>B́ ganoke beshiru ay ashuwots k'aro b́ shishtsok'on «Eebi b́ naaroni?» ett bí at.<verse eid="LUK 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Ash ashuwotswere «Hambe! Nazrettso Iyesus han weerone beshoke b́ fa'oni» ett bokeewu.<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Mann ááwu dogo, «Dawit naay Iyesuso! oona taash maac'o k'ewowe!» ett b́ kuh.<verse eid="LUK 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Shin shino amiru ashuwots, «S'k eree!» ett bo fay. Bímo b́ k'aro iki bogshdek't, «Dawit naayo! oona neesha taan maruwe!» etfetst b́tesh.<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Mansh Iyesus need'dek't «T maants dowere» ett b́ keewu. Ááwu dogonwere b́waatsok'on, hank'o ett bíaat, <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>«Neesh eeg tk'ale n geyi?» bí et. Ááwu dogonwere «Doonzono! bek'oshe tgeyiri» bíet.<verse eid="LUK 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Iyesuswere «S'iile! n imnetiyo neen kashire» bíet.<verse eid="LUK 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Ááwu dogonwere manoor bek'o b́fal, Ik'onowere udefere Iyesus shuutso shoy dek't b́ tuu, ash jamonuwere man bobek'tsok'on Ik'o bo udi.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesusnat Zekiyosn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Iyesus Iyarikó kitots kindt man weeron beshat bí amí. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Manoknowere t'ilsh ko'ifuwotsats naasho Zekiwosi eteef gaalets ash iko fa'e b́ tesh. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Bí Iyesus aawi b́ wottsok'o bek'osh b́ geefera b́ tesh, ernmó b́ need'o k'awun b́ wottsatse ashonwere ay b́wotsosh bek'o maaw b́ wuts. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Iyesus man weeron b́beshirwotse Zekiwos bín bek'o geeyat ashuwots wos't fuk'i mit abaats keshb́dek'i. <verse eid="LUK 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Iyesuswere manok am b́bodtsok'on dambaan kááwdek't s'iilt Zekiwossh, «Zekiwoso! hambets n mootse jino taash b́ geyiytuwotse káári mitatse ood'e» bí et. <verse eid="LUK 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Zekiwoswere káári oot't, gene'úwefetst Iyesusi ibiyosh dek't bíami. <verse eid="LUK 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Man bek'ts ash jamo «Ashaan morretso moots s'eegere ibo amt kidre!» ett Iyesus ats bo mumudi.<verse eid="LUK 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Zekiyosmó need'dek't doonzo Iyesussh hank'owobíet, «Doonzono! hambe, t detsts gaal jamotse b́ bado t'owwotssh imetuwe, dirshat ashaatse t dek'ts gizo b́beyalowere, awd kisho woshde'er aaniytuwe.»<verse eid="LUK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Iyesuswere hank'owa bíet, «Ashaan Abraham naar b́ wottsotse hambets kasho máánsh wotere, <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 18:11">Mat. 18:11</ref> </char></note> Ash na'o b́ weyiye t'aftso geeyar kashiyoshe.»<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tats guutsuwotsi ariyetso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat. 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:11-27 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat. 25:14-30</ref> </char>
    </note> Ashuwots man k'eboke bobefere Iyesus keewu iko ando jewrdek't b́keewi, bíwere Iyerusalem maants b́ karntsotse ash ashuwots Ik'i mengstu andon b́be'etwok'o boosh bíartsosha b́tesh. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Mann Iyesus hank'wa bíet, «Nugus woti alo k'a'u de'k't aanar wosh wok datso amts naasho fa'e b́tesh, <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Bí amftsre shino b́ guutsuwotsitse tatswotsi s'eegdek't bo took tookosh ik ik minaniyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Minaniya: </char><char style="ft">Ik minaniyo ik ash keez shashi damoze. </char></note> imt ‹Aanar twafetsosh gizan jahere› bí et. <verse eid="LUK 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>B́ dats ashuwotsmo bín boshit'fotse, ashaan noatsats b́ naasho geeratsone ett bí amiyakon wosh na'o bo wosh.<verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>«Ash man nugus wotat bíantsok'on boosh imets gizon jaakt awuk'o bo oorshtsok'o danosh, gizo imt bíamts b́ guutsuwotsi b́ s'eegiyi. <verse eid="LUK 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>Shints guutso t'int, ‹Doonzono! n imts ik minaniyon hamb tats minaniyo oorshre› bí et. <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>B́ doonzuwere ‹Nee sheeng guutsono! sheenge nfini, muk' keewatse amanek nwottsotse taamo neen tats kitatse alo neesh imre› bí et. <verse eid="LUK 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>Gitl guutsonwre t'int ‹Doonzono! taash n imts minaniyo hambe, uts minaniyo oorshre› bí et. <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>Doonzonuwere hansh ‹Nenowere uts kitatse naashire› bí et.<verse eid="LUK 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>«Keezlonwere t'int hank'o bíet, ‹T doonzo! taash n'ímts gizoniye hambe, but'ots k'undek'atniye ged t k'ri b́ teshi. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Man t k'aluwere nee ngeraw dek'etuwo, n shohawo kakuwituwo, maac' kup' n woto danat t shattsatsne› bíet. <verse eid="LUK 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>B́ doonzwere ‹Nee gond guutsono! n keewts keewann niats angshetuwe, taa t geerawo dek'etk twotonat tshohawo kakuwitk maac' kup' asho t woto danrnee, <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Beree t gizo oot' daatsit bankiyo eegoshe gedo n k'azi? Taa aanar twoor b́ oot'onton dek'anek'e b́ teshi› bí et. <verse eid="LUK 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>Maniyere hakon doonzman, manoke need'dek't teshtswotssh, ‹B́ minaniyo bíatse de'er tats minani detsts guutsosh imere› bí et. <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Bowere ‹Doonzono! bíyere tats minaniyo detsfe!› bo et. <verse eid="LUK 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mat. 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mar. 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luk'. 8:18</ref> </char></note> Doonzonuwere ‹Detsts jamosh iki bogoshde dabetuwe, deshawoknmo dab b́ detstsonor bíatse k'a'udek'etwe etiruwe. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Boatsats t naasho geerawu t t'elatmanotsnomó hanok dewar tshinatse boon úd'uwere!› » bíet. <verse eid="LUK 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Iyesus man jewuron b́keewihakon b́ weerindo Iyerusalem maants sha'efetst, b́ danifuwots shin shinatse bíamir b́tesh.<verse eid="LUK 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus een mangon Iyerusalemits b́kindo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat. 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar. 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoh. 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Iyesus Debrezeyit guro ganoke fa'u Bete Fagenat Betaniyi maants b́t'intsok'on, b́ danifwotsitse gituwotsi hank'o ett b́ wosh, <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>«It shinatse fa'a galuts ameree, manok it bodtsok'onowre konúwor bíats be b́ danawu daaz na'o tipotse daatsitute, bish de'er hanok de'ewoore. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Konuwor ‹Eegishe it bitsiri› err iti bíatiyale, ‹Doonzosh b́ geyitsotsne› err aaniwere.»<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Woshetswotsuwere boame jam keewo arikon Iyesus ettsok'o wotat bi'ere bodaatsi. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Dazna'ono bobitsfere doonzwots «Eegishe it bitsiri?» boosh bo eti. <verse eid="LUK 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Bowere «Doonzosh b́ geyitsotsne» bo et. <verse eid="LUK 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Dazna'onowere Iyesus maants dek't bowá, bo tahono daazna'o jik' abaats k'awudek't Iyesus b́betwok'o bo k'ali. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Iyesus bíamfere ashuwots boshemo weridats bo es'iri.<verse eid="LUK 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Iyesus Iyerusalem kitots bodosh b́t'infere Debrezeyit guratse dashan oot'oke b́befere, manoor b́ shutsats sha'iru ashjametswots bo bek'ts adits keewwotsatse tuwtson bogeneútsosh bo k'aro eensh dekt Ik'o udo dek't botwi. <verse eid="LUK 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Dub. 118:26</ref> </char></note> Hank'owa bo etiri boteshi, «Doonzo shútson weetu naasho deereke! jeeno darotse, mango Ik'osh daaratse wotowa!»<verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Ash dagotse teshts ferisawino eteef ik ikuwotsmo Iyesussh «Danifono! n danifuwotsi s'k bo eteetuwok'o woshuwe!» bo et. <verse eid="LUK 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Iyesuswere «Bo dab s'k boetalor shútsuwotswor kuhituno etiruwe itsha» ett bíaaniy.<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Iyerusalemsh bíeptsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Iyesus Iyerusalem kito maants t'int, kitu b́ bek'tsok'on, bish bíepi. <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>Hank'owo bí et, «Nee n jeenosh geyit keewo hambets danfnee woterake! Andmó keewu han niawatse ashwutsere, <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>N balangaruwots neen gúride kas'o kac'de neen gúrde'er bokic'it aawo weetuwe. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Neenat n gitsotse fa'a n na'uwotsi datsats dikde t'afituno, b́ gaherawon orituwo dab ik shútsonor bbeyoke neesh k'azeratse, han b́ wotituwere, Ik'o neen kashiwosh b́waats dúro n dartsoshe.»<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Ik' mootse jaakirwosti b́kishtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat. 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mar. 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:12-22">Yoh. 2:12-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Iyesus Ik' k'oni moots kindt, manoke jaakiru ashuwotsi gisho dek't b́tuwi, <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa. 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Erm. 7:11</ref> </char></note> Hank'owere boosh bíet, « ‹T moo Ik' k'oni mee b́ wotiti› ett guut'ere, itmó bik'tsuwotssh gemee it woshk'ri.»<verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:47 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LUK 21:37">Luk'. 21:37</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesus aaw aawon Ik' mootsna b́ danifo, kahni naashwots, Muse nemo danifuwots, ash jiishiru k'oshuwots bín ud'osha bogefo. <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Ernmó ash jamó Iyesusi k'ebosh geeyat bo nibo imk'rk boteshtsotse bín úd'osh geyiru jirwots eegor k'alosh falratsno.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus kon alon b́finiruwok'o bín aatetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat. 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mar. 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Ik aawu Iyesus Ik'i mootse daatseyat ash ashosh doo shishiyo b́ keewufere kahni naashwotsna, Muse nemo danifuwotsnat eenashuwotswere bíyok bo weyi, <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>Bowere «Aab noosh keewwe, keewanotsi kon alon nfiniruwok'ona?» ett bo aati. <verse eid="LUK 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Iyesuswere hank'wa boosh bíet, «Taawere ik keewu iti aatuna, eshe aab taash aaniwere, <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>Yohans gupo Ik'okike himó ashokike?»<verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Bowere hank'o ett bo atsatseyo bo keewe, « ‹Ik'okike no› etala, ‹Beree eegishe bín amano it k'azi› etetuwe nosha, <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>‹Ashokike› no etalmó ash jamo Yohansi nebiyi b́woto bo amantsotse shutsone noon bo togeti.» <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Mannsh «Aawokik b́ woto danatsone» ett bo aaniy. <verse eid="LUK 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Iyesuswere, «Beree taawor kon alon keewanotsi t finiruwok'o itsh keewuratse» bí eti.<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Weyini mitonat goshtsuwotsn ariyetso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat. 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mar. 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:1">Isa. 5:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Manats dabt Iyesus ariyetsan ash ashosh keewo dek't b́ tuu, ash iko weyini mito b́toki, goshtsuwotssh krayik'rat k'osh datso k'az bíami, bí anerawono ayo b́ja'i. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Woyiniyo b́shutsok'on weyiniman doonz b́ shuwotse b́bano bísh de'e b́weyish guuts iko goshtsuwotsok b́woshi, goshtsuwotsmo togdek't kishibashon faksh bok'ri. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Mank'o ando k'osh guutso b́ woshere bínor tog boishí, ketidek't kishibashon damibok'ri. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Ando aani keezl guutso b́woshere manowere togdek't gaawit kishdek't juubok'ri. <verse eid="LUK 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>Maniye hakonowere weyiniyo doonz «Eshe awuk'o k'alutak'una? T shuntso t naayi woshona, daneraka bín mangiyo k'ayatsne,» bíet. <verse eid="LUK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Ernmó goshtsuwots bín bobek'tsok'on bo atsatsewo hank'o bo eti, Eshe naatetuwo haniye, woore úd'k'rone! b́ datso nok wotituwe! <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Mansh b́ naayi woyniyi maniyre úratse kish dek't boúd'i. Eshe and weyiniman doonz goshtsmanotsi awuk'o boon b́k'alituwok'o arefa itsha? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>Weyni doonzo b́tokone b́ weti, goshtsuwotsnowere úd'nib́ishit, weyni mitmanowere k'osh goshtsuwotssh imk'rituwe. ashuwotswere man boshishtsok'on «Hanwo b́jamon wotk'aye» boeti.<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Dub. 118:22</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesusmo bo maants s'iilfetst hank'o bí et,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">«Eshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">‹Gmbi agfwots gac'ts shútso shúts kup'o shútswotsi tungúshatse kaatsde detsetwo wotb́gutsi›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 20:17">ett guut'etso eege b́kitsiri. <verse eid="LUK 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>Shúts manats dihitu jamo tishitwe, shútsman bíats b́dihitu ashonmo t'ars'etwe.»<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ereer dashi jangosh t'intsets aato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat. 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mar. 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Muse nemo danifuwotsnat kahni naashwotsn ariyets keewuman boatsats b́ keewtsok'owo dank'rat manoor bín deshdek'osh geyatni botesh, ernmó ash asho shatbowtsi. <verse eid="LUK 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Mansh Iyesusi ash aalts aawots detsosh kotbodek'i. Naasho alonat bíats angshetuwok'o betsit nooni dáro bíatse datsosha bogefoni, mansh ash sheeng araarr b́ keewiru keewo mec'it ashuwotsi woshbok'ri. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Keew mec'it ashuwots Iyesus maants t'int, hank'o ett bín boaati, «Danifono! nee n keewiruwonat n daniyruwon ar b́wottsok'o danfone, Ik'i weero arikone ndaniyiri bako konshor bogabogshratsne. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Ab noosh keewwe! no nemok'on Rom nugúsosh ereer dasho wotitwamo woteratsa?»<verse eid="LUK 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Iyesusmó bo gondon bok'od'iruwok'o dank'rat boosh hank'o bí et, <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>«Aab́ ambarmani taash kitsuwere, ambarmanats gedets aronat shútson konke?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Bowere «Rom nugúsoke» boeti.<verse eid="LUK 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Iyesuswere, «Eshe naashi naashoko naashi naashosh, Ik'oko Ik'osh imere» bíet.<verse eid="LUK 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Bowere ash ash shinatse b́keewuts keewon bín detso falratsno, mansh boosh bíaniyor adt s'k etbowtsi.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">K'irtsuwots k'iro da'ar botuwi jango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat. 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mar. 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:27 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:8">Wosh. 23:8</ref> </char>
    </note> «K'irtsuwots tuuratsno» etef Seduk'awiyots Iyesusok t'int hank'o ett bo aati, <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Iwi. 25:5</ref> </char></note> «Danifonó! Muse hank'o ett noosh guut're, ‹Ash iko b́máátsu atse na'o b́ shurawo k'iron b́k'aleyal bí eshu máátsmani de'er bí eshush shaato shegrshwee.› <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Shawat eshuwwots fa'ano boteshi, jametsuwotsitsi k'aabo máátso dek't na'o b́ shurawo k'irb́wutsi. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>B́ shutsonuwere máátsmani b́ dek'i. <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>Keezlonuwere bin b́dek'i, mank'oon shawat wotsuwere bin dek't na'o boshurawo k'irbowtsi. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Jametsuwotsiyere il máátsman k'irbwutsi. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Shawatetsuwots taron bin máátso bodek'tsotse eshe k'irtsuwots bo tuwots ááwushe ááwushe mááts b wotiti?»<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Iyesuswere hank'o ett boosh bíaaniy, «Datsatsi ashuwots máátso dek'etunó, de'etuno, <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>k'irtsuwotsitse tuur, weet dúron beet ashuwotsmó, máátso de'atsno, de'eratsno. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Ik'i melakiwotskok'o bowotituwotse k'irratsno, k'irotsno bo tutsotsnowere Ik'o nana'úwotsye. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:37 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Kesh. 3:6</ref> </char></note> K'irtsuwots tuwi jangoshmo, Muse buush tawi jango b́keewu taarikiyotse, Doonzone ‹Abrahamko Izar Izewer, Isak'ko Izar Izeweri, Yok'obko Izar Izeweri› ett bín s'eegree. <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Manshe Ik'oniye kashetswotsko Izar Izeweri bakro Izar Izewer k'irtsuwotskaliye, jametsuwots bísh kashon beetúne.»<verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Muse nem danifuwotsitse ik ikuots «Danifono! sheenge n keewi!» boet. <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Maniyere hakon aawo shu'ude Iyesusi aatosh falituwo boyitse konwor aaliye.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mesiyo jangosh t'intsets aato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat. 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mar. 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Maniye hakon Iyesus hank'oa boosh bíet, «Aak'oneya Krstos Dawit naayiye boetiri? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42-43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42-43"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:42-43 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Dub. 110:1</ref> </char></note> Dawit b́ tookon duubi mas'aafotse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42-43">‹Doonzo t doonzsh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42-43">N t'alatuwotsi n tufi shirots neesh t gerfetsosh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42-43">T k'ani aaromants beewe bíeti› etfe.<verse eid="LUK 20:42-43"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>Eshe Dawit b́tookon doonza ett b́ s'eegiyakon bere Krstos Dawitsh aawuk'oneya b́ naay woto b́faliti?»<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Muse nemo danifuwotsatse atso korde'ere bí'ettsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Ash jamo b́ shishfere Iyesus b́ danifuwotssh hank'owa bíet, <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>«Tahi geenz geenzo karde'er hake bako sha'o, gawuyotsno mangiyets jamo dek'o, Ik' k'oni mootse mangiyets jorwotsi, jiwoknowere mangts beyoko shunf Muse nem danifuwotsatse it atso kordere. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Bowere be'ewosh bot'intsiru geenz wotts Ik' k'onats webdek't bokenih k'irts maatsuwotsi botes'iri, manshe iki gond keewe boon kotiri.»<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s">T'owu máátsu imts imo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mar. 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Iyesus dambaan kawdek't b́s'ilfere gaaletswots bo imiruo [mebo] ms'watiy dek'eyiru sat'nots bo gedfere bek' b́k'r. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>Mank'o t'owu mááts iku, git santimu wotit gizo sat'nots b ged'fere bek' b́k'ri. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>Hank'owere bíet, «Ariko itsh keewiruwe, t'owmáátsan jametsoniyere bogsh dek'at imranee. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Bo boimye bogalotse oortsoniye, bimo t'owu wotefetsatniye eegor b ooride'awon b detsts jamo imranee.»<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik' moo b́gahituwok'o bek'on Iyesus b́keewtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat. 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mar. 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Ash ik ikuwots, «Ik'i maa han awuk'owe b́sheengi? Gizi shaawo kishit mang shútsuwotsnat Ik'osh t'ints sheeng keewone baats b́wutsi» et fetst bo keeweyiri b́ teshi. <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>Ernmó Iyesus «It bek'iru jaman shútso shútsats kororeyar b́oorawu dúro weetuwe, shúts jamanots ik aawu gaahitune.»<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Bowere «Danifono! man b́wotit awure? Hanuwere wotosh b́t'intsok'o eegi milktoneya nodaneti?» ett boaati.<verse eid="LUK 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Doonzo wooniyere shinon weet gisheyonat gond bek'on</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat. 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mar. 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Iyesus hank'o ett boosh bíaaniy, «It shelawok'o it atso korde'ere! ayuwots ‹Taa Krstos taane! hambe! bíaawo t'inre!› err t shutson weetune, bo shuutso sha'ak'ayere. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Kes'i jangonat dimbiron it shishor tek' k'ayere, shinshino man b́woto geyife, ernmó b́s'uwo manoor woteratse.»<verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Manats dabt Iyesus hank'owa bíet, «Ash asho ashaashats, naasho naashats tuwitwee. <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>B́ be beewoke kup' wotts dats shek'ewo, k'ak'onat maryi shodon wotituwe. Shatit keewuwotsnat mlikit een eenuwotsn darotse be'etúne. <verse eid="LUK 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>Ernmó jaman b́ woteftsere shino ash ashuwots itn detsetúno, gishitúno, ayhudi Ik' k'oni moonat tipi mootso beshide iti imetuno, t shútsi jangosho itn naash naashonat altswotsok de'e ametunee. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Hanuwere t shútsi jango gawosh itsh iki sheeng b́wutsiti. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14-15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 12:11-12">Luk'. 12:11-12</ref> </char></note> Mansh itats bodet s'amiyewor it aanit keewosh it kic'erawok'o shino t'iwints de'ere. <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>It balangaruwotsitse konuwor falr k'efo b́ bayaw nononat dani telefo taa itsh imetuwe. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Iti ind nihuwtsnat it eshuwots, it jaguwotsnat it tohuwotswor bo oorerawo iti beshider imetune, itiste ik ikuwotsi úd'etuwe. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>T shútsi jangosh ash jami shinatse shit'eek wotitute. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Ernmó it took s'iratse ik s'iru dab t'afratsane. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>It k'amon it kashu kashidek'etute» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Iyerusalem b́t'afituwok'o shino b́keewutsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat. 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mar. 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>Manats dabt Iyesus hank'owa bíet, «Iyerusalem t'alaton gúrde bobefre it bek'or b t'afo b́ bodtsok'o dande'ere, <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Manoor Yihud datsatse fa'uwots guromants woc'no, kitutse fa'uwots biitse keeno, kituniyere úratse fa'uwots kitumand kind k'ayno. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 9:7">Hos. 9:7</ref> </char></note> T'afan jangosh guut'etso shin bek'on keewetso b́ wotituwok'o hanweer wershikonat fayi dúrone. <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Manots, na'i mac'uwotsnat s'aats ishiru na'i induwotssh indowe boosha! datsatse kic'i gondo wotituwe, ash manotsatse Ik'i fayo weetuwe. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Boyitsnowere ayuwots shik goradon úd'etuno, katsuwotsuwere kisho imr dats datsats dametuno, Ik'i ash woterawwots dúro b́ s'uufetsosh Iyerusalem Ik'i ash woterawwotsn net'etk wotitwaniye.»<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ash na'ono aani b́weyi jango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat. 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mar. 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa. 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Hzk'. 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:31">Iyu. 2:31</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12-13">Bek'. 6:12-13</ref> </char>
    </note> Manats dabt Iyesus hank'o bíeti, «Aawonat aashitson, k'enuwotsatsnoor adits milikituwots be'etúno, datsatsnowere ash jamwots aats k'aronat b́ jongo tek'iyiru k'aratse tuutson sharr kic'ituno. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Datsats weet keewo kotoke ashuwots shatoon k'ewitúnee, manoor daritsi angwots shek'etúno, <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan. 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Bek'. 1:7</ref> </char></note> Maniye hakon Ash na'o angi eenonat dawunots wotde'er b́waafere ashuwots bek'etúno. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Jamanots woto de'e botuwor it kashit aawo b́ bodtsotse dambaan kaaw de'er s'iilere.»<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Doonzo woo kitsit belesi mitú ariyetso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat. 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:26-31">Mar. 13:26-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Manats dabt Iyesus jewurets keewuman boosh b́ keewu, «Belesi mitonat k'osh mituwotsi t'intsde s'iilere, <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Bo maaro ato de'e b́tuwo it bek'tsok'on k'aawo b́ t'intsok'o danfte. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Mank'oon jaman woto de b́tuwo it bek'or Ik'i mengsto wosh b́karntsok'owo dande'ere.<verse eid="LUK 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>«Ariko itsh keewirwe, jaman b́ s'eenfetso and dúri s'oot'an besheratse. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Daronat datson beshitune, t keewonmo besheratse.»<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kup'de'er koti jango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>Manats dabt Iyesus hank'o b́ et «Móónat úshi ayon, mashon, ay finon maawonat datsatsi beyosh kic'on it nibo ay b́ maawrawok'o it atso korde'ere! Maniye okoon aawuman kambok'o gawerawon iti deshdek'etwe. <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>Manots aawuman datsatse daatset ash jamwotsi gawerawo kambok'o deshdek'etwe. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Mansh, weet gond keewu jamatse oorosh ango it daatsituwok'o aani Ash Na'o shinatse ned'osh it falituwok'o jam aawo Ik' k'onoke kup'ore.»<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:37 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk'. 19:47</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesus aaw aawon Ik'i mootse b́ daniyfo, datso b́ ilor Debrezeyit gurats kede b́ k'eefoni. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Ash jamo Iyesusi k'ebosh guuron Ik'i mootsere b́ maants bo amfoni.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesusats malets malo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat. 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar. 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoh. 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Kesh. 12:1-27</ref> </char>
    </note> Faziga eteets tush meyi bali ááwo mangiyef aawo t'inre b́tesh, <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>K'eesi naashuwots naet Muse nemo danifuwots ash asho boshattsosh Iyesusi deshde boud'it malo ááshon bogeyiri botesh.<verse eid="LUK 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yhud Iyesusi beshide imosh b́shiyetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat. 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mar. 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Manoor b́ woshtswots tatse gituwotsitse iko Kiriyot dats asho Yihud atsots Shed'ano kindbwuts. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Mansh Yihud kahniwotsnat Ik'i maa kotfuwotsi jishfok amt Iyesusi awuk'o k'alr boosh beshide b́ imetwok'o bonton b́ keeweyi. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Bowere keewmansh gene'uwat gizo bísh imosh keewe bowuts. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Bo keewets wulimańnowere wotowe ett ash asho b́ danawo Iyesusi beshi de'er imosh k'anit aawo b́geyiri.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Maniye hakon fazigi mereero shukeet tush beno meyi Ik' aawo bod b́guuts. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Iyesus «Fazigi kooc' misho nometwok'o amr k'aniwere» ett P'et'rosnat Yohansn woshbk'r.<verse eid="LUK 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Bowere «Fazigi kooc' misho aawoke no k'aniyetwok'owe n geyi?» ett bínboaati.<verse eid="LUK 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Bíwere boosh hankowa bíet, «Kituts it kindor aats kitef koro kuriru asho daatsitute, b́ shuutso shoyde b́ kindit moots ameree. <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>Moo doonzsh, noon danifo ‹T danifuwotsnton fazigi kooc' misho t metuwoko ibi kashef moo aawoke? etfe› erere bísha. <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>Bíwere dadirotse fa'a es'dek't k'aniyets maa gawuno itsh kitsituwe, manoke k'aniwere.» <verse eid="LUK 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>B́ danifuwots amt, jam keewo Iyesus ettsok'o wotat b́datseyi, fazigi baaliyo noowere manoke bok'aniyi.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'ayin meekewo jango b́ned'itsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat. 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mar. 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 K'or. 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Kooc'misho b́ bodtsok'on Iyesus b́ woshtswotsnton mishi marats beeb́dek'i. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Hank'owa boosh biet, «Godbek'o tiats b́ bodftsere shino itnton fazigi koc'mishan moosh ayidek'atni t tewunfoni b́ teshi. <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Keewan Ik'i mengstotse arik wotar bbe'efetsosh haniye hakon Fazigi koc'mishan b́ jamon maratse etiruwe itsha?»<verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Maniye hakoń Iyesus úshi wanc'o k'aau dek't Ik'o b́ údiyakon hank'o biet, «Nayere han kayde'ere, <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>arikon itsh keewiruwe andon de'etuwr Ik'i mengstu bwafetsosh weyini shuwanatse daatsets usho uyatse.»<verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Iyesus manats dabt misho k'audek't Ik'o b́ údiyakon, b́ danifuwotssh «Nayere, han itsh imetuwo tmetsoniye, han taan gawosh woshde'ere» ett bí im. <verse eid="LUK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Erm. 31:31-34</ref> </char></note> Mank'o koc'mishoniye okoon ushi wanc'o k'aaúdek't imt boosh hank'o bíet, «Ushe wanc'an it jangosh kud'itwo t s'atsoniye bíats ned'iyet handr taaroniye.<verse eid="LUK 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:21 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Dub. 41:9</ref> </char>
    </note> «Ernmo taan beshide imetu asho kisho hamb taanton mishi marotse. <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Ash Na'o b́ jangosh shin keewetsok'on k'irituwe, ernmó Ash Na'o beshide imetu ashmansh indowe bísha!»<verse eid="LUK 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Bowere «Noyitse keewan k'alituwo kone?» ett boatsatsewo moosho dek'botu.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:24 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:1">Mat. 18:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:34">Mar. 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46">Luk'. 9:46</ref> </char>
    </note> Manats dabt bo, «Nounetsitse bogo kone?» ett moosho dek't botuu. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:25-26 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 25:25">Mat. 25:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:42-44">Mar. 10:42-44</ref> </char></note> Iyesusmó hank'o boosh bíeti, «Ik' ash woterawwots naashuwots ash ashaatse alo detsfne, dats keewtswotswere ashosh sheeng k'alfwotsi etetuwe, <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:26 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mat. 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mar. 9:35</ref> </char></note> Itmó bokok'o woto itsh geyiratse, maniyere ititse een wottso b́ beyal muk' wotowa, jishtsi wottso guutsok'o wotowe. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:27 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 13:12-15">Yoh. 13:12-15</ref> </char></note> Mishimarats bedek't meyiruwonat need'dek't manziruwotse awune enoni? Eena eteefoni mishi maratse bedek'tsoniyoshna? Taamó it dagotse guutsok'o taane. <verse eid="LUK 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>It taa gondo tbek'or jamon taanton kup'atniye it teshi. <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>Mansh t nih taan b́ naashitsok'o taawere it naashituwe. <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:30 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mat. 19:28</ref> </char></note> T mengstotse mishi maratse bede'er meetute, úshetute, naashi jooratse bede Isra'el naar tatse gituwotsats angshitute.»<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusi P'et'ros bíhalitwok'o shino b́keewtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat. 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar. 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoh. 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>Manats dabt Iyesus hank'o bíet, «Smonoo! Smonoo! hmb, goshtso b́ sndeyi buyo as'de b́ galfook'o Shed'ano iti as'baze b́geyi. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Ernmó ni imnetiyo b́ t'afrawok'o taa neesh Ik'o k'onituwe, ando aani ni anorowere nieshuwotsi kup'iwe.»<verse eid="LUK 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>P'et'roswere «Doonzono! tip wotowa, k'ir wotowa neenton amoosh k'ank taane!» bíet.<verse eid="LUK 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Iyesusmó aniydek't, «P'et'rosoo! hambets baako b́ k'adfetsere, ‹Neen danatse› err keezoto taan haalitune etfe» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:35 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:9-10">Mat. 10:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-9">Mar. 6:8-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:4">Luk'. 10:4</ref> </char>
    </note> Maniye hakon Iyesus b́ danifuwotssh, «Gizosh k'arc'ito, borso, c'amono it kishatse alo iti t woshor itsh shaptso fa'a b́teshi?» boosh bí et.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Bowere «Eegor noosh shapts keewo aaliye» ett bísh boaaniy. <verse eid="LUK 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Iyesuswere boosh aaniy hank'owa biet, «Andmó gizo, borsono detstso, k'aau de'e, shiki gorado deshawonwere b́ taho kemr shiki gorado kewude'e <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa. 53:12</ref> </char></note> T jangosh shin guut'ets jamo fin isho bgeyitsotse ‹Gondwotsnton taawere› etiruwo S'ayin mes'afotsi keewo ti atse wot b́ s'uwo geyife etre itsha.»<verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>B́ danifuwotswere «Doonzono! hamb git shiki goraduwots fa'ane!» bo eti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Bíwere «bodfne!» boosh bíet.<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Debre zeyit guratse Ik'o b́k'ontsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat. 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar. 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Iyesus kitutse kesht b́ doyok'o Debrezeyit guromants bíami, b́ danifuwotsuwere bínton boam. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Manok bobodtsok'on Iyesus, «Fadeyots it kindrawok'o Ik'o k'onuwere» bí eti.<verse eid="LUK 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Maniyehakon shúts sha'ubetsok'o boatse wokdek't bíam, tuk'mal dek't hank'o ett Ik'o b́k'on, <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>«Nihono! nshunka wotiyale tiats bodosh etiru kic'i wanc'an tiatse wokiwe, ernmó nee niettsok'owabako taa tiettsok'o wotk'aye.» <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Manoor bin kupiit melakiyo darotse waat́ bíats be'e b́wutsi. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>B́ nibotsnowere ayidek't kic'efetst kup'idek't Ik'o b́k'oniri b́teshi, b́s'azonuwere s'atsok'o wotat datsatsa b́s'oriri b́tesh.<verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Ik' b́ k'onirwoke tuut b́ danifuwotsok b́waa, ayi dek't boshiyantsatse tuutson nefat k'eewutsat bobefere wadatst boosh hank'o bíet, <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>«Eegishe it k'eyiri? Maniyere fadeyots itkindrawok'o tuur Ik'o k'onuwere.»<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusi beshidek't imi jangonat b́detsewon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat. 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar. 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yoh. 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Iyesus man keewoke b́befere, ay ashuwots waa bokesh, boon jishiruwonuwere tatse gituwotsits wottso iko Yihudi b́tesh, Yhud bín jobosh b́ maants t'nb́dek'. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Iyesusmó «Age Yhudo! Ash Na'o jobon beshide imisheya?»<verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Iyesusnton teshts b́danifuwots keewuan b́ wottsok'o bobek'tsok'on «Doonzono! shiki goradon jod'onowa?» bo et. <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Boyitsnowere iko kahni naasho guutso shiki goradon k'es'dek't b́k'ani waazo k'ut'b́k'r.<verse eid="LUK 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Iyesusmo «K'aye! hank'o keewo aani k'alk'aye!» bí et, Asho wazonowere shu'udek't kashi b́k'ri.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Maniye hakon Iyesus bin detsosh waats k'eesi naashuwotsi, Ik' maa kotfuwotsatsi altsuwotsnat ashitsi eenashuwotsnsh hank'o bí et «Taan wombedewok'o detsoshe shiki goradonat gumbo dek'atniya it weyiri? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:53 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk'. 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref> </char></note> Aawu aawon itnton Ik' mootse t daatsewor taan t teshor, andmo it aawonat t'aluwotse altsosho bo ááwe.»<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'et'ros Iyesusi bíhaltsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat. 26:57-58</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mar. 14:53-54</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yoh. 18:12-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Maniye hakon ash ashuwots Iyesusi detsdek't k'eesi naasho mook dek't bowaa, P'et'rosuwere wokoon b́shuutso b́ shi'iri. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Ash ashuwots kas'otse tawo deshidek't ikoke bedek'tni botesh. P'et'oswere waat towat be b́dek'i. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>P'et'ros tawu ganok b́befere gon iku tawu shanatse bek'bk'ri, b́ maants t'iwintsdek' s'iilat «Hanwor Iyesusntoni b́teshi!» bi et. <verse eid="LUK 22:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>P'et'rosmó, «Nee ashune! taa bín danatse!» jamere bí et. <verse eid="LUK 22:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Muk'i tesht k'osh ash iko P'et'rosi bek't «Neewor boyitsi iko neene!» bí et.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">P'et'rosmó «Ashono neena! taanaliye!» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Ik sa'atok'o tesht k'osh ash iko P'et'rossh «Ashaahan Gelil dats ash b́wottsotse arikon bíntoniye b́teshiye!» ett kup'idek't b́ keewi. <verse eid="LUK 22:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>P'et'rosmó, «Ashono neena! ni etiruman danatse!» bí et. Man keewoke b́befere manoor baako b́ k'adi. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Manoor doonzo Iyesus wongr ett P'et'rosi b́ s'iil, P'et'roswere «Hambets bako keezoto b́k'adfetsosh taan danatse er haalitune» ett doonzo Iyesus b́ keewutso gawubdek'i. <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Urats kesht ayidek't bí eep.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́togetsok'onat b́gac'etsok'on</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat. 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mar. 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Manoor Iyesusi detsdek't teshts ashuwots bíyats trgic'o kashfetst bín botogiri. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>B́ shitsonowere p'urifetst, «Kone neen togtsoni? Nebiyi nwotiyal aab dane?» boetfera botesh. <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Bíats ay keewo keewufets bín boc'ashiri botesh.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus moosh moosheyiru jebok dek't ametsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat. 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mar. 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yoh. 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Gatsb́wutstsok'on dats naashuwots, kahni naashuwots, Muse nemo danifuwots ikok kakuwebogutsi, Iyesusnowere jebats dek'bowa. <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>Hank'o ett bísh bokeewu «Ab nee Krstos neena wotiyal noosh keewwe,» Biimo boosh hank'owa bíet, «Itsh t keewiyalo taan amaneratstere, <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>Iti tiatiyalo taash aniratsteree, <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Ernmó haniyehakon Ash na'o kup' Ik'o k'ani aaromand bedek'etuwe.» <verse eid="LUK 22:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Jametswots Ik wotdek't «Eshe nee Ik'o naay neeneya?» et bo aati. <verse eid="LUK 22:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Bowere «Eshe eeg gawe noosh b́ geyiti? Hamb b́ nonatse keshtso no notokon shishrone!» bo et.<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesusi P'ilat'osok dek't ametsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat. 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar. 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoh. 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Maniye hakon manoke kakuwedek't beyiru ash ashuwots dek' amt P'ilat'os shinats t'intsbok'ri, <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Hank'o ettnwere bín s'aamiyo dek' botuwi, «Ashaan no ashuwotsi b́shelifere daatsrone, Rom nugúsoshowere ereero dasherawok'o bazife, ando ‹Taahe nuguso Krstos taane› ettniye b́ keewiri.»<verse eid="LUK 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>P'ilat'oswere «Ayhudiwots naasho neeneya?» ett Iyesusi bíaati.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Iyesuswere «Nee niettsok'oyiye» bí eti.<verse eid="LUK 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Manoor P'ilat'os kahani naashuwotsnat ash ashosh «Ashaanatse eegor t'afiyo daatsratse» bí et.<verse eid="LUK 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Boomó «Ashaan Geliln b́detstso hanok b́borfetsosh, Yihud dats jamatse daniyfetst ash asho boatsatseyo bofayetuwok'o b́ woshiri» etfetst kup'shdek't bos'aamiyi.<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Herodis shinats b́t'intsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>P'ilat'os Gelili eteets shútsman b́ shishtsok'on, «Ashaan Gelil dats asheya?» ett bíaat. <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Iyesus b́ waa Herodis alts datsatse b́ waatsok'o b́ dantsok'on Herodisok damibk'ri, Herodisuwere manoor Iyerusalemitsa b́tesh. <verse eid="LUK 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Herodisuwere Iyesusi b́bek'tsok'on ayidek't gene'úb́guts, Iyesus jango b́shishtsotse bín bek'ono ayoto tewuntni b́teshi, mank'o Iyesus adits finuwotsno b́ finefere bek'oshor b́geefotsna. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Mansh Herodis Iyesusi ay keewo bíaat, Iyesusmó bísh eegor aaniratse. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Kahni naashuwotsnat Muse nemo danifuwots manoke need'dek't kup'idek't bín bos'aamiri. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Herodis b́ jirwotsnton bíats trgic'o b́ kaash, tahi sheengonowere bíats takdek't P'ilat'osok aani dek't damib́k'r. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Herodisnat P'ilat'osn maniye shin balngar teshtswots manots aawots jagebowutsi.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusats k'iro angshetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat. 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mar. 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yoh. 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Maniye hakon P'ilat'os k'eesi naashuwotsi, ash jishfuwotsnat ashuwotsi dabdek't iknon b́ s'eegi, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>Hank'owere boosh bí et, « ‹Ashuwotsi bo fayetuwok'o b́ tuuziri› etaat ashaan t maants dek'at it weyi, taawere hamb it shinatse aatat tiere it etts jam weeron ashaanatse ik t'afiyonor daatsratse. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Mank'owere Herodiswor bíatse b́ t'afitso ikonor b́ t'ut'tsotse nomand aani dek't doyik'rere, eshe ashaanatse k'irosh bín betsit keewo ikonor bíatse daatsratse. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Manshe garafarniye bín faksh t k'ritiye.» <verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>[Dúre dúron Fazigi bali aawots P'ilat'os tipitsi ashuwotsitse iko ashuwotssh b́ fakshfotsna.]<verse eid="LUK 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Mansh ash jamo «Ashaan no ááwatse ok t'afiwe! Berbannmo biishde fakshk'rowe noosha!» et fetst ik k'aaron bokuhi. <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Berban kitutse dimbro tuuzt ashono ud't manatse tuutson tip moots tipek asha b́tesh.<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>P'ilat'os Iyesusi bíshde faksho geyat́ aani ash ashuwotssh b́keewu. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Ashuwotsmo «Bín jirk'rowe! jirk'rowe bína!» ett bokuhi.<verse eid="LUK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>P'ilat'osuwere keezlo boosh hank'o bíet, «Ashaan b́ t'afitso b́jamon eebi? Taa k'irosh bín betsit keewo eegor bí atse datsratsere, manshe garafarni faksh tk'riti.»<verse eid="LUK 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Boomó bok'aaro eenshdek't «Jiir k'rowe bína!» ett bokuhi, ashuwotsnat k'eesi naashuwots k'aaro ayidek't enbgutsi. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Manatse tuutson bo aattso boosh k'aletuwok'o P'ilat'os angsh b́k'r. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Galotse asho beezo bazt ando asho úd't bíere tipt teshetso Berbani bo aattsok'on fakshb́k'ri, Iyesusnmo boshuntsok'on boosh beshidek't imb́k'r.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusi jitetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat. 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar. 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:17-27">Yoh. 1:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Mann Iyesusi dek't boami, dek't boamfere K'erena eteets datsi ash wottso Simoni gat'ariyon kito maants b́kindfere dats bodek'i, bín detsdek't mask'aliyo Iyesusko kuridek't Iyesus shuutso shoyde b́shaituwok'o bo k'ali.<verse eid="LUK 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Ay ashonwere Iyesus shutsats shoydektni boamir bítesh, bodagotsno bo gero jot'fetst eepiru maats maatsuwots fa'ano. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Iyesusmó bomaand wongr ett hank'o boosh bíet, «It Iyerusalem dats máátsuwotso! it tokonat it na'osh efere bako taash eepk'ayere! <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>‹Mahan wotts máátsuwots, shurawu maac'wotsnat s'aatsrawu s'atsuwots awuk'o derekno!› eteet aawwots weetúnee. <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hos. 10:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:16">Bek'. 6:16</ref> </char></note> Manoor ash ashuwots gúrwotssh, ‹No abaats grshore!› guri teuwotsshowere ‹Noon atsuwore!› eto deebotuwiti. <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Miti motsats hank'o keewu jaman k'aletka wotiyal eshe miti shuk'onmo awuk'owek'uwa k'aleti?» <verse eid="LUK 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Mank'owere gond finets git ashuwotsi Iyesusnton úd'osh dek't boami. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Took k'ola wee K'araniyo eteef beyokok bobodtsokon manoke Iyesusi jitbok'ri, mank'o gond finets ash gitwotsi iko Iyesus giromaants iko b́ k'anomaants jitbok'ri. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Dub. 22:18</ref> </char></note> Maniyehakon Iyesus, «T niho! bo k'aliruwo bodanawotse boosh orowa eree!» bíet. Kes' kes'fuwotsu Iyesus tahats it'o oorsht kaybodek'i.<verse eid="LUK 23:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:35 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:7">Dub. 22:7</ref> </char>
    </note> Ash ashonwere need'dek'tni bos'iliri botesh, Ayhudi naashuwots uwere «K'oshuwotsnoó worire and eshe bí Ik'i futtso Ik'o b́tokosh marat'bdek'tsoni wotiyal aab b́ tooko woriwe!» etfetst́ bíts bokaashi. <verse eid="LUK 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:36 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Dub. 69:21</ref> </char></note> Kes' kes'fuwotswere mank'o bíatsa bokashfera botesh, b́maand t'int bíro ayidek't shashtso boimi. <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>Bowor mank'o «Nee arikon ayhudiwotsko naasho nana wotiyal aab n tooko woride'e!» boetiri.<verse eid="LUK 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>«Ayhudiwotsko naasho haniye» ett guut'etso Iyesus jitetsi k'oyats gedbok'ri.<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusnton jitets gond finets git ashuwots</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:38-44">Mat. 27:38-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:27-32">Mar. 15:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Iyesusnton jitets gond finetsuwotsitse iko, Iyesussh, «Nee mesihiyo nenoshna? Aab eshe n tokonat noon woriwe!» ett bín b́ c'ashfera b́tesh.<verse eid="LUK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Boyitse ikonmó bín hank'o ettni b́fay, «Neewor bíki naari angshotse bedek'at Ik'o sharatsiya? <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Noo nofints morratse tuutso noosh wotit fayo daatsrone, ashaanmó eegonor t'afiyo deshatse.» <verse eid="LUK 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Manats dabt Iyesussh, «Doonzono! n mengstots n woor taan batk'aye.» bíet.<verse eid="LUK 23:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Iyesuswere «Ariko neesh keewiruwe, hambets taanton genetotse daatsetune» bíet.<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus k'iro</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat. 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar. 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoh. 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Man b́wotuwe aaw shrt sa'atok'ona b́tesh, manortson tuut jed'iy sa'ato b́borfetsosh datsjamatse t'alu wotb́gutsi. <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:45 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Kesh. 26:31-33</ref> </char></note> Aawo t'aluwu b́wutsi, Ik'i meyitsi magarajo taalotse dek't tuut gaad'at gitoko kayb́gutsi. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:46 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 31:5">Dub. 31:5</ref> </char></note> Iyesuswere b́k'aaro eenshdek't, «Nihono! hambiye! tkashu nkishats beshidek'at adaro imiruwe!» bí et, man bíettsok'on b́ kasho bíatsotse k'azb́kesh.<verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Manoke teshts bali naash wottso, wotts man b́bek'tsok'on «Arikon ashaan kááwe b́teshi!» ett Ik'o b́ mangiy.<verse eid="LUK 23:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Wotit keewo s'ilosh manoke kakuwedek't teshts ash jamo wotts keewuman bobek'tsok'on bo gero k'is'fere bo galomand k'azboaani. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:49 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 8:2-3">Luk'. 8:2-3</ref> </char></note> Iyesusi karnon dants ash jamwotsnat Galil datsatse tuut b́shutsatse sha'efere waats máátswots wokoon need'dek't keewan bo s'iliri.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́duketsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat. 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar. 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoh. 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Ayhudiwots kitt wotts Armatyasitse befo Yosefi eteef asho fa'e b́tesh, bíwere kaawonat ash sheenga b́tesh, ayhudiwotsitse moosh moshifuwotsitsi ikoni. <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>Wotowa ereo ayhudiwots shiyewonat t malots kindratse b́tesh, bí Ik'i mengsto kotiru asho b́ tesh. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Ashman P'ilat'osok t'int Iyesus duuno bísh b́ imish bíaat. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Dunonowere orshdek't hariya eteef c'ic'i dek't wozets tahon k'odbok'ri, ash k'osho konuwor bíts b́ dukerawu s'alatse k'ewudek't k'aniyets doowots duukb́k'r, <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Man b́k'aluwere kokowots kooc' Sanbatosh k'anoke beyefera b́tesh.<verse eid="LUK 23:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Geliln tuut Iyesus shuutso waats máátswots Yosefnton amt b́ doowo bo s'iili, duunono awuk'o k'aldek' duuktsok'oi bo s'iil. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:56 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:10">Kesh. 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:14">Iwi. 5:14</ref> </char></note> Bogalomandowere aanat duunosh wotit shak' shawu wotts k'memiyonat shituwo k'ani bok'r, bo nemok'on sanbati aawots kashdek't bojin.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus k'irotse b́tuwok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat. 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar. 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoh. 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Mááts máátsuwots bok'anits shituwo dek't torbanotsi shints aawots (sanbat eenots) datsgatson dowomand boami, <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Doowo ipets shútso dowatse okaan kukulwutsat b́befere bodaatsi. <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>B́ gitsots bokindormo doonzo Iyesus duuno daatsratsno. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Keewuman jangatse bok'alituwo dart adoke bobefere aawok'o goliru tah tahdek'ts ash gituwots waa boganok need' boguts. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Mááts máátsuwots ayidek't shatwtsat bo tooko dashan gup'ndek't bobefere ashuwots, «Eegishe kashetso k'irtsuwots dagotse it geyiri? Bosh boet. <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>Bíwo hanoke aaliye, tuure, Gelilin b́teshor itsh b́ keewutso gawude'ere, <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6-7 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mat. 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:18-19">20:18-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mar. 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33-34">10:33-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Luk'. 9:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-33">18:31-33</ref> </char></note> ‹Ashna'o morretsuwotssh beshide imewo, jitewonat keezl aawotsowere k'irotse tuwo bín geyife› etre b́teshi.»<verse eid="LUK 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Mááts máátsuwotswere Iyesus keewuts keewo gawu bodek'i, <verse eid="LUK 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>Doowoknowere aanat jaman tatse ikuwotsnat ortswotsnishowere bo keewu. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Hanowere b́ woshtswotssh keewtsuwots megdela eteets datstsu Mariyamna, Yohannat Yak'ob ind Mariyamna, mank'o mááts k'oshuwotsu fa'ano botesh. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Boomó keewman boosh gúmo bíartsosh boon amaneratsno. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Ernmó P'et'ros tuwut doowo maantsan b́ wos'i, manok b́ bodiyakon túmt b́s'ilor duunats takets duuni taho hariyon wozets taho biyl b́ befere b́ bek', wotts keewu manatse tuutson adfetst b́ moo maants k'az bían.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́danif gituwotssh b́be'etsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mar. 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Manots aawots Iyesus shuutso shaefwotsitse gitetsuwots Iyerusalematse tatse git kilometrok'o wokat fa'u Emahusi err s'eegef galomand bo amiri. <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>Bowere wotts keewu jamman tuzt bo atsatsewo bo keeweyiri botesh. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Manowere bo keewor Iyesus b́ tookon bo maants t'int bonton sha'o dek't b́tuwi. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Eree bo aawon bek'fetst koni b́wottsok'o dano falratsno. <verse eid="LUK 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Bíwere, «Sha'efetsat it keeweyiru keewhan eeb naaroni?» boosh bí et.<verse eid="LUK 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Boyitsi iko K'elyop'i eteefo, «Daganitse Iyerusalemitse k'aleets keewuwotsi danawu ib asho n s'uzneya?» bísh bíet.<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Iyesuswere «Eebi b́ naaroni?» bí et. Bowere hank'o ett bísh boaaniy, «Nazrettso Iyesus atsats bodts keewoni! bí Ik'onat ash jami shinatse keewonat finon kup' wotk Nebiye b́ teshi. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Kahani naashuwotsnat noon jishiruwotsn k'irosh beshi dek't bo imi, bínowere bo jiti. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Noomo ‹Isra'eli fariytwotuwo bíne› etaat no jangirwo bíne b́teshi. Wotowa eree jam keewan b́ wotiyakon hamb keezl aawoniye. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Eree noyitse fa'a mááts máátsuwotsitse ik ikuwots noon adirne, bo hamets guur b́ doowo maants amtni botesh, <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>Ernmó b́ duuno daatsratsno, ‹Iyesus beyar beetke!› etiru melakiwotsi bek'on no bek'iye ett aanat bowaa. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Noyitsnowere ik ikuwots b́ doowo maants amt mááts máátsuwots ettsok'o wotat bíere bodaatsi, Iyesusnmo be'aatsno.»<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Iyesuswere hank'owa boosh bíet, «It t'iwintsrawanotsna et Nebiyiwots keewuts jamo it amaneraok'o it nibo shuutso maants getseyiruwanots! <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Krstos gond bek' jamań de'er b́ mango maants kindo bín geyiyalkeya?» <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Maniyere hakon Musena et Nebiyiwots mas'afatse dek' tuut S'ayin mas'aaf jamotse b́ jangosh keewetso kitsfetst boosh kish b́keewi.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Bo boamiru galok bo t'intsok'on Iyesus beshar ametuwok'o bíari. <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>Boomó, «Datso ilere, aawunuwere iloshe bíetiri, mank'o b́wottsotse noonton hanok k'ewe» ett kup'idek't bín bok'on, mank'o b́wotere bowok k'eyosh bo moots b́kind. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Bonton mishimarts beeb́dek'i, misho k'a'údek't Ik'o b́ údiyakon tiitsdek't boosh b́imi. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Manoor bo aawo k'eshe b́uutsere Iyesusi b́ woto danbok'ri, bímo manoor boawatse ááshb́gutsi. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Bowere boatsatsewosh «weerindatse no sha'efere noosh b́keeworonat S'ayn mas'aafwotsitse kitsfetst noosh b́ keewor no nibotse tawok'o biat'eferoshna b́teshi?» bo atsatsewosh boet.<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Bowere manoor tuut Iyerusalem maants aanat k'azboam, manokno b́ danif tatse ikuwotsi bonton fa'uwotsnton ikn kakuwedek't bo befere daatsbodek'i. <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>Bowere «Doonzo Iyesus arikon k'azturee! Sm'onshowere be'ere!» boetiri.<verse eid="LUK 24:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>B́ daniru gitetsuwots bo tookon weerindatse wotts keewonat doonzo Iyesus misho b́ titsor aawok'o k'alt bodantsok'o bo keewi.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́danifuwotsats b́be'etsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat. 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar. 16:14-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Bowere han keewoke bo befere Iyesus b́ tookon botalots need'dek't, «Jeeno itsh wotowe!» bíet.<verse eid="LUK 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Boomó meyo bobek'tsok'o boosh bíarere tek'at shatoon s'eenbowtsi. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Iyesuswere hank'o boosh bíet, «Eegishe it tek'iri, eegishe it nibotse amano it k'aziri? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Tkishuwotsnat ttufwotsn taan t wotk'o danere, taan shu'ar s'iilere, tiatse it s'iliruwok'o meyo meetsonat mak'tson deshatse.»<verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Hank'o ett b́ tufonat b́ kishon boosh b́ kits, <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Bowere gene'onat aydek't aa'doke bobeyruwotse andoru amanerafa'no bo teash. Iyesuswere «Meetuwo it detstso fa'a?» ett boon bíaat. <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Bowere mus'o mistetsu muk'na'ú bísh boim. <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>Bíwere k'aaú dek't bo shinatse b́maa.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Iyesuswere, «Itnton tteshor Musesh imets nemo, Nebiyiwotsnat t Duubi mas'afatse t jangosh guut'etso jamo s'eeno bin geyituwe etaat itsh tkeewutso haniye» bíet.<verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Maniye hakon s'ayin mas'aafwotsi t'iwintso bofalituwok'o bo nibo boosh k'eshb́k'r. <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>Hank'owo boosh bíet, «Krstos gondo b́bek'etuwok'owonat keezl aawotso Kirotse b́ tuwituwok'o shin guut'ere, <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>Mank'o b́ shútson naadre etonat morrosh orowe eton Iyerusalemiyere tuur dats jamatse ash jamosh b́ nabitwok'o guut'ere. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Itwoor jam keewansh gawu itne, <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:49 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:4">Wosh. 1:4</ref> </char></note> Hambe! taa t nih itsh imetuwe ett b́ jangitso itsh deyitwe, itwere dambe ango tahok'o tah itdek'fetsosh Iyerusalem kitutse betere.»<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus daromaand k'az b́tuutsk'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mar. 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Wosh. 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Maniye hakon Iyesus b́ danifuwotsi Iyerusalem kitutse kishdek't Betaniyi datsats b́ borfetso dek't bíam, manoknowere b́ kisho jargdek't boon b́deeri. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:50-51 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Wosh. 1:9-11</ref> </char></note> Boon deroke b́beyiruok'on boatse k'aleyat daromaand k'az b́tuu. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Bowere bísh bosagadi, geneeúfetst Iyerusalem maants k'az boaani. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Ik'onowere údefetst aawu aawon Ik'i mootse t'ut'uerakne boteshi.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
